English:
Learning to defend yourself from <color=#ff0000>hostile creatures</color> will keep you alive longer.

@w2 Your <color=#ffc800>Survival Tool</color> has a <color=#59ff00>defense </color>mode which is useful for defending yourself against <color=#ff0000>hostile creatures</color> when you have no other <color=#59ff00>weapons</color>.

@p9 Open your Inventory, Craft and Equip a <color=#ffc800>Survival Tool</color>.
@w2 Once you have your <color=#ffc800>Survival Tool</color> equipped, use it to defeat a <color=#ff0000>Creature</color>.

Chinese (simplified):
学会防御<color=#ff0000>敌对生物</color>可以让你活得更久。

@w2 你的<color=#ffc800>生存工具</color>有一个<color=#59ff00>防御</color>模式，当你没有其他<color=#59ff00>武器</color>时，可以用来防御<color=#ff0000>敌对生物</color>。

@p9 打开你的物品栏，制作并装备一个<color=#ffc800>生存工具</color>。
@w2 一旦你装备了<color=#ffc800>生存工具</color>，用它击败一个<color=#ff0000>生物</color>。

English:
While in combat, you will take <color=#ff0000>damage </color>and suffer other <color=#ff0000>ill effects</color>. 

@w2 To survive, you'll need to craft <color=#006eff>medicines </color>that can heal you <color=#ff0000>injuries </color>and cure your <color=#ff0000>ailments</color>. 

@p9 Use your <color=#ffd500>Suit Constructor </color>located in your Inventory(<color=#00fbff>Tab</color>) to craft three <color=#006eff>bandages </color>and an <color=#006eff>antibiotic ointment</color>.
@w5 Swamps are a useful place to look for <color=#006eff>medical ingredients</color>.

Chinese (simplified):
在战斗中，你会受到<color=#ff0000>伤害</color>并遭受其他<color=#ff0000>不良效果</color>。

@w2 为了生存，你需要制作<color=#006eff>药物</color>来治愈你的<color=#ff0000>创伤</color>并治好你的<color=#ff0000>疾病</color>。

@p9 使用你物品栏（<color=#00fbff>Tab键</color>）中的<color=#ffd500>防护服建造机</color>制作三个<color=#006eff>绷带</color>和一个<color=#006eff>抗生素药膏</color>。
@w5 沼泽是寻找<color=#006eff>医疗成分</color>的好地方。

English:
One constant threat that many would-be survivors overlook is the need for <color=#ff6f00>food</color>. @w2 If you don't eat, you will get <color=#ff6f00>hungry </color>and eventually <color=#ff0000>starve</color>. 

@w4 There are many types of <color=#ff6f00>food </color>that grow naturally, but none more useful than <color=#ff6f00>plant protein</color>.

@p9 Your <color=#ffd500>Suit Constructor</color> can process <color=#ff6f00>plant protein</color> into <color=#ff6f00>Energy Bars</color> that are a good source of <color=#ff6f00>food</color>.

@p9 Craft three <color=#ff6f00>Energy Bars</color> to start building your food stocks.

Chinese (simplified):
许多潜在的幸存者忽视的一个持续威胁是对<color=#ff6f00>食物</color>的需求。@w2 如果你不吃东西，你会感到<color=#ff6f00>饥饿</color>并最终<color=#ff0000>饿死</color>。

@w4 有许多天然生长的<color=#ff6f00>食物</color>，但最有用的莫过于<color=#ff6f00>植物蛋白</color>。

@p9 你的<color=#ffd500>防护服建造机</color>可以将<color=#ff6f00>植物蛋白</color>加工成<color=#ff6f00>能量棒</color>，是<color=#ff6f00>食物</color>的一个好来源。

@p9 制作三个<color=#ff6f00>能量棒</color>开始建立你的食物储备。

English:
The galaxy is filled with <color=#ffd500>junk</color>. @w2 From <color=#ffd500>derelict ships</color> floating through space, to <color=#ffd500>crashed vessels</color> and those abandoned as junk, the amount of <color=#ffd500>salvageable material</color> is extraordinary.

@p9 In order to survive in this galaxy, you will need to learn how to make the most of even the most worthless looking pile of trash.

@p9 The first step in turning trash into treasure is to <color=#ffd500>claim </color>a piece of <color=#ffd500>junk </color>for your own. In order to do so, you must first build a <color=#ffd500>core </color>using a <color=#ffd500>Portable Constructor</color>. Then you must place the <color=#ffd500>core </color>on the piece of <color=#ffd500>salvage </color>you want to claim. Once you learn how to do this, you will have all the necessary skills to survive.

Chinese (simplified):
星系中充满了<color=#ffd500>垃圾</color>。@w2 从漂浮在</color>太空<color=#ffd500>中的<color=#ffd500>废弃飞船</color>，到<color=#ffd500>坠毁的飞船</color>和被当作垃圾抛弃的飞船，<color=#ffd500>可回收材料</color>的数量惊人。

@p9 为了在这个星系中生存，你需要学会如何充分利用甚至是最不起眼的一堆垃圾。

@p9 将垃圾变成宝藏的第一步是<color=#ffd500>认领</color>一件<color=#ffd500>垃圾</color>归你所有。要做到这一点，你必须首先使用<color=#ffd500>便携式建造机</color>建造一个<color=#ffd500>核心</color>。然后你必须将<color=#ffd500>核心</color>放置在你想要认领的<color=#ffd500>残骸</color>上。一旦你学会如何做到这一点，你将拥有所有必要的生存技能。

English:
@q0 Congratulations! @w4 You have finished Basic Training! @w4 Now you are ready to choose an area in which to Specialize. @w4 There are four types of specialties to choose from: 
@w4 <color=#59ff00>Combat</color>, <color=#ffc800>Engineering</color>, <color=#ff00f7>Exploration</color>, and <color=#006eff>Medical</color>.
@w4 Each Specialization has its own perks.
@p9 The <color=#59ff00>Combat Specialization</color> focuses on <color=#59ff00>fighting</color>. This specialization allows you to learn how to craft a wide variety of <color=#59ff00>weapons</color>, including both <color=#59ff00>hand-held</color> and <color=#59ff00>ship weapons</color> and <color=#59ff00>turrets</color>. The <color=#59ff00>Combat Specialization</color> has access to the toughest <color=#59ff00>armors</color>, as well as defensive devices, such as <color=#59ff00>Shield Generators</color>, for all manner of vessels and structures.

@p9 Ultimately, the <color=#59ff00>Combat Specialization</color> would allow you to craft a powerful <color=#59ff00>vehicle weapons</color> like the <color=#59ff00>Hellstorm Turret</color> for a Capital Vessel that can rain down <color=#59ff00>Hellfire Missiles</color> upon <color=#ff0000>enemy troops</color> and <color=#ff0000>strongholds</color>, as well as superior <color=#59ff00>hand-held weapons</color> like the <color=#59ff00>Anti-Matter Rifle</color>, a power <color=#59ff00>Sniper Rifle</color> that can obliterate structural blocks and devices.

@p9 The <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color> focuses on <color=#ffc800>construction </color>and <color=#ffc800>resource gathering</color>. While not suited for <color=#04ff00>combat </color>in almost any way, the <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color> allows you to craft advanced devices that are required for ships to fly, such as <color=#ffc800>Thrusters </color>and <color=#ffc800>RCSs</color>, as well as the ability to <color=#ffc800>craft vehicles from scratch</color> (without having to repair an existing vehicle).

@p9 The <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color> also allows you to craft <color=#ffc800>CPU Extenders</color>, <color=#ffc800>Teleporters</color>, and <color=#ffc800>Repair Bays</color>, as well as higher-tier <color=#ffc800>fuel packs</color>, all of which would otherwise have to be scavenged from junk vessels. The <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color> also grants access to a variety of <color=#ffc800>tools</color>, including the <color=#ffc800>Multitool </color>and <color=#ffc800>Drill</color>, as well as all <color=#ffc800>resource gathering</color> devices, such as <color=#ffc800>auto-miners</color>, <color=#ffc800>vehicle drills</color> and <color=#ffc800>tools turrets</color>. 

@p9 Ultimately, the <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color> would allow you to craft powerful hand tools such as the <color=#ffc800>Master Multi-Tool</color> and the <color=#ffc800>Combat Drill</color>, a powerful <color=#ffc800>drill </color>that has an <color=#04ff00>Assault </color>mode that can <color=#59ff00>demolish </color>structural blocks and deal <color=#59ff00>significant damage</color> to <color=#ff0000>enemy troops</color> as well. Additionally, the <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color> gains access to special <color=#ffc800>Experimental Technology</color> including an <color=#ffc800>Advanced Warp Drive</color> that not only has a much longer warp range than a regulars <color=#ffc800>Warp Drive</color>, but also uses much less <color=#ffc800>Warp Fuel</color> when warping between systems.

@p9 The <color=#ff00f7>Exploration Specialization</color> allows you to craft all manor of <color=#ff00f7>exploration </color>and <color=#ff00f7>detection devices</color>, such as ship <color=#ff00f7>Detectors</color>. They can also build a <color=#ff00f7>Scout Vessel</color> from scratch, and equip it with a unique <color=#ffc800>gravity-based thrust system</color> not suited for larger vessels, but perfect for light <color=#ff00f7>scout vessels</color>, in addition to a <color=#ffc800>Mid-Range Warp Drive</color> for small vessels that can travel interstellar. They can craft unique hand-held <color=#59ff00>Scout Rifles </color><color=#04ff00></color>which are a combination of a <color=#04ff00>sniper </color>and an <color=#04ff00>assault rifle</color>, and gain access to <color=#04ff00>armor </color>that is much easier to move in than others. 

@p9 Ultimately, the <color=#ff00f7>Exploration Specialization</color> would allow you to craft a powerful <color=#ff00f7>Long-Range Detector</color> for a Small Vessel that can <color=#ff00f7>scan </color>an entire planet or sector, and a <color=#ff00f7>Deep Space Radar</color> that can not only <color=#ff00f7>scan</color>, but <color=#ff00f7>identify </color>objects and vehicles at extreme ranges.

@p9 The <color=#006eff>Medical Specialization</color> allows you to craft a large variety of advanced <color=#006eff>Medicines </color>and <color=#006eff>Medical Devices</color> for ships and bases, as well as a <color=#006eff>Medical Injector</color> which allows you to heal your allies in the field. The <color=#006eff>Medical Specialization</color> also allows you to craft <color=#006eff>Medical Augments</color>, which are one-use items that grant you semi-permanent increases to one or more of your core attributes (Health, Stamina, Food), as well as providing additional effects such as <color=#006eff>Health Regeneration</color>, <color=#ff00f7>Movement Speed</color> increases, and even Temperature Regulation. The bonuses granted by an <color=#006eff>Augment </color>last until either another <color=#006eff>Augment </color>is applied or you 'die'. 

@p9 Ultimately, the <color=#006eff>Medical Specialization</color> would allow you to craft a powerful <color=#006eff>Medical Injector</color> that can also <color=#006eff>recharge </color>an ally's stamina, and has a '<color=#04ff00>Stun Beam</color>' that deals small amounts of <color=#04ff00>damage</color>, but can keep many foes at bay. (Stuns Players in PvP as well).

@p9 Once you have selected your specialization, you can begin to gain ranks in that Specialization by opening your PDA (<color=#00fbff>F1</color>) and activating the corresponding Rank 1 Mission.

@p9 Once you reach Rank 3 in any Specialization, you will be offered the chance to complete an Advanced Training course, which will allow you to select an additional specialization if you wish, or you can gain 500 UP to help you unlock your specialization's high-tier items or devices.

@p9 Once you reach Rank 5 in any Specialization, you will be allowed  to select an additional specialization if you wish, or you can gain 500 UP to help you unlock your specialization's high-tier items or devices.

@p9 Which Specialization would you like to start with?

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 恭喜！ @w4 你已完成基础训练！ @w4 现在你可以选择一个领域进行专精。 @w4 有四种专精可供选择： 
@w4 <color=#59ff00>战斗</color>, <color=#ffc800>工程</color>, <color=#ff00f7>探索</color>, 和 <color=#006eff>医疗</color>.
@w4 每个专精都有其独特的特长。
@p9 <color=#59ff00>战斗专精</color>侧重于<color=#59ff00>战斗</color>。该专精允许你学习制造各种<color=#59ff00>武器</color>，包括<color=#59ff00>手持</color>和<color=#59ff00>飞船武器</color>以及<color=#59ff00>炮塔</color>。 <color=#59ff00>战斗专精</color>可以使用最坚固的<color=#59ff00>装甲</color>，以及防御装置，如<color=#59ff00>护盾发生器</color>，适用于各种飞船和建筑。

@p9 最终，<color=#59ff00>战斗专精</color>将允许你制造强大的<color=#59ff00>载具武器</color>，如用于主力舰的<color=#59ff00>地狱风暴炮塔</color>，可以向<color=#ff0000>敌军</color>和<color=#ff0000>据点</color>倾泻<color=#59ff00>地狱火导弹</color>，以及卓越的<color=#59ff00>手持武器</color>，如<color=#59ff00>反物质步枪</color>，一种强大的<color=#59ff00>狙击步枪</color>，能够摧毁结构方块和装置。

@p9 <color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>侧重于<color=#ffc800>建造 </color>和<color=#ffc800>资源采集</color>。虽然几乎不适合<color=#04ff00>战斗 </color>，但<color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>允许你制造飞船飞行所需的高级装置，如<color=#ffc800>推进器 </color>和<color=#ffc800>RCS</color>，以及<color=#ffc800>从头制造载具</color>的能力（无需修理现有载具）。

@p9 <color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>还允许你制造<color=#ffc800>CPU扩展器</color>、<color=#ffc800>传送器</color>和<color=#ffc800>修理坞</color>，以及更高级的<color=#ffc800>燃料包</color>，否则这些只能从废弃飞船中回收。 <color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>还提供各种<color=#ffc800>工具</color>，包括<color=#ffc800>多功能工具 </color>和<color=#ffc800>钻头</color>，以及所有<color=#ffc800>资源采集</color>装置，如<color=#ffc800>自动采矿机</color>、<color=#ffc800>载具钻头</color>和<color=#ffc800>工具炮塔</color>。 

@p9 最终，<color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>将允许你制造强大的手持工具，如<color=#ffc800>大师级多功能工具</color>和<color=#ffc800>战斗钻头</color>，一种强大的<color=#ffc800>钻头 </color>，具有<color=#04ff00>突击 </color>模式，可以<color=#59ff00>摧毁 </color>结构方块并对<color=#ff0000>敌军</color>造成<color=#59ff00>显著伤害</color>。此外，<color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>可以使用特殊的<color=#ffc800>实验技术</color>，包括<color=#ffc800>高级翘曲引擎</color>，其翘曲范围远大于普通<color=#ffc800>翘曲引擎</color>，而且在星系间翘曲时消耗更少的<color=#ffc800>翘曲燃料</color>。

@p9 <color=#ff00f7>探索专精</color>允许你制造各种<color=#ff00f7>探索 </color>和<color=#ff00f7>探测装置</color>，如飞船<color=#ff00f7>探测器</color>。他们还可以从头建造一艘<color=#ff00f7>侦察飞船</color>，并配备独特的<color=#ffc800>重力推进系统</color>，不适合大型飞船，但非常适合轻型<color=#ff00f7>侦察飞船</color>，此外还有用于小型飞船的<color=#ffc800>中程翘曲引擎</color>，可以进行星际旅行。他们可以制造独特的手持<color=#59ff00>侦察步枪 </color><color=#04ff00></color>，是<color=#04ff00>狙击枪 </color>和<color=#04ff00>突击步枪</color>的结合体，并可获得<color=#04ff00>装甲 </color>，其移动更加灵活。 

@p9 最终，<color=#ff00f7>探索专精</color>将允许你为小型飞船制造强大的<color=#ff00f7>远程探测器</color>，可以<color=#ff00f7>扫描 </color>整个星球或星区，以及<color=#ff00f7>深空雷达</color>，不仅能<color=#ff00f7>扫描</color>，还能在极远距离<color=#ff00f7>识别 </color>物体和载具。

@p9 <color=#006eff>医疗专精</color>允许你制造各种高级<color=#006eff>药品 </color>和<color=#006eff>医疗装置</color>用于飞船和基地，以及<color=#006eff>医疗注射器</color>，可以在战场上治疗盟友。 <color=#006eff>医疗专精</color>还允许你制造<color=#006eff>医疗增强体</color>，这是一种一次性物品，可永久提升一项或多项核心属性（生命、耐力、食物），并提供额外效果，如<color=#006eff>生命恢复</color>、<color=#ff00f7>移动速度</color>提升，甚至温度调节。 <color=#006eff>增强体 </color>提供的加成持续到另一个<color=#006eff>增强体 </color>被应用或你“死亡”。 

@p9 最终，<color=#006eff>医疗专精</color>将允许你制造强大的<color=#006eff>医疗注射器</color>，还可以<color=#006eff>补充 </color>盟友的耐力，并具有“<color=#04ff00>眩晕光束</color>”，造成少量<color=#04ff00>伤害</color>，但可以牵制许多敌人。（在PvP中也能眩晕玩家）。

@p9 一旦你选择了专精，你可以通过打开PDA（<color=#00fbff>F1</color>）并激活相应的第一级任务来提升该专精的等级。

@p9 一旦你在任何专精中达到3级，你将有机会完成高级训练课程，如果你愿意，可以选择额外的专精，或者获得500 UP以帮助你解锁专精的高级物品或装置。

@p9 一旦你在任何专精中达到5级，你将可以选择额外的专精（如果你愿意），或者获得500 UP以帮助你解锁专精的高级物品或装置。

@p9 你希望从哪个专精开始？

English:
As an <color=#ffc800>Engineer</color>, your job is to equip, maintain and upgrade your ships and structures. 
@w2 In order to gain Ranks in <color=#ffc800>Engineering</color>, you must either craft or salvage the devices necessary to do your job. Regardless of how you obtain the devices, you must place the devices on the appropriate structure type in order to successfully gain your ranks.

@p9 Your first task as an <color=#ffc800>Engineer </color>will be to add <color=#ffc800>power generation</color> and <color=#ffc800>construction </color>capabilities to a Base or Capital Vessel. Doing this will allow you to craft more advanced devices for use on your structures and vessels.

@p9 Place a <color=#ffc800>power generator</color> (Either a <color=#ffc800>Generator</color> or <color=#ffc800>Solar Capacitor</color>) and a <color=#ffc800>fuel source</color> (Either a <color=#ffc800>Fuel Tank</color> or a <color=#ffc800>Solar Panel</color>) on a Base or Capital Vessel. @w6 Then place a <color=#ffc800>Small Constructor</color>. @w4 Finally, use the <color=#ffc800>Small Constructor</color> to craft a <color=#ffc800>Large Constructor</color> which can be used to craft all manner of advanced devices.

Chinese (simplified):
作为一名<color=#ffc800>工程师</color>，你的工作是装备、维护和升级你的飞船与建筑结构。
@w2 为了在<color=#ffc800>工程学</color>中获得等级，你必须制作或拆解完成工作所需的设备。无论你如何获得设备，都必须将设备放置在合适的结构类型上才能成功升级。

@p9 你作为<color=#ffc800>工程师 </color>的第一个任务是为主力舰或基地添加<color=#ffc800>发电</color>和<color=#ffc800>建造 </color>能力。这样做将允许你制作更高级的设备，用于你的建筑结构和飞船。

@p9 在基地或主力舰上放置一个<color=#ffc800>发电机</color>（可以是<color=#ffc800>发电机</color>或<color=#ffc800>太阳能电容器</color>）和一个<color=#ffc800>燃料源</color>（可以是<color=#ffc800>燃料罐</color>或<color=#ffc800>太阳能板</color>）。@w6 然后放置一个<color=#ffc800>小型建造机</color>。@w4 最后，使用<color=#ffc800>小型建造机</color>制作一个<color=#ffc800>大型建造机</color>，它可以用来制作各种高级设备。

English:
One of the key factors in <color=#ffc800>resource gathering</color> is the ability to get around without having to walk everywhere. Hover Vessels are very useful for traveling to and from <color=#ffc800>resource locations</color> and for hauling larger amounts of <color=#ffc800>raw resources</color> to your base. 

@p9 As an <color=#ffc800>Engineer</color>, you have the ability to <color=#ffc800>build </color>Hover Vessels from scratch, and to <color=#ffc800>craft the devices</color> needed for a Hover Vessel to work. @w4 Build or Salvage a Hover Vessel that is capable of helping you traverse the terrain of the planet.

@p9 To do this, you must place four <color=#ffc800>Hover Engines</color> and four <color=#ffc800>Small Thrusters</color> on a Hover Vessel. @w2 You can salvage these off of the many junk hover vessels in the junkyards around the planet, or <color=#ffc800>build them yourself</color>.

Chinese (simplified):
在<color=#ffc800>资源收集</color>中，一个关键因素是能够不依赖步行四处移动。悬浮飞船对于往返<color=#ffc800>资源地点</color>以及将大量<color=#ffc800>原始资源</color>运回你的基地非常有用。

@p9 作为一名<color=#ffc800>工程师</color>，你有能力<color=#ffc800>从零建造</color>悬浮飞船，并<color=#ffc800>制作设备</color>来让悬浮飞船运作。@w4 建造或拆解一艘能够帮助你穿越星球地形的悬浮飞船。

@p9 要做到这一点，你必须在悬浮飞船上放置四个<color=#ffc800>悬浮引擎</color>和四个<color=#ffc800>小型推进器</color>。@w2 你可以从星球周围废料场中的许多废弃悬浮飞船上拆解这些部件，或者<color=#ffc800>自己建造它们</color>。

English:
Small Vessels are the key to traveling off world to find more <color=#ffc800>resources </color>to gather. @w2 In space, there could be asteroids with <color=#ffc800>valuable resources</color>, and other planets may even have <color=#ffc800>surface deposits</color>. @w4 However, your primary source of <color=#ffc800>resources </color>in space will be the various <color=#ffc800>Ship Graveyards</color> that can be found around the galaxy. 

@p9 In order to get there, however, you'll need a vehicle <color=#ffc800>capable of flight</color>. As an <color=#ffc800>Engineer</color>, you have the ability to <color=#ffc800>build </color>Small Vessels from scratch, and to <color=#ffc800>craft the devices</color> needed for a Small Vessel to fly. @w4 Build or Salvage a Small Vessel that is capable of taking you into space. @w2 One with enough <color=#ffc800>cargo space</color> to help you transport things back would be nice.

@p9 To do this, you must place four <color=#ffc800>Small Thrusters</color> and two <color=#ffc800>Medium Thrusters</color> on a Small Vessel. @w2 You can salvage these off of the junk small vessels in the junkyards around the planet, or <color=#ffc800>build them yourself</color>.

Chinese (simplified):
小型飞船是离开星球旅行的关键，可以寻找更多<color=#ffc800>资源</color>进行采集。@w2 在太空中，可能会有富含<color=#ffc800>珍稀资源</color>的小行星，其他星球甚至可能有<color=#ffc800>地表矿藏</color>。@w4 然而，你在太空中的主要<color=#ffc800>资源</color>来源将是遍布星系的各类<color=#ffc800>飞船坟场</color>。

@p9 不过，要抵达那里，你需要一艘<color=#ffc800>能够飞行</color>的载具。作为一名<color=#ffc800>工程师</color>，你有能力<color=#ffc800>从零开始建造</color>小型飞船，并<color=#ffc800>制作</color>小型飞船飞行所需的设备。@w4 建造或修复一艘能够将你带入太空的小型飞船。@w2 如果有足够的<color=#ffc800>货舱空间</color>来帮助你往回运输物资就更好了。

@p9 要做到这一点，你必须在小型飞船上安装四个<color=#ffc800>小型推进器</color>和两个<color=#ffc800>中型推进器</color>。@w2 你可以从星球周围的垃圾场中的废弃小型飞船上拆解这些东西，或者<color=#ffc800>自己制造</color>它们。

English:
Even with a Capital Vessel at your disposal, it's occasionally necessary to store <color=#ffc800>resources </color>and valuables in a safe location.

@w8 Abandoned space stations can be found throughout the galaxy. One of these would make a perfect base of operations, if it were <color=#ffc800>repaired</color>. If you find a suitable <color=#ffc800>Derelict Orbital Station</color>, you should try to <color=#ffc800>repair it</color> and turn it into your base of operations. If you have an ally who specializes in <color=#ff00f7>Exploration</color>, this could help out immensely.

@w6 Locate a <color=#ffc800>Derelict Orbital Station</color> and <color=#ffc800>make it an operational base</color>.

Chinese (simplified):
即使有主力舰可供使用，有时也需要将<color=#ffc800>资源</color>和贵重物品存放在安全的地方。

@w8 废弃空间站遍布星系。如果能够<color=#ffc800>修复</color>，其中一个将是一个绝佳的操作基地。如果你找到合适的<color=#ffc800>废弃空间站</color>，你应该尝试<color=#ffc800>修复它</color>并将其变为你的操作基地。如果你有一个专精于<color=#ff00f7>探索</color>的盟友，这将大有裨益。

@w6 找到一个<color=#ffc800>废弃空间站</color>并<color=#ffc800>将其变成一个可运作的基地</color>。

English:
{PlayerName}! It seems that there is a strange transmission stuck in the station's Receiver. It seems to have originated on a Zirax frequency.

@w4 The Lines of Code are as follows:
@w2 <color=#ffc800>0223402252023230</color>
@w2 <color=#ffc800>0245403242033250</color>
@w2 <color=#ffc800>0352203545042320</color>
@w2 <color=#ffc800>0425504532052340</color>
@w2 <color=#ffc800>0524205342054350</color>

@p9 These codes have been uploaded to your PDA. You can open your PDA and view them at any time.

Chinese (simplified):
{PlayerName}！看来有一个奇怪的信号卡在了空间站的接收器里。它似乎源自兹瑞克斯的频率。

@w4 代码行如下：
@w2 <color=#ffc800>0223402252023230</color>
@w2 <color=#ffc800>0245403242033250</color>
@w2 <color=#ffc800>0352203545042320</color>
@w2 <color=#ffc800>0425504532052340</color>
@w2 <color=#ffc800>0524205342054350</color>

@p9 这些代码已上传到你的PDA。你可以随时打开PDA查看。

English:
Capital Vessels make extremely valuable mobile bases. Rather than bringing salvaged materials and <color=#ffc800>resources</color> to your base, with a Capital Vessel, you can bring your base to the <color=#ffc800>resources</color>.

@w4 As an <color=#ffc800>Engineer</color>, you can <color=#ffc800>build </color>Capital Vessels from scratch, and are capable of <color=#ffc800>crafting the devices</color> required for a Capital Vessel to take flight. @w4 Build or Salvage a Capital Vessel to use as your mobile base of operations.

@p9 To do this, you must place four <color=#ffc800>Small Thrusters</color> and two <color=#ffc800>Medium Thrusters</color> on a Capital Vessel. @w2 You can salvage these off of the occasional crashed or junked Capital Vessels around the planet, or <color=#ffc800>build them yourself</color>.

Chinese (simplified):
主力舰是极具价值的移动基地。与其将回收的材料和<color=#ffc800>资源</color>带回基地，不如用主力舰将基地带到<color=#ffc800>资源</color>所在之处。

@w4 作为<color=#ffc800>工程师</color>，你可以<color=#ffc800>从头建造</color>主力舰，并且能够<color=#ffc800>制造</color>主力舰升空所需的装置。@w4 建造或回收一艘主力舰，作为你的移动操作基地。

@p9 为此，你必须在主力舰上放置四个<color=#ffc800>小型推进器</color>和两个<color=#ffc800>中型推进器</color>。@w2 你可以从星球周围偶尔坠毁或废弃的主力舰上回收这些部件，或者<color=#ffc800>自己建造</color>它们。

English:
As a <color=#04ff00>Soldier</color>, your job is to <color=#04ff00>protect </color>your allies, <color=#04ff00>defend </color>your base, and lead the <color=#04ff00>assault </color>on <color=#ff0000>enemy forces</color>. 
@w2 In order to gain Ranks in <color=#04ff00>Combat</color>, you will be required to show off your <color=#04ff00>military expertise</color>, defeating <color=#ff0000>enemies </color>wherever they may be. 

@w4 You have been provided with an <color=#04ff00>Assault Rifle</color>, which will be useful in defeating your <color=#ff0000>enemy</color>. You have the capability of learning how to craft additional <color=#04ff00>weaponry </color>for whatever situation may arise. 

@w6 Practice with your <color=#04ff00>Assault Rifle</color> by <color=#04ff00>killing </color>ten more <color=#ff0000>Spiders</color>.

Chinese (simplified):
作为一名<color=#04ff00>士兵</color>，你的职责是<color=#04ff00>保护</color>你的盟友，<color=#04ff00>保卫</color>你的基地，并领导对<color=#04ff00>敌方部队</color>的<color=#ff0000>进攻</color>。
@w2为了提升<color=#04ff00>战斗</color>等级，你需要展示你的<color=#04ff00>军事专长</color>，<color=#ff0000>击败</color>任何地方的<color=#ff0000>敌人</color>。

@w4你已获得一把<color=#04ff00>突击步枪</color>，它将有助于击败你的<color=#ff0000>敌人</color>。你有能力学习如何制作额外的<color=#04ff00>武器</color>，以应对可能出现的任何情况。

@w6通过<color=#04ff00>杀死</color>另外十只<color=#ff0000>蜘蛛</color>来练习你的<color=#04ff00>突击步枪</color>。

English:
The <color=#ff0000>Aliens</color> uses special <color=#ff0000>Defensive Towers</color> to expand their territory on a planet. @w2 <color=#04ff00>Taking out</color> these <color=#ff0000>towers </color>would reduce their territory tremendously. 

@w6 Use a Small Vessel or Hover Vessel to <color=#04ff00>destroy </color>the <color=#ff0000>core </color>of five <color=#ff0000>enemy Junkyard Defense Towers</color>. 
@w4 Alternatively, if you have <color=#04ff00>explosives</color>, you could try to approach the <color=#ff0000>tower </color>on foot, and <color=#04ff00>blast </color>the base of the <color=#ff0000>tower </color>until the <color=#ff0000>core </color>is exposed. @w2 However, this is not recommended.

The <color=#ff0000>Aliens</color> uses their <color=#ff0000>Drone Bases</color> to coordinate their <color=#ff0000>attacks </color>on their enemies, namely you. @w2 If you <color=#04ff00>take out</color> the <color=#ff0000>Drone Base</color>, you will effectively drive them off the planet,@w2 for a time at least. 

@p9 Once you have <color=#ff00f7>found </color>the <color=#ff0000>Drone Base</color>, gather your allies for an all out <color=#04ff00>assault </color>on the <color=#ff0000>Drone Base</color>. @w2 In order to <color=#04ff00>take it out</color>, you'll first have to <color=#04ff00>take out</color> their <color=#ff0000>shields</color>. @w4 Then you'll have to make your way into the <color=#ff0000>facility </color>on foot. @w4 Once inside, you'll need to <color=#ff00f7>locate </color>the <color=#ff0000>core room</color> and <color=#04ff00>destroy </color>the <color=#ff0000>core</color>.

@w6 This will be your toughest mission yet. @w2 Good luck!

@p9 Note: if you're friends with a <color=#ff00f7>Scout</color>, they may know where the <color=#ff0000>Drone Base</color> is already.
@w5 Note: If you're friends with an <color=#ffc800>Engineer</color>, they may be able to help you bypass the locks on the doors.

As a <color=#006eff>Medic</color>, it's your job see to the <color=#006eff>wellbeing </color>and continued <color=#006eff>health </color>of your allies. 

@w2 In order to gain Ranks in <color=#006eff>Medical</color>, you will be required to craft <color=#006eff>medical supplies</color> for your allies to use, and set up a <color=#006eff>Medical Bay</color> to store and craft medicines, and to <color=#006eff>heal </color>your allies when you aren't around.

@p9 Your first task as an <color=#006eff>Medic </color>will be to begin crafting basic <color=#006eff>medical supplies</color> to help you allies survive the <color=#ff0000>hostile environment</color> you find yourselves in.

@w6 Craft ten <color=#006eff>bandages </color>and four of each type of <color=#006eff>Medical Ointment</color> (<color=#006eff>Antibiotic</color>, <color=#006eff>Antitoxic</color>, and <color=#006eff>Anti Radiation</color>).

Chinese (simplified):
作为一名<color=#006eff>医疗兵</color>，你的职责是关注盟友的<color=#006eff>福祉</color>和持续的<color=#006eff>健康</color>。

@w2为了提升<color=#006eff>医疗</color>等级，你需要制作<color=#006eff>医疗用品</color>供盟友使用，并设置一个<color=#006eff>医疗舱</color>来储存和制作药物，以及在你不在时<color=#006eff>治疗</color>你的盟友。

@p9作为<color=#006eff>医疗兵</color>的首要任务是开始制作基本的<color=#006eff>医疗用品</color>，帮助你的盟友在你所处的<color=#ff0000>恶劣环境</color>中生存。

@w6制作十个<color=#006eff>绷带</color>和每种<color=#006eff>医疗药膏</color>各四个（<color=#006eff>抗生素</color>、<color=#006eff>抗毒剂</color>和<color=#006eff>抗辐射</color>）。

English:
While <color=#006eff>Ointments </color>and <color=#006eff>Pills </color>are effective against the most common ailments,@w2 the more serious conditions can only be handled by <color=#006eff>injections</color>, or advanced <color=#006eff>Medical Equipment</color> or <color=#006eff>Medical Kits</color>. @w4 The easiest of these to craft are <color=#006eff>injections</color>.

@w6 Craft four of each type of <color=#006eff>Medical Injection</color> (<color=#006eff>Antibiotic</color>, <color=#006eff>Antitoxic</color>, <color=#006eff>Anti Parasite</color>, and <color=#006eff>Anti Radiation</color>).
@w4 <color=#006eff>Medical Injections</color> require Fire Moss Scrapings which can be found in the Swamps.

Chinese (simplified):
虽然<color=#006eff>药膏</color>和<color=#006eff>药丸</color>对最常见的疾病有效，@w2但更严重的状况只能通过<color=#006eff>注射剂</color>或高级<color=#006eff>医疗设备</color>或<color=#006eff>医疗包</color>来处理。@w4 其中最容易制作的是<color=#006eff>注射剂</color>。

@w6 每种类型的<color=#006eff>医疗注射剂</color>制作四个（<color=#006eff>抗生素</color>、<color=#006eff>抗毒素</color>、<color=#006eff>抗寄生虫</color>和<color=#006eff>抗辐射</color>）。
@w4 <color=#006eff>医疗注射剂</color>需要火焰苔藓刮屑，可以在沼泽中找到。

English:
As a <color=#ff00f7>scout</color>, your job is to <color=#ff00f7>locate </color>POIs that could be useful for your group to <color=#ff00f7>investigate </color>or <color=#04ff00>attack</color>. @w2 In order to gain Ranks in <color=#ff00f7>Exploration</color>, you will need to <color=#ff00f7>locate </color>certain POIs, <color=#ffc800>craft </color>a Scout Vessel to help you <color=#ff00f7>explore</color>, and eventually, head out into the wider galaxy in <color=#ff00f7>search </color>of ancient secrets.

@w6 Your first mission is to <color=#ff00f7>find information on a colony ship POI</color>. Keep an eye on your mini-map for an icon the shape of a Chevron. These POIs are often key elements for your missions, or those of your allies. 

@w4 Hint: Appearently you are in the middle of a huge space ship junkyard with a lot of destroyed vessels around you. Maybe you want to scrape together some parts and rebuild a Ship enough to move around the system a tleast!

@w4 <color=#c73bc9>NOTE: The Exploration missions are designed to be started on your starting area. Th emission chain will alert you when you are suposed to search elsewhere. </color>

Chinese (simplified):
作为一名<color=#ff00f7>侦察兵</color>，你的工作是<color=#ff00f7>定位</color>对你的团队有用的兴趣点，以便<color=#ff00f7>调查</color>或<color=#04ff00>攻击</color>。@w2 为了在<color=#ff00f7>探索</color>中获得等级，你需要<color=#ff00f7>定位</color>某些兴趣点，<color=#ffc800>制作</color>一艘侦察飞船来帮助你<color=#ff00f7>探索</color>，最终驾驶它前往更广阔的银河系<color=#ff00f7>寻找</color>远古的秘密。

@w6 你的第一个任务是<color=#ff00f7>寻找一个殖民船兴趣点的信息</color>。留意你的小地图上V形图标。这些兴趣点通常是你的任务或盟友任务的关键元素。

@w4 提示：显然你正处于一个巨大的太空飞船废品场中，周围有许多被摧毁的飞船。也许你想收集一些零件，重建一艘足以在星系内移动的飞船！

@w4 <color=#c73bc9>注意：探索任务设计为从你的起始区域开始。任务链会在你该前往其他地方搜索时提醒你。</color>

English:
It appears you've <color=#ff00f7>found </color>an Alien Obelisk! @w2 This is an excellent find!

@p4 Sensors indicate a low-level energy signal emanating from the Obelisk. @w2 I'll begin analyzing it and let you know what I find.

@w6 This could take a while. @w4 In the mean time, you should continue with your next mission.

Chinese (simplified):
看来你已经<color=#ff00f7>发现了</color>一个外星方尖碑！@w2 这是一个绝佳的发现！

@p4 传感器显示方尖碑发出低能量信号。@w2 我将开始分析它，并告诉你我的发现。

@w6 这可能需要一些时间。@w4 在此期间，你应该继续你的下一个任务。

English:
The Alien Obelisk you <color=#ff00f7>found </color>was luckily close by. @w2 However, most POIs you'll try to <color=#ff00f7>find </color>won't be so close. 

@w4 Scout Vessels are Small Vessels that are designed to cover large areas of ground quickly, while being highly maneuverable and capable of <color=#ff00f7>detecting </color>nearby POIs. 

@p9 As a <color=#ff00f7>scout</color>, you have the capability of <color=#ffc800>building </color>a Scout Vessel from scratch, and equipping it with a <color=#ffc800>Graviton Thrust Drive</color>, which will take the place of the forward, rear, and side <color=#ffc800>thrusters </color>for purposes of <color=#ffc800>thrust</color>. @w2 This will allow you to design an efficient Scout Vessel, without the help of an <color=#ffc800>Engineer</color>. 

@w4 Once you have your Scout Vessel completed, you will be able to <color=#ff00f7>locate </color>POIs on the surface of the planet much easier.

Chinese (simplified):
你<color=#ff00f7>发现的</color>外星方尖碑幸运地就在附近。@w2 然而，你试图<color=#ff00f7>找到</color>的大多数兴趣点不会这么近。

@w4 侦察飞船是一种小型飞船，旨在快速覆盖大片地面，同时具有高机动性，并能<color=#ff00f7>探测</color>附近的兴趣点。

@p9 作为一名<color=#ff00f7>侦察兵</color>，你有能力<color=#ffc800>建造</color>一艘侦察飞船，并为其配备<color=#ffc800>引力子推进器</color>，它将取代前进、后退和侧面的<color=#ffc800>推进器</color>用于<color=#ffc800>推进</color>。@w2 这将让你能够设计一艘高效的侦察飞船，无需<color=#ffc800>工程师</color>的帮助。

@w4 一旦你的侦察飞船完成，你将能够更轻松地<color=#ff00f7>定位</color>星球表面的兴趣点。

English:
{PlayerName}, I am detecting a power source on the planet that seems to be the source of the <color=#ff0000>Alien Drones</color> in the area. @w2 It has the same energy signature as the <color=#ff0000>Junkyard Defense</color> towers in the area.
@w2 If you <color=#ff00f7>locate </color>this <color=#ff0000>Drone Base</color>, you and your allies may be able to devise a strategy to <color=#04ff00>take it out</color>, and strike a significant blow to the <color=#ff0000>Aliens</color>.

@w6 <color=#ff00f7>Locate </color>the <color=#ff0000>Rados Drone Base</color>.

Chinese (simplified):
{PlayerName}, 我正在探测到星球上有一个能源源，似乎是该区域<color=#ff0000>外星无人机</color>的来源。@w2 它与该区域的<color=#ff0000>废品场防御</color>塔有着相同的能量特征。
@w2 如果你<color=#ff00f7>定位</color>这个<color=#ff0000>无人机基地</color>，你和你的盟友也许能制定策略<color=#04ff00>消灭它</color>，给<color=#ff0000>外星人</color>以重大打击。

@w6 <color=#ff00f7>定位</color>拉多斯无人机基地<color=#ff0000> </color>.

English:
{PlayerName}, I have finally finished analyzing the mysterious signal that was being emitted by the Alien Obelisk! @w6 The signal appears to be a warning of some sort, or part of one. 

@w4 The message I can decipher is as follow:

@w6 @d8 TRAVELERS ... BEWARE THE ... FOR THEY ...
@W2 ...GATE ... ARRIVED AMIDST THE ... BEYOND THE ...
@W2 THROUGH THE ... SAIL AMIDST THE SEA ... LOOKING FOR MORE ...
@W2 BEWARE ...
@W2 BEWARE THE ...

The signal seems to indicate that there are other obelisks in this system that may be able to reveal more of the message.

@p9 Unfortunately, our communications systems are too weak to pick up any signal from such a distance. @w2 However, it appears that the Zirax have set up a Com Center on this planet. @w2 If you could infiltrate it and access its Communications Array, we may be able to detect the other three signals, and determine which planets they are coming from.

Chinese (simplified):
{PlayerName}, 我终于完成了对外星方尖碑发射的神秘信号的分析！@w6 这个信号似乎是某类警告，或警告的一部分。

@w4 我能解读的信息如下：

@w6 @d8 旅行者们……当心……因为他们……
@W2 ……门……到达了……之间……在……之外……
@W2 穿过……航行于……之海……寻找更多……
@W2 当心……
@W2 当心……

信号似乎表明这个星系中还有其他方尖碑，可能能够揭示更多信息。

@p9 不幸的是，我们的通信系统太弱，无法从如此远的距离接收到任何信号。@w2 不过，看起来兹瑞克斯已经在这个星球上建立了一个通信中心。@w2 如果你能潜入其中并访问它的通信阵列，我们也许能够探测到其他三个信号，并确定它们来自哪些星球。

English:
@w4 …ACCESSING…
@w4 …ACCESSING…
@w4 …PROCESSING DATA…

@w6 The Com Array has <color=#ff00f7>detected </color>three signals similar to the one from the Destroyed Alien Obelisk.

@p9 The signals are coming from three planets in this solar system:
@w4 The Lava planet called Krin Orntell, 
@w2 The Arid planet called Zasha Orntell; 
@w2 And the forest moon of the Gas Giant Exana Orntell. 

@w6 I suggest traveling to these planets and attempting to <color=#ff00f7>find</color> and <color=#ff00f7>scan </color>the obelisks emitting these signals to learn more.

Chinese (simplified):
@w4…正在访问…
@w4…正在访问…
@w4…正在处理数据…

@w6通信阵列已<color=#ff00f7>检测到</color>三个与已摧毁的外星方尖碑信号相似的信号。

@p9这些信号来自该恒星系中的三颗星球：
@w4名为克林·奥恩特尔的熔岩星球，
@w2名为扎莎·奥恩特尔的干旱星球；
@w2以及气体巨星埃克萨纳·奥恩特尔的森林卫星。

@w6我建议前往这些星球，尝试<color=#ff00f7>找到</color>并<color=#ff00f7>扫描</color>发出这些信号的方尖碑以了解更多信息。

English:
The <color=#ff0000>Hostile Aliens</color> have control of this planet. @w2 Learning how to <color=#04ff00>deal with them</color> will require Advanced Combat Tactics.

@w4 <color=#04ff00>Take out</color> five <color=#ff0000>Alien Soldiers</color> or <color=#ff0000>Ripper Dogs</color> in order to prove your mettle against these ruthless <color=#ff0000>enemies</color>.

@w4 NOTE: It's probably a good idea to salvage some <color=#04ff00>Advanced Weapons</color> before you try to fight the <color=#ff0000>Alien's</color>.

@q0 Congratulations! @w4 You have finished the Advanced Training Course! 


@w2 You can now proceed to unlock an additional Specialization!
      @w4 Alternatively, you can choose to gain Unlock Points to unlock additional devices or items that you already have access to.

                                                                             @w4 @d6 The Choice Is Yours!

Chinese (simplified):
@q0恭喜！@w4你已完成高级训练课程！


@w2你现在可以继续解锁一个额外的专精！
      @w4或者，你可以选择获得解锁点来解锁已有权限的额外设备或物品。

                                                                             @w4@d6选择权在你手中！

English:
Gathering ingredients to craft <color=#006eff>Medical Supplies</color> can take a lot of time and effort, which often would otherwise be better spent elsewhere. 


@w4 <color=#ff6f00>Growing </color>your own <color=#006eff>Medical Ingredients</color> can save you a lot of time and effort. @w2 Using a Food Processor, you can turn <color=#006eff>gathered ingredients</color> into <color=#ff6f00>growable Sprouts</color>, which you can then plant in a <color=#ff6f00>Growing Plot</color>. 

@w4 <color=#ff6f00>Plant</color> one of each of the following <color=#006eff>Medical Ingredient</color> Sprouts: Fiber, Herbal Leaves, and Plant Protein or Vegetables.

Chinese (simplified):
收集原料来制作<color=#006eff>医疗用品</color>可能需要很多时间和精力，而这些时间通常可以更好地用在别处。


@w4<color=#ff6f00>自己种植</color><color=#006eff>医疗原料</color>可以节省你大量时间和精力。@w2使用食物处理器，你可以将<color=#006eff>收集的原料</color>转化为<color=#ff6f00>可种植的幼苗</color>，然后将其种植在<color=#ff6f00>种植板</color>中。

@w4<color=#ff6f00>种植以下每种</color><color=#006eff>医疗原料</color>幼苗各一个：纤维、草本叶、植物蛋白或蔬菜。

English:
Now that the <color=#ff0000>Drone Base</color> on the planet is <color=#04ff00>shut down</color>, there should be no more <color=#ff0000>drone attacks</color> on your bases. @w4At least, not until the <color=#ff0000>Aliens </color>restart their <color=#ff0000>Drone Base</color>. 

@w2 For now, the main problem will be the <color=#ff0000>Alien Space Forces</color>. @w2The <color=#ff0000>Aliens </color>employ a large number of <color=#ff0000>Space Drones</color> that are capable of doing a lot of <color=#ff0000>damage</color>, if left unchecked. 

@w2 <color=#04ff00>Take out</color> as many <color=#ff0000>Space Drones</color> as you can!

Chinese (simplified):
既然星球上的<color=#ff0000>无人机基地</color>已被<color=#04ff00>关闭</color>，你的基地应该不会再受到<color=#ff0000>无人机攻击</color>。@w4至少，在<color=#ff0000>外星人</color>重启他们的<color=#ff0000>无人机基地</color>之前不会。

@w2目前，主要问题是<color=#ff0000>外星太空部队</color>。@w2<color=#ff0000>外星人</color>使用了大量<color=#ff0000>太空无人机</color>，如果不加以控制，它们能造成巨大<color=#ff0000>伤害</color>。

@w2<color=#04ff00>消灭尽可能多的</color><color=#ff0000>太空无人机</color>！

English:
You've become a master of <color=#ff0000>destruction</color>, capable of <color=#ff0000>taking out</color> nearly any foe.@w4 Now, prove your mettle against one of the <color=#ff0000>Zirax's</color> toughest foes, the <color=#ff0000>Zirax Orbital Patrol Vessel</color>!!!

@p9 All <color=#ff0000>Zirax Orbital Patrol Vessels</color> are equipped with <color=#ff0000>Polarized Hull Shields</color>. You'll need to <color=#ff0000>knock out</color> the enemy's <color=#ff0000>shields </color>before you can even attempt to board them. @w2 Use caution, however, because many <color=#ff0000>Capital Ship's Shields</color> regenerate, even after being knocked to 0. @w2 It's highly recommended that you use your own Capital Vessel, or heavily armed Small Vessel to attempt this.

@p9 Once the <color=#ff0000>Patrol Vessel's Shields</color> are out, you'll need to <color=#ff0000>destroy </color>all of its rear <color=#fed43e>thrusters </color>in order to stop the ship. @w2 It's impossible to board a moving Capital Vessel, so stopping the enemy vessel is a requirement.

@p9 Finally, you'll need to make your way onto the Capital Vessel, locate and <color=#ff0000>destroy </color>its Core.@w2 Beware of the Patrol Vessel's Crew, however, as they will respond with deadly force. @w2 It's recommended that you bring along a <color=#0084ff>Medic </color>and other support crew to aid you in this <color=#ff0000>attack</color>.
@w4 If you don't have a <color=#0084ff>Medic </color>available, remember to take plenty of <color=#0084ff>Medical Supplies</color>, and keep a Capital Vessel equipped with a <color=#0084ff>Medical Station</color> or <color=#0084ff>Emergency Teleporter</color> nearby so you can respawn close to your target without much danger.

@p9 Good Luck {PlayerName}! This will be your toughest mission yet!

Chinese (simplified):
你已经成为了<color=#ff0000>毁灭</color>大师，能够<color=#ff0000>消灭</color>几乎任何敌人。@w4现在，在<color=#ff0000>兹瑞克斯的</color>最强敌人之一——<color=#ff0000>兹瑞克斯轨道巡逻舰</color>面前证明你的勇气！！！

@p9所有<color=#ff0000>兹瑞克斯轨道巡逻舰</color>都配备了<color=#ff0000>极化船体护盾</color>。你需要<color=#ff0000>击破</color>敌人的<color=#ff0000>护盾</color>才能尝试登船。@w2但务必小心，因为许多<color=#ff0000>主力舰护盾</color>即使在归零后也能再生。@w2强烈建议你使用自己的主力舰或重型武装的小型飞船来进行尝试。

@p9一旦<color=#ff0000>巡逻舰的护盾</color>被击破，你需要<color=#ff0000>摧毁</color>它所有的尾部<color=#fed43e>推进器</color>以停止飞船。@w2无法登上移动中的主力舰，因此必须停下敌方飞船。

@p9最后，你需要进入主力舰，找到并<color=#ff0000>摧毁</color>其核心。@w2不过要小心巡逻舰的船员，他们会以致命武力反击。@w2建议你带上<color=#0084ff>医疗兵</color>和其他支援人员协助这次<color=#ff0000>攻击</color>。
@w4如果没有<color=#0084ff>医疗兵</color>可用，记得带上足够的<color=#0084ff>医疗用品</color>，并在附近保留一艘配备了<color=#0084ff>医疗站</color>或<color=#0084ff>紧急传送器</color>的主力舰，这样你可以在目标附近安全重生。

@p9祝你好运{PlayerName}！这将是你最艰巨的任务！

English:
Now that you're spending more time on the Station, you should add Oxygen and Ventilation systems to it. @w2 Don't forget to make each section air tight. 

@w2 It appears that there is already a ventilation shaft that travels throughout the station. If you were to make the entire station air tight, one Ventilator should be able to provide oxygen to the entire station. @w2 However, I'd recommend starting with the <color=#ffc800>Engineering </color>section, and then working to get the rest of the station airtight as you get to it.

@w2 Place an Oxygen Tank and Ventilator to the Station.

Chinese (simplified):
既然你现在在空间站上待的时间更多了，你应该给它添加氧气和通风系统。@w2别忘了让每个区域都保持气密。

@w2看来有一个贯穿空间站的通风井。如果你能让整个空间站气密，一台通风机就能为整个空间站提供氧气。@w2不过，我建议从<color=#ffc800>工程</color>区域开始，然后在改造其他区域时再让它们气密。

@w2在空间站上放置一个氧气罐和通风机。

English:
Because <color=#ffc800>resources</color> are so rare in this galaxy, it's important to make the most of the <color=#ffc800>resources </color>you can <color=#ff00f7>find</color>. @w2 Auto-miners are a very efficient and useful way to <color=#ffc800>gather resources</color>. 


@w4 While the <color=#ffc800>Auto Miner Core</color> required for an <color=#ffc800>Auto Miner</color> <i>CAN </i>be built in an <color=#ffc800>Advanced Constructor</color>, they can also be <color=#ff00f7>found </color>as loot in various <color=#ff0000>POIs</color>. 



@p6 You should attempt to make use of any <color=#ffc800>Auto Miner Cores</color> you <color=#ff00f7>find</color>, and begin <color=#ffc800>mining </color>any <color=#ffc800>valuable resource deposits</color> you find.

@w4 Craft five <color=#ffc800>Auto-Miners</color> (of any Tier).

Despite the large number of junk in the galaxy, the civilizations you will discover are often quite advanced. @w2 Many such civilizations make use of <color=#ffc800>teleportation technology</color> to allow their citizens to travel from place to place quickly. 

@w4 If you had a <color=#ffc800>Teleporter</color>, you could teleport to and from friendly bases and vessels. 

@w6 Place a <color=#ffc800>Teleporter </color>on a Base or Capital Vessel.

Chinese (simplified):
尽管星系中有大量垃圾，但你将发现的文明通常相当先进。@w2 许多这样的文明利用<color=#ffc800>传送技术</color>让他们的公民快速地在不同地点间旅行。

@w4 如果你有一个<color=#ffc800>传送器</color>，你就可以在友方基地和飞船之间传送。

@w6 在基地或主力舰上放置一个<color=#ffc800>传送器</color>。

English:
The Rados Com Array we used <color=#ff00f7>detected </color>three signals similar to the one from the Destroyed Alien Obelisk.

@p9 The signals were coming from three planets in this solar system:
@w4 The Lava planet called Krin Orntell, 
@w2 The Arid planet called Zasha Orntell; 
@w2 And the forest moon of the Gas Giant Exana Orntell. 

@w6 I suggest traveling to these planets and attempting to <color=#ff00f7>find</color> and <color=#ff00f7>scan </color>the obelisks emitting these signals to learn more.

Chinese (simplified):
我们使用的拉多斯通信阵列<color=#ff00f7>探测到</color>三个与摧毁的外星方尖碑相似的信号。

@p9 这些信号来自这个太阳系中的三颗星球：
@w4 名为克林·奥恩特尔的熔岩星球，
@w2 名为扎莎·奥恩特尔的干旱星球；
@w2 以及气态巨星埃克萨娜·奥恩特尔的森林卫星。

@w6 我建议前往这些星球，尝试<color=#ff00f7>找到</color>并<color=#ff00f7>扫描</color>发射这些信号的方尖碑，以了解更多信息。

