English:
…COMPILING SCAN DATA…


@w4 The translation seems to be complete! Although the meaning of the message is a bit... cryptic.

@p9 The message reads:

@w6 @d8 TRAVELERS OF THE NIGHT, BEWARE THE ONES FROM BEYOND, FOR THEY HAVE RETURNED!
@w2 THROUGH THE FORSAKEN GATE THEY HAVE ARRIVED AMIDST THE CURSED PLANET BEYOND THE DARKENED EYE!
@w2 THROUGH THE ETERNAL DARK, THEY SAIL AMIDST THE SEA OF STARS, LOOKING FOR MORE SOULS TO CONDEMN!
@w2 BEWARE THE ONES FROM BEYOND!
@w2 BEWARE THE ONES FROM BEYOND! @d3

@p9 The signal seems to be coming from the Barren Planet of Vextar Orntell. Perhaps if we locate the signal's source, we can determine more about its origin!

@p9 Make your way to Vextar Orntell in order to <color=#ff00f7>locate </color>the source of the Mysterious Signal.

Chinese (simplified):
…扫描数据编译中…


@w4 翻译似乎完成了！虽然消息的含义有点……晦涩。

@p9 消息内容如下：

@w6 @d8 黑夜的旅人，当心来自彼岸者，因为他们已经归来！
@w2 他们通过被遗弃之门抵达了黑暗之眼背后的诅咒星球！
@w2 在永恒的黑暗中，他们在星辰之海中航行，寻找更多可诅咒的灵魂！
@w2 当心来自彼岸者！
@w2 当心来自彼岸者！@d3 

@p9 信号似乎来自贫瘠星球维克斯塔·奥恩特尔。也许如果我们找到信号源，就能更多地了解它的起源！

@p9 前往维克斯塔·奥恩特尔，以便<color=#ff00f7>定位</color>神秘信号的源头。

English:
{PlayerName}, this is definitely the source of the Mysterious Signal. @w2 This panel indicates that the signal was indeed intended as a warning. I will scan the structure to try and determine its origin.

@w4 ...ANALYZING...  
@w2 ...ANALYZING...
@w2 ...COMPILING DATA...

@p9 The writing and architecture of this structure seem to indicate it was constructed by an ancient civilization that once thrived in this galaxy. My record archive indicates that a Ziggurat of similar construction was found on a planet known as the Jewel of Vertron, which orbits a Black Hole. Perhaps this is the 'Darkened Eye' the message warned us of. We should <color=#ee00ff>look for</color> the Black Hole named 'Vertron' and take a closer look at the Ziggurat.

Chinese (simplified):
{PlayerName}，这绝对是神秘信号的源头。@w2 这个面板显示该信号确实是一个警告。我将扫描这个结构，试图确定它的来源。

@w4 ...分析中...  
@w2 ...分析中...
@w2 ...数据编译中...

@p9 该结构的文字和建筑风格似乎表明它是由曾经在这个星系繁荣过的古老文明建造的。我的存档记录显示，在一个名为维尔特朗之宝的星球上发现了类似构造的齐格拉特，该星球绕黑洞运行。也许这就是消息中警告我们的'黑暗之眼'。我们应该<color=#ee00ff>寻找</color>名为'维尔特朗'的黑洞，并仔细观察那个齐格拉特。

English:
@d6 I see... 
@d3 @w2 In that case, may I see your credentials?

@p9 @d0 Ah! @w1 <color=#006eff>Medical Rank 4</color>! @w1 Excellent! 
@w2 @d3 We've been looking for someone with your <color=#006eff>medical experience</color> for some time. 
@p9 We have a problem on the surface that could use your assistance. @w2 Unfortunately, we cannot allow any vehicles to enter the planet's atmosphere, but you're being cleared to teleport to Quarantine Base Alpha on the planet.
@w4 The Access Code for the Teleporter is <color=#ffc800>8521</color>.

@w4 Once you arrive, talk to the security chief. @w2 He'll explain the situation in detail.

Chinese (simplified):
@d6 我明白了... 
@d3 @w2 这样的话，能让我看看你的证件吗？

@p9 @d0 啊！@w1 <color=#006eff>医疗等级4</color>！@w1 太棒了！
@w2 @d3 我们一直在寻找像你这样具备<color=#006eff>医疗经验</color>的人。
@p9 地面上有个问题需要你的帮助。@w2 不幸的是，我们不允许任何飞行器进入星球大气层，但你已经获准传送到星球上的阿尔法隔离基地。
@w4 传送器的访问代码是<color=#ffc800>8521</color>。

@w4 到达后，去找安保主管谈谈。@w2 他会详细说明情况。

English:
Welcome to Quarantine Base Alpha, Doctor {PlayerName}. @w2 Administrator Vrelk told me to expect you. 

@w4 We have a problem that you might be uniquely suited to solve. @w2 In order to deal with the biological contaminant, we've sent out several teams of <color=#006eff>medical research</color> personnel to investigate certain structures that we believe may be responsible for the contaminant. 

@p9 However, one of the teams we sent out has failed to check in for over a week now. @w2 We fear they may have been killed, or become infected. @w2 We'd like you to locate them and assess their condition. 

@p9 Regardless of what you find, we'd like you to obtain any <color=#006eff>research data</color> that they may have gathered and report back here with their findings. @w2 The researchers were investigating a Mysterious Structure several kilometers away. @w2 I'll upload the coordinates to your PDA. 

@w4 Good Luck, Doctor.

Thank God! @w2 I was worried the PMA had abandoned us. @w4 We've been stuck down here for... @w1God, I don't know how long. 
@w4 It's hard to tell time down here, but it must have been at least a week.

@w4 Where's the rest of the rescue team... @w4 Please don't tell me you're all they sent.

That figures. Goddamn bureaucrats care more about the damned <color=#006eff>research </color>than their own people.
@w4 Look, @w1Doctor, @w1you might as well get comfortable here. @w4 There's no way out, or at least none we could find. 

@p9 Feel free to use any of the supplies and devices we have here.
@w6 If you're intent on taking our <color=#006eff>research </color>back to the PMA, @w1you'll have to find your own way out of here. 

@p9 We had a <color=#006eff>research lab</color> set up on the lowest level, but that floor became unstable and it was abandoned. @w2 Any <color=#006eff>research </color>we have left would be down there. @w2 However, only our Chief Biochemist had the code to our <color=#006eff>research locker</color>, where all our <color=#006eff>research </color>was kept, and he disappeared a few days ago. @w2 He's probably dead, but if you find his body, he may have written down the code somewhere. If you happen to get in there, there's some extra <color=#006eff>medical supplies</color> in there as well.

{PlayerName}, now that you've become a notable member of the <color=#006eff>medical community</color>, thanks to your actions in aiding Polaris in their quarantine problem, you will need to increase your <color=#006eff>medical capabilities</color>. @w2In order to do that, you'll need to set up a large <color=#006eff>medical </color><color=#ff6f00>garden</color>. 

@p9 In order to keep up with demand, you'll need at least eighteen <color=#ff6f00>crop plots</color>, which will require at least two <color=#ff6f00>Growing Lights</color>.
@w2 Whether you salvage the devices or craft them, is up to you.

Nicely Done! 

@w4Now we need to <color=#ff6f00>plant </color>at least three of each of the following <color=#006eff>medical ingredients</color>:
@w1Aloe Vera - Herbal Leaves
@w1Fiber Plant - Fiber
@w1Ahex Plants - Plant Protein
@w1Mushrooms - Mushrooms
@w1Spice Plant - Spice
@w1Kavae or Coffee - Natural Stimulant

Chinese (simplified):
做得好！

@w4现在我们需要<color=#ff6f00>种植</color>以下每种<color=#006eff>医疗成分</color>至少三棵：
@w1芦荟 - 草药叶
@w1纤维植物 - 纤维
@w1阿赫克斯植物 - 植物蛋白
@w1蘑菇 - 蘑菇
@w1香料植物 - 香料
@w1卡瓦或咖啡 - 天然兴奋剂

English:
@q0 With the <color=#ff0000>Alien Drone Base</color> out of commission, you shouldn't have to worry about any more <color=#ff0000>drone attacks</color> on your base, and the <color=#ff0000>Aliens </color>now know just how <color=#04ff00>formidable </color>you are!

Congratulations! You've achieved Rank 5 of <color=#04ff00>Combat</color>!

@p9 You can now proceed to unlock an additional Specialization!
@w4 Alternatively, you can choose to gain Unlock Points to unlock additional devices or items that you already have access to.

@w4 @d6 The Choice Is Yours!

@q0 You helped out Polaris and gained 5000 reputation with them plus you've been given 50,000 credits as a reward. 

Congratulations! You've achieved Rank 5 of <color=#006eff>Medical</color>!

@p9 You can now proceed to unlock an additional Specialization!
@w4 Alternatively, you can choose to gain Unlock Points to unlock additional devices or items that you already have access to.

@w4 @d6 The Choice Is Yours!

@q0 Congratulations! You've achieved Rank 5 of <color=#ff00f7>Exploration</color>!

@p9 You can now proceed to unlock an additional Specialization!
@w4 Alternatively, you can choose to gain Unlock Points to unlock additional devices or items that you already have access to.

@w4 @d6 The Choice Is Yours!

@q0 Now that your Space Station has been <color=#ffc800>equipped </color>and <color=#ffc800>upgraded</color>, you can continue to <color=#ffc800>repair </color>the rest of the station and make <color=#ffc800>additional improvements</color> as you see fit.

Congratulations! You've achieved Rank 5 of <color=#ffc800>Engineering</color>!

@p9 You can now proceed to unlock an additional Specialization!
@w4 Alternatively, you can choose to gain Unlock Points to unlock additional devices or items that you already have access to.

@w4 @d6 The Choice Is Yours!

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 现在你的空间站已经<tag n="78">装备</tag n="79"/>和<tag n="80">升级</tag n="81"/>完毕，你可以继续<tag n="82">修复</tag n="83">空间站的其余部分，并根据需要进行<tag n="84">额外改进</tag n="85"/>。

恭喜！你已达到<tag n="86">工程</tag n="87"/>等级5！

@p9 你现在可以解锁额外的专长了！
@w4 或者，你可以选择获得解锁点数，以解锁你已经能够访问的额外装置或物品。

@w4 <tag n="91">选择权在你手中！

English:
It appears you've <color=#ff00f7>found </color>a Destroyed Alien Obelisk! @w2 This is an excellent find!

@p4 Sensors indicate a low-level energy signal emanating from the Obelisk, despite it's damaged state. @w2 I'll begin analyzing it and let you know what I find.

@w6 This could take a while. @w4 In the mean time, you should continue with your next mission.

Chinese (simplified):
看来你<color=#ff00f7>发现</color>了一个被摧毁的外星方尖碑！@w2 这是个极好的发现！

@p4 传感器显示方尖碑散发出微弱的能量信号，尽管它已受损。@w2 我会开始分析并告诉你我的发现。

@w6 这可能需要一段时间。@w4 同时，你应该继续你的下一个任务。

English:
The Destroyed Alien Obelisk you <color=#ff00f7>found </color>was luckily close by. @w2 However, most POIs you'll try to <color=#ff00f7>find </color>won't be so close.

@w4 Scout Vessels are Small Vessels that are designed to cover large areas of ground quickly, while being highly maneuverable and capable of <color=#ff00f7>detecting </color>nearby POIs.

@p9 As a <color=#ff00f7>scout</color>, you have the capability of <color=#ffc800>building </color>a Scout Vessel from scratch, and equipping it with a <color=#ffc800>Graviton Thrust Drive</color>, which will take the place of the forward, rear, and side <color=#ffc800>thrusters </color>for purposes of <color=#ffc800>thrust</color>. @w2 This will allow you to design an efficient Scout Vessel, without the help of an <color=#ffc800>Engineer</color>.

@w4 Once you have your Scout Vessel completed, you will be able to <color=#ff00f7>locate </color>POIs on the surface of the planet much easier.

Chinese (simplified):
你<color=#ff00f7>发现</color>的已摧毁的外星方尖碑幸运地就在附近。 @w2然而，你试图<color=#ff00f7>寻找</color>的大多数兴趣点不会这么近。

@w4侦察飞船是专为快速覆盖大片地面区域而设计的小型飞船，同时具有高度的机动性，能够<color=#ff00f7>探测</color>附近的兴趣点。

@p9作为<color=#ff00f7>侦察兵</color>，你有能力<color=#ffc800>建造</color>一架侦察飞船，并为其配备<color=#ffc800>引力子推进驱动器</color>，它将取代前、后和侧面的<color=#ffc800>推进器</color>，用于产生<color=#ffc800>推力</color>。 @w2这将让你无需<color=#ffc800>工程师</color>的帮助，就能设计出一架高效的侦察飞船。

@w4一旦你的侦察飞船建造完成，你将能更轻松地在星球表面<color=#ff00f7>定位</color>兴趣点。

