@w4 The Desert planet called Or Madra,
@w2 The Snow planet called Uropea;
@w2 And the Alien planet called Nomspera.

@w6 I suggest traveling to these planets and attempting to <color=#ff00f7>find</color> and <color=#ff00f7>scan </color>the obelisks emitting these signals to learn more.

