@w4 Like I initially thought, the obelisks all seem to be transmitting some sort of warning.

@p9 While the message from the three undamaged Obelisks seems to be fully intact, I can't seem to decipher the language used.
@w4 In order to decipher the message, we'll have to travel to the source of the signal. @w2 The signal seems to be coming from the Barren Planet of Resona.

@p9 Make your way to Resona in order to <color=#ff00f7>locate </color>the source of the Mysterious Signal.

Chinese (simplified):
……编译扫描数据……


@w4 正如我最初所想，这些方尖碑似乎都在传输某种警告。

@p9 虽然三个未损坏的方尖碑的消息似乎是完整的，但我似乎无法破译所使用的语言。
@w4 为了破译消息，我们必须前往信号的源头。@w2 信号似乎来自荒芜星球Resona。

@p9 前往Resona，以便<color=#ff00f7>定位</color>神秘信号的源头。

English:
{PlayerName}, this is definitely the source of the Mysterious Signal. @w2 From here, I can attempt to translate the message from the signal:

@w6 @d8 TRAVELERS OF THE NIGHT, BEWARE THE ONES FROM BEYOND, FOR THEY HAVE RETURNED!
@w2 THROUGH THE FORSAKEN GATE THEY HAVE ARRIVED AMIDST THE CURSED PLANET BEYOND THE DARKENED EYE!
@w2 THROUGH THE ETERNAL DARK, THEY SAIL AMIDST THE SEA OF STARS, LOOKING FOR MORE SOULS TO CONDEMN!
@w2 BEWARE THE ONES FROM BEYOND!
@w2 BEWARE THE ONES FROM BEYOND!
@d3
@p9 That seems to be the best translation I can provide. @w2 I will analyze this further to attempt to ascertain its meaning.

Chinese (simplified):
