@w6 @d8 黑夜的旅行者们，当心界外之人，因为他们已经回归！
@w2 他们穿过被遗弃之门，降临在黑暗之眼背后的诅咒星球之中！
@w2 他们穿越永恒黑暗，航行于星海之间，寻找更多灵魂来定罪！
@w2 当心界外之人！
@w2 当心界外之人！
@d3
@p9 这似乎是我能提供的最佳翻译。@w2 我会进一步分析，试图确定其含义。

English:
@d6 I see...
@d3 @w2 In that case, may I see your credentials?

@p9 @d0 Ah! @w1 <color=#006eff>Medical Rank 4</color>! @w1 Excellent!
@w2 @d3 We've been looking for someone with your <color=#006eff>medical experience</color> for some time.
@p9 We have a problem on the surface that could use your assistance. @w2 Unfortunately, we cannot allow any vehicles to enter the planet's atmosphere, but you're being cleared to teleport to Quarantine Base Beta on the planet.
@w4 The Access Code for the Teleporter is <color=#ffc800>1377</color>.

@w4 Once you arrive, talk to the security chief. @w2 He'll explain the situation in detail.

Chinese (simplified):
@d6 我明白了……
@d3 @w2 那样的话，我能看看你的证件吗？

@p9 @d0 啊！@w1 <color=#006eff>医疗4级</color>！@w1 太好了！
@w2 @d3 我们一直在寻找像你这样有<color=#006eff>医疗经验</color>的人已经有一段时间了。
@p9 我们在星球表面有一个问题需要你的帮助。@w2 不幸的是，我们不能允许任何飞行器进入星球大气层，但你已被批准传送到星球上的贝塔隔离基地。
@w4 传送器的访问代码是<color=#ffc800>1377</color>。

@w4 到达后，找安全酋长谈谈。@w2 他会详细说明情况。

English:
Welcome to Quarantine Base Beta, Doctor {PlayerName}. @w2 Administrator Berel told me to expect you.

@w4 We have a problem that you might be uniquely suited to solve. @w2 In order to deal with the biological contaminant, we've sent out several teams of <color=#006eff>medical research</color> personnel to investigate certain structures that we believe may be responsible for the contaminant.

@p9 One of our research teams located a Mysterious Structure several kilometers away that showed promise. @w2 Despite some initial setbacks, they managed to set up a working lab and began to study some of the mysterious substances found inside. @w2 Now they are in need of additional <color=#0062ff>Medical Supplies</color>, but such supplies require <color=#0062ff>Medical Personnel </color>of at least Rank 4 to transport through such dangerous an area.

@p9 Your job will be to take these <color=#0062ff>Medical Supplies</color> to the researchers, then report back to me. @w2 I'll upload the coordinates of the Mysterious Structure to your PDA.

@w4 Good Luck, Doctor.

Chinese (simplified):
欢迎来到贝塔隔离基地，{PlayerName}博士。@w2 贝雷尔主管告诉我你会来。

@w4 我们有一个问题，你或许特别适合解决。@w2 为了处理生物污染物，我们派出了几组<color=#006eff>医学研究</color>人员去调查一些我们认为可能是污染物来源的建筑。

@p9 我们的一支研究团队在几公里外发现了一个有希望的神秘建筑。@w2 尽管初始有些挫折，他们还是设法建立了一个工作实验室，开始研究内部发现的一些神秘物质。@w2 现在他们需要额外的<color=#0062ff>医疗用品</color>，但这样的用品需要至少4级的<color=#0062ff>医务人员</color>才能通过如此危险的区域运送。

@p9 你的任务是将这些<color=#0062ff>医疗用品</color>带给研究人员，然后回来向我汇报。@w2 我会将神秘建筑的坐标上传到你的个人数字助理（PDA）。

@w4 祝你好运，博士。

English:
@d6 Data Transmitting...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 @d3 Receiving incoming transmission...

