English:
Great! @w2 With this data we can try and determine what type of energy is animating these hulks!
@w2 While we're analysing the data, why don't you make sure the ghost ship drifting off by <color=#f90b17>taking out its thrusters.</color>

@w2 We'll contact you when we have a preliminary analysis of the data.

Chinese (simplified):
太棒了！@w2 有了这些数据，我们就能确定是什么能量在驱动这些庞然大物！
@w2 在我们分析数据的时候，你不如去<color=#f90b17>拆除那艘幽灵船的推进器</color>，让它停下来。

@w2 等我们对数据有了初步分析，会联系你的。

English:
@q0 Nicely done, {PlayerName}. @w4 Our scientists will begin studying this <color=#57a86b>Ectoplasm </color>immediately. 

@w4 As promised, your credits are being transferred to you now, and we will spread the word of your aid to all of Polaris. 

@p9 If you ever find yourself in possession of a large quantity of <color=#57a86b>Ectoplasm</color>, contact us and we will gladly provide you appropriate compensation. 

@w4 Thanks again, {PlayerName}. @w2 Safe travels!

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 干得好，{PlayerName}。

@w4 我们的科学家将立即开始研究这种<color=#57a86b>灵质</color>。

@w4 如约，你的信用点正在转给你，我们会将你的帮助事迹传遍整个极星。

@p9 如果你将来拥有大量<color=#57a86b>灵质</color>，请联系我们，我们会很高兴为你提供相应的报酬。

@w4 再次感谢，{PlayerName}。@w2 一路平安！

English:
@q0
<color=#00ffee>Emergency situation detected!</color>
@w2 Termination of suspended animation complete...
@w4 Welcome back, {PlayerName}.
@w4 I'm afraid I must inform you that we have not arrived at our intended destination.
@p9 Furthermore, assessment of the damage to the Cryo Module indicates that it has been in it's current position for at least 10 Earth years, @w1 possibly more.
@w4 What limited information I have indicates that the Cryo Module has been ejected from the <color=#3333e5>UES Taurus</color>, and has crashed on a planet with a breathable atmosphere. @w2 Beyond that, I have no other information.
@p9 Perhaps one of the consoles in this Module retains some information about the situation.

@w4 Try to find a working console, and I'll see if I can retrieve any data.

Chinese (simplified):
@q0
<color=#00ffee>检测到紧急情况！</color>
@w2 终止休眠状态...完成。
@w4 欢迎回来，{PlayerName}。
@w4 恐怕我必须通知您，我们并未抵达原定目的地。
@p9 此外，对低温模块损坏情况的评估显示，它已在当前位置停留了至少10个地球年，@w1 甚至更久。
@w4 根据我掌握的有限信息，低温模块已从<color=#3333e5>UES 金牛座</color>中被弹出，并坠毁在一颗拥有可呼吸大气层的星球上。@w2 除此之外，我别无其他信息。
@p9 或许这个模块中有一台控制台保留着一些关于当前情况的信息。

@w4 试着找一台能工作的控制台，我会看看能否检索到数据。

English:
@q0 This terminal appears to be working. 
@w2 Attempting data retrieval...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...data retrieval complete.

@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the captain of the <color=#3333e5>UES Taurus</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 Arrival Log, Entry 2
@w2 It appears that the inhabitants of this galaxy are not as friendly as we hoped. @w1 An alien ship of unknown origin arrived soon after we began broadcasting our distress signal. @w1 But instead of coming to our aid, they attacked us without warning. @w1 We are currently on an uncontrolled collision course with the planet. @w2 I have ordered that the attached Modules be ejected, so that if we happen to explode on impact, @w1 they might survive.
@w4 -Captain Branson

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 这个终端似乎还能工作。
@w2 尝试检索数据...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...数据检索完成。

@w2 我从<color=#3333e5>UES 金牛座</color>的船长那里发现了一份日志。@w2 开始播放。

@p9 抵达日志，第2条
@w2 看来这个星系的居民并不像我们期望的那样友好。@w1 我们发出求救信号后不久，一艘来历不明的外星飞船就出现了。@w1 但他们没有来帮助我们，反而毫无预警地攻击了我们。@w1 我们现在正失控地朝这颗星球撞去。@w2 我已命令将附带的模块弹出，这样如果我们不幸撞毁，@w1 它们或许能幸存下来。
@w4 ——布兰森船长

English:
@q0 This terminal appears to be working. 
@w2 Attempting data retrieval...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...data retrieval complete.

@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the captain of the <color=#3333e5>UES Taurus</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 Arrival Log, Entry 1
@w2 We have emerged from the mysterious anomaly intact, but crippled. @w2 My helmsman tells me that we are no longer in the Milky Way galaxy, but rather somewhere in the Andromeda galaxy. @w2 Our ship is on emergency power, and we have been separated from the rest of the fleet. 
@p9 I have diverted what power we can spare to the CryoPods in hopes that they will continue to function until we can meet back with the fleet.  @w2 We have began broadcasting a distress signal, in hopes that the rest of the fleet will receive it. @w1 I hope any aliens that might pick up our signal are friendly, or else we will definitely be in trouble.
@w4 -Captain Branson

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 这个终端似乎工作正常。 
@w2 正在尝试数据检索...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...数据检索完成。

@w2 我发现了一条来自<color=#3333e5>UES金牛座</color>舰长的日志条目。@w2 开始播放。

@p9 抵达日志，条目1
@w2 我们完整地穿过了这个神秘异常，但已经受损严重。@w2 我的舵手告诉我，我们已不在银河系，而是在仙女座星系的某处。@w2 我们的飞船靠紧急电源运行，并且与舰队其他成员失散了。
@p9 我将我们能节省下来的电力转移到了低温休眠舱，希望它们能持续运行直到我们与舰队会合。@w2 我们已开始广播遇险信号，希望舰队其他成员能收到。@w1 我希望任何可能接收到我们信号的外星生物是友好的，否则我们肯定会陷入麻烦。
@w4 ——布兰森舰长

English:
I've saved the Log record in your Journey Book in your PDA. @w2 You should try to find more crew logs. @w2 Any time you find another crew log, I'll record it in your Journey Book. 

@p9 It appears that the <color=#3333e5>UES Taurus</color> was attacked by a species native to this galaxy. @w2 If I could link to the Taurus' communications system, I may be able to pick up signals from the area and learn more about this race. 

@w2 I'll try and scan the area,. @w2 I might pick up the <color=#3333e5>UES Taurus</color> distress signal, @w1 if it's still active.

@p9 While I scan the area, I suggest you review your Basic Training courses. @w2 I'll let you know when I find something..

Chinese (simplified):
我已将日志记录保存在你PDA的旅途日志中。@w2你应该尝试找到更多船员日志。@w2每当你找到另一份船员日志，我都会记录到你的旅途日志中。

@p9看起来<color=#3333e5>UES 金牛座</color>曾遭到这个星系原住民物种的攻击。@w2如果我能连接到金牛座的通讯系统，也许能接收到该区域的信号，了解更多关于这个种族的信息。

@w2我会尝试扫描这片区域。@w2我可能会接收到<color=#3333e5>UES 金牛座</color>的求救信号，@w1如果它还在运作的话。

@p9在我扫描区域的时候，我建议你复习一下基础训练课程。@w2我找到什么时会通知你的。

English:
@q0 This terminal appears to be working. 
@w2 Attempting data retrieval...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...data retrieval complete.

@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the captain of the <color=#3333e5>UES Taurus</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 Arrival Log, Entry 3
@w2 Somehow, the Taurus survived the crash landing without exploding. We managed to eject only two of the attached Modules before entering the atmosphere, one of which was the Cargo Module. @w2 Why Doctor Vlach decided to dump the Cargo Module, instead of one of the Cryo Modules to save more passengers, I cannot say. @w2 I would ask him, but, @w1 unfortunately, @w1 he and my helmsman didn't survive the crash.
@p9 With just me and Engineer Flores alive, I plan on making the best of the situation and seeing if we can find the Cargo Module to at least recover the cargo we lost. @w2 Perhaps there's something in there, or elsewhere on this Junkyard of a planet, that can help us contact the fleet.
@w4 -Captain Branson

Chinese (simplified):
@q0这个终端似乎还能用。
@w2正在尝试数据恢复...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...数据恢复完成。

@w2我找到了一份来自<color=#3333e5>UES 金牛座</color>舰长的日志条目。@w2开始播放。

@p9抵达日志，条目 3
@w2不知怎么的，金牛座在坠毁中幸存了下来，没有爆炸。我们设法在进入大气层前只弹出了两个附属模块，其中之一是货舱。@w2为什么弗拉赫医生决定抛弃货舱，而不是抛弃一个冷冻舱来拯救更多乘客，我说不上来。@w2我会问他，但是，@w1不幸的是，@w1他和我的舵手都没能在坠毁中幸存。
@p9只有我和工程师弗洛雷斯活着，我计划充分利用这种情况，看看能否找到货舱，至少回收我们丢失的货物。@w2也许那里或这个星球垃圾场的其他地方有东西能帮我们联系上舰队。
@w4 ——布兰森舰长

English:
@q0 This terminal appears to be working. 
@w2 Attempting data retrieval...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...data retrieval complete.

@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the engineer of the <color=#3333e5>UES Taurus</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 Engineering Log, Entry 1
@w2  The mysterious anomaly we traversed seems to have drained most of the ship's power. @w2 The Captain had me divert what little power we have left to the Cryo Chambers. @w2 We set course toward what appears to be a Temperate planet, in hopes that others from our fleet will do the same, @w1 if they're even nearby. @w2 I've tried to convince the Captain that we should land and try to revive as many of the passengers as we can, @w1 but he insists on trying to contact the fleet by sending out a distress signal. @w2 I hope his adherence to regulations doesn't get us killed.
@w4 -Engineer Flores

