English:
{PlayerName}, @w1 I have located an energy signature that matches the distress signal of the <color=#3333e5>UES Taurus</color>!

@w2 It's not too far away. @w1 You should head toward the signal. @w2 At the very least, we should find out what happened to the rest of the ship and crew.

@p9 You should try to use your Survival Tool to gather up as many resources as possible on the way. Use the Resource Mode to gather surface rubble that contain various Scrap and Components. @w2 Don't forget to pick any useful plants on the way.

