English:
@q0 Now you should be able to breath easier. However...

@w4 I'm afraid I must inform you that we have not arrived at our intended destination.
@p9 Furthermore, assessment of the damage to the Cryo Module indicates that it has been in it's current position for just over two Earth years.
@w4 What limited information I have indicates that the Cryo Module has been ejected from the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo</color>, and has crashed on a planet with an unbreathable atmosphere. @w2 Beyond that, I have no other information.
@p9 Perhaps one of the consoles in this Module retains some information about the situation.

@w4 Try to find a working console, and I'll see if I can retrieve any data.

Chinese (simplified):
@q0现在你应该能呼吸得更顺畅了。不过...

@w4恐怕我必须通知你，我们并没有抵达预定的目的地。
@p9此外，对冷冻舱损坏情况的评估显示，它已在当前位置停留了超过两个地球年。
@w4我掌握的有限信息表明，冷冻舱已从<color=#3333e5>UES 利奥号</color>弹出，并坠毁在一个大气无法呼吸的星球上。@w2除此之外，我没有其他信息。
@p9也许这个舱内的某个控制台还保留着关于情况的一些信息。

@w4试着找一个能用的控制台，我来看看能否恢复任何数据。

English:
I've saved the Log record in your Journey Book in your PDA. @w2 You should try to find more crew logs. @w2 Any time you find another crew log, I'll record it in your Journey Book. 

@p9 It appears that the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo</color> was attacked by a species native to this galaxy. @w2 If I could link to the Leo's' communications system, I may be able to pick up signals from the area and learn more about this race.

@w2 I'll try and scan the area,. @w2 I might pick up the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo's</color> distress signal, @w1 if it's still active.

@p9 While I scan the area, I suggest you review your Basic Training courses. @w2 I'll let you know when I find something..

