@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the captain of the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 Arrival Log, Entry 2
@w2 It was a mistake sending out a distress call. @w2 When we first detected the approaching signal, @w1 we thought that one of the other <color=#3333e5>United Earth Ships</color> had found us. @w2 We couldn't have been more wrong. 

@p9 The ship that found us was of an unknown alien design. @w2 They opened fire on us as soon as they were in range. @w2 We're heading toward an Arid planet nearby, hoping to evade our pursuers. @w2 I have ordered that the attached Cryo Modules be ejected, so that if we don't make it, @w1 perhaps our passengers can survive.
@w4 -Captain Earling

