English:
@q0 This terminal appears to be working.
@w2 Attempting data retrieval...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...data retrieval complete.

@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the captain of the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 Arrival Log, Entry 1
@w2 After emerging from the mysterious anomaly, @w1 Doctor Bonilla revived the rest of the flight crew. @w2 Ensign Caplin has determined that the anomaly has, somehow, transported us over two and a half million light years into the Andromeda Galaxy. 
@p9 Our ship’s chronometer says that we’ve only been in stasis for around four months. @w2 However, @w1 based on star and galaxy positions, our computer has calculated that it’s been around 600 years since we left Earth. @w2 I’m not sure how to explain this discrepancy other than the anomaly somehow transported us through time as well.
@p9 In addition to all that, we don't seem to have emerged in the same location as the rest of the fleet. @w4 I'm not sure if it's a good idea, @w1 but I plan on activating our distress beacon, hoping that the fleet isn't too far away to receive it.

@w4 -Captain Earling

