@w2 从神秘的异常中脱离后，@w1 博尼拉医生唤醒了其余飞行人员。 @w2 卡普林少尉确定，这个异常不知何故将我们传送到了仙女座星系中超过二百五十万光年的地方。 
@p9 我们的飞船计时器显示我们只处于休眠状态大约四个月。 @w2 然而，@w1 根据恒星和星系的位置，我们的计算机计算出我们离开地球已经大约600年了。 @w2 我不知道如何解释这种差异，除了这个异常也以某种方式穿越了时间。
@p9 除此之外，我们似乎并没有和舰队其余部分出现在同一地点。 @w4 我不确定这是否是个好主意，@w1 但我计划激活我们的求救信标，希望舰队没有远到无法接收。

@w4 -船长厄林

English:
@q0 This terminal appears to be working.
@w2 Attempting data retrieval...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...data retrieval complete.

@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the captain of the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 Arrival Log, Entry 3
@w2 All the Cryo Modules have been ejected. @w2 The alien ship has sent drones to follow them, but two of them are on trajectory for the planet. Hopefully, they will survive the crash, and someone will eventually come out of cryo stasis. @w2 The planet registers as habitable, @w1 if a little on the hot end, so theyy have a chance, unlike us. 
@p9 My last act was to order the rest of the flight crew onto Cryo Module 3, one of the two Modules with Oxygen Suits. @w2 They were supplied with the Auxiliary Ventilator and all the Emergency Rations we could find, giving them the best chance possible. @w2 Hopefully, the alien ship will continue to follow me, and they can somehow evade the drones.
@w4 -Captain Earling

