@p9 With that in mind, I have decided to begin looking for a good location to set up a new colony, @w1 while keeping our sensors active to see if we can detect any sign of the rest of the <color=#3333e5>United Earth Fleet</color>. @w2 Hopefully we won't run out of warp fuel before we can either find a suitable planet, or a new fuel source that is compatible to our warp drive.

