@p9 It appears we're going to be here alone for a while. @w2 Seeing as the <color=#3333e5>Fukushima </color>and the <color=#3333e5>Merryweather </color>were the only ships carrying legitimate medical facilities, @w1 I had to make due with what I had. @w2 I've used some left over scraps of medical equipment we had lying around to put together a Ramshackle Healing Station. @w2 It's not as useful as a full Medic Station, @w1 no built in Emergency Teleporter, @w1 but it will slowly heal someone inside.
