@w2 Attempting data retrieval...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...data retrieval complete.

@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the doctor of the <color=#3333e5>UES Speedwell</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 Medical Log, Entry 2
@w2 With so little medical supplies on hand, @w1 I'm not sure we should be the ones responding to a distress call. @w2 However, @w1 since we ARE trying to locate the rest of the fleet, @w1 and this at least seems to be a <color=#3333e5>United Earth</color> signal we're receiving, @w1 I don't see we have much choice.
@w4 I've been gathering what little supplies we do have, @w1 and believe we are ready to help, @w1 as best we can. @w2 The uncertainty of the signa's origin aside, @w1 I'm hopeful that we do, indeed, find one of the other ships from our fleet.
@w4 -Doctor Schneider

