English:
@q0 This terminal appears to be working.
@w2 Attempting data retrieval...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...data retrieval complete.

@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the doctor of the <color=#3333e5>UES Speedwell</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 *whispering* Medical Log, Entry 3
@w2 It's been nearly a day since the aliens boarded the ship. @w2 The first group set up some sort of teleport pads in the Engine Room, @w1 and more have been teleporting in ever since their ships left. 

@w4 A few hours ago, they began removing the crew from their cryo chambers. @w2 Most of them were executed instantly, @w1 but a few were taken away, @w1 presumably to be held prisoner... @w2 or worse.

@p9 I've been hiding in one of the empty cryo chambers, @w1 hoping they're too stupid to re-check the ones they already emptied. @w2 If I could somehow get one of their weapons, @w1 perhaps I could destroy the teleport pads and prevent more from boarding. @w2 if only... @w1 shit... @w1 no. *Cryo Chamber Opens* *Sreaming* NOOOOO!!!!!!!!!! *Alien growls and snarls*
@w4 *shotgun blast* *End of Log*

