English:
@q0 This terminal appears to be working.
@w2 Attempting data retrieval...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...data retrieval complete.

@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the helmsman of the <color=#3333e5>UES Speedwell</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 Helmsman Log, Entry 1
@w2  Waking up from cryo statis is often disorienting. @w1 But waking up in a different galaxy is even more so. @w2 Apart from our location being over two million lightyears from where we were, something else seems off. @w4 I can't exactly put my finger on it, @w1 but the stars and galaxies seem... @w1 @d6 off... @w1 @d3 somehow. @w4 Nobody from earth has ever seen the universe from this galaxy, @w1 so that's maybe it. 

@p9 The Captain wants us to try to continue our mission, @w1 despite the absence of the rest of the fleet. @w2 She believes that the rest of the fleet will find us, @w1 or we will find them, @w1 and somehow being stranded in an alien galaxy won't get us killed.
@w4 I wish I were so optimistic.
@w4 -Ensign Neibuhr, Helmsman

