@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the helmsman of the <color=#3333e5>UES Speedwell</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 Helmsman Log, Entry 2
@w2 It seems the captain's optimism was well founded. @w2 We seem to have picked up a distress signal coming from a nearby system. @w2 However, @w1 even though the frequency appears to be a <color=#3333e5>United Earth</color> frequency, @w1 the signal itself is unfamiliar to me. @w2 It's obviously a distress call, @w1 but it's not encoded with the ID of any of the ships of our fleet. @w2 In fact, @w1 based on the data that IS encoded, @w1 it seems to be from no ship at all... @w4 or at least not one that had been constructed before we left Earth.
@w4 -Ensign Neibuhr, Helmsman

