English:
@q0 Due to the hostile nature of the current situation, @w1 <color=#3333e5>United Earth Protocol</color> allows you to forgo Basic Training, and select a Specialization immediately.
@w4 There are four types of specialties to choose from:
@w4 <color=#59ff00>Combat</color>, <color=#ffc800>Engineering</color>, <color=#ff00f7>Exploration</color>, and <color=#006eff>Medical</color>.
@w4 Each Specialization has its own perks.
@p9 The <color=#59ff00>Combat Specialization</color> focuses on <color=#59ff00>fighting</color>. This specialization allows you to learn how to craft a wide variety of <color=#59ff00>weapons</color>, including both <color=#59ff00>hand-held</color> and <color=#59ff00>ship weapons</color> and <color=#59ff00>turrets</color>. The <color=#59ff00>Combat Specialization</color> has access to the toughest <color=#59ff00>armors</color>, as well as defensive devices, such as <color=#59ff00>Shield Generators</color>, for all manner of vessels and structures.

@p9 Ultimately, the <color=#59ff00>Combat Specialization</color> would allow you to craft a powerful <color=#59ff00>vehicle weapons</color> like the <color=#59ff00>Hellstorm Turret</color> for a Capital Vessel that can rain down <color=#59ff00>Hellfire Missiles</color> upon <color=#ff0000>enemy troops</color> and <color=#ff0000>strongholds</color>, as well as superior <color=#59ff00>hand-held weapons</color> like the <color=#59ff00>Anti-Matter Rifle</color>, a power <color=#59ff00>Sniper Rifle</color> that can obliterate structural blocks and devices.

@p9 The <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color> focuses on <color=#ffc800>construction </color>and <color=#ffc800>resource gathering</color>. While not suited for <color=#04ff00>combat </color>in almost any way, the <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color> allows you to craft advanced devices that are required for ships to fly, such as <color=#ffc800>Thrusters </color>and <color=#ffc800>RCSs</color>, as well as the ability to <color=#ffc800>craft vehicles from scratch</color> (without having to repair an existing vehicle).

@p9 The <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color> also allows you to craft <color=#ffc800>CPU Extenders</color>, <color=#ffc800>Teleporters</color>, and <color=#ffc800>Repair Bays</color>, as well as higher-tier <color=#ffc800>fuel packs</color>, all of which would otherwise have to be scavenged from junk vessels. The <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color> also grants access to a variety of <color=#ffc800>tools</color>, including the <color=#ffc800>Multitool </color>and <color=#ffc800>Drill</color>, as well as all <color=#ffc800>resource gathering</color> devices, such as <color=#ffc800>auto-miners</color>, <color=#ffc800>vehicle drills</color> and <color=#ffc800>tools turrets</color>. 

@p9 Ultimately, the <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color> would allow you to craft powerful hand tools such as the <color=#ffc800>Master Multi-Tool</color> and the <color=#ffc800>Combat Drill</color>, a powerful <color=#ffc800>drill </color>that has an <color=#04ff00>Assault </color>mode that can <color=#59ff00>demolish </color>structural blocks and deal <color=#59ff00>significant damage</color> to <color=#ff0000>enemy troops</color> as well. Additionally, the <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color> gains access to special <color=#ffc800>Experimental Technology</color> including an <color=#ffc800>Advanced Warp Drive</color> that not only has a much longer warp range than a regulars <color=#ffc800>Warp Drive</color>, but also uses much less <color=#ffc800>Warp Fuel</color> when warping between systems.

@p9 The <color=#ff00f7>Exploration Specialization</color> allows you to craft all manor of <color=#ff00f7>exploration </color>and <color=#ff00f7>detection devices</color>, such as ship <color=#ff00f7>Detectors</color>. They can also build a <color=#ff00f7>Scout Vessel</color> from scratch, and equip it with a unique <color=#ffc800>gravity-based thrust system</color> not suited for larger vessels, but perfect for light <color=#ff00f7>scout vessels</color>, in addition to a <color=#ffc800>Mid-Range Warp Drive</color> for small vessels that can travel interstellar. They can craft unique hand-held <color=#59ff00>Scout Rifles </color><color=#04ff00></color>which are a combination of a <color=#04ff00>sniper </color>and an <color=#04ff00>assault rifle</color>, and gain access to <color=#04ff00>armor </color>that is much easier to move in than others. 

@p9 Ultimately, the <color=#ff00f7>Exploration Specialization</color> would allow you to craft a powerful <color=#ff00f7>Long-Range Detector</color> for a Small Vessel that can <color=#ff00f7>scan </color>an entire planet or sector, and a <color=#ff00f7>Deep Space Radar</color> that can not only <color=#ff00f7>scan</color>, but <color=#ff00f7>identify </color>objects and vehicles at extreme ranges.

@p9 The <color=#006eff>Medical Specialization</color> allows you to craft a large variety of advanced <color=#006eff>Medicines </color>and <color=#006eff>Medical Devices</color> for ships and bases, as well as a <color=#006eff>Medical Injector</color> which allows you to heal your allies in the field. The <color=#006eff>Medical Specialization</color> also allows you to craft <color=#006eff>Medical Augments</color>, which are one-use items that grant you semi-permanent increases to one or more of your core attributes (Health, Stamina, Food), as well as providing additional effects such as <color=#006eff>Health Regeneration</color>, <color=#ff00f7>Movement Speed</color> increases, and even Temperature Regulation. The bonuses granted by an <color=#006eff>Augment </color>last until either another <color=#006eff>Augment </color>is applied or you 'die'. 

@p9 Ultimately, the <color=#006eff>Medical Specialization</color> would allow you to craft a powerful <color=#006eff>Medical Injector</color> that can also <color=#006eff>recharge </color>an ally's stamina, and has a '<color=#04ff00>Stun Beam</color>' that deals small amounts of <color=#04ff00>damage</color>, but can keep many foes at bay. (Stuns Players in PvP as well).

@p9 Once you have selected your specialization, you can begin to gain ranks in that Specialization by opening your PDA (<color=#00fbff>F1</color>) and activateing the corresponding Rank 1 Mission.

@p9 Once you reach Rank 3 in any Specialization, you will be offered the chance to complete an Advanced Training course, which will allow you to select an additional specialization if you wish, or you can gain 500 UP to help you unlock your specialization's high-tier items or devices.

@p9 Once you reach Rank 5 in any Specialization, you will be allowed to select an additional specialization if you wish, or you can gain 500 UP to help you unlock your specialization's high-tier items or devices.

@p9 Which Specialization would you like to start with?

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 由于当前局势的敌对性质，@w1 <color=#3333e5>联合国地球协议</color>允许你跳过基础训练，立即选择一项专精。
@w4 有四种专精可供选择：
@w4 <color=#59ff00>战斗</color>、<color=#ffc800>工程</color>、<color=#ff00f7>探索</color>和<color=#006eff>医疗</color>。
@w4 每种专精都有其独特的增益。
@p9 <color=#59ff00>战斗专精</color>专注于<color=#59ff00>战斗</color>。该专精让你学会制造多种多样的<color=#59ff00>武器</color>，包括<color=#59ff00>手持武器</color>、<color=#59ff00>飞船武器</color>和<color=#59ff00>炮塔</color>。<color=#59ff00>战斗专精</color>可获得最坚固的<color=#59ff00>护甲</color>，以及防御设备，例如适用于各类飞船和建筑的<color=#59ff00>护盾发生器</color>。

@p9 最终，<color=#59ff00>战斗专精</color>将让你制造强大的<color=#59ff00>载具武器</color>，例如用于主力舰的<color=#59ff00>地狱风暴炮塔</color>，可向<color=#ff0000>敌军</color>和<color=#ff0000>据点</color>倾泻<color=#59ff00>地狱火导弹</color>；以及卓越的<color=#59ff00>手持武器</color>，例如<color=#59ff00>反物质步枪</color>，一种强大的<color=#59ff00>狙击步枪</color>，可摧毁结构方块和设备。

@p9 <color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>专注于<color=#ffc800>建造</color>和<color=#ffc800>资源采集</color>。尽管几乎不适合任何<color=#04ff00>战斗</color>，但<color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>让你能制造飞船飞行所需的先进设备，例如<color=#ffc800>推进器</color>和<color=#ffc800>RCS</color>，以及<color=#ffc800>从头制造载具</color>（无需修理现有载具）的能力。

@p9 <color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>还让你能制造<color=#ffc800>CPU扩展器</color>、<color=#ffc800>传送器</color>和<color=#ffc800>维修舱</color>，以及更高级的<color=#ffc800>燃料包</color>；否则这些只能从废弃飞船上搜刮。<color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>还解锁多种<color=#ffc800>工具</color>，包括<color=#ffc800>多功能工具</color>和<color=#ffc800>钻头</color>，以及所有<color=#ffc800>资源采集</color>设备，如<color=#ffc800>自动采矿机</color>、<color=#ffc800>载具钻头</color>和<color=#ffc800>工具炮塔</color>。

@p9 最终，<color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>将让你制造强大的手持工具，例如<color=#ffc800>大师多功能工具</color>和<color=#ffc800>战斗钻头</color>，这是一种强大的<color=#ffc800>钻头</color>，拥有<color=#04ff00>突击</color>模式，可<color=#59ff00>摧毁</color>结构方块并对<color=#ff0000>敌军</color>造成<color=#59ff00>显著伤害</color>。此外，<color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>可获得特殊的<color=#ffc800>实验技术</color>，包括<color=#ffc800>高级翘曲引擎</color>，不仅翘曲范围远大于普通<color=#ffc800>翘曲引擎</color>，而且在星系间翘曲时消耗的<color=#ffc800>翘曲燃料</color>更少。

@p9 <color=#ff00f7>探索专精</color>让你能制造所有类型的<color=#ff00f7>探索</color>和<color=#ff00f7>探测设备</color>，例如飞船<color=#ff00f7>探测器</color>。他们也能从头建造<color=#ff00f7>侦察飞船</color>，并为其配备独特的<color=#ffc800>重力推进系统</color>（不适合大型飞船，但对轻型<color=#ff00f7>侦察飞船</color>完美），此外还有适用于小型飞船、可星际旅行的<color=#ffc800>中程翘曲引擎</color>。他们可以制造独特的手持<color=#59ff00>侦察步枪</color>，这是一种<color=#04ff00>狙击步枪</color>和<color=#04ff00>突击步枪</color>的结合体，并能获得比其他护甲更易移动的<color=#04ff00>护甲</color>。

@p9 最终，<color=#ff00f7>探索专精</color>将让你为小型飞船制造强大的<color=#ff00f7>远程探测器</color>，可<color=#ff00f7>扫描</color>整个星球或星区；以及<color=#ff00f7>深空雷达</color>，不仅能<color=#ff00f7>扫描</color>，还能在极远距离<color=#ff00f7>识别</color>物体和载具。

@p9 <color=#006eff>医疗专精</color>让你能制造大量高级<color=#006eff>药品</color>和用于飞船与基地的<color=#006eff>医疗设备</color>，以及<color=#006eff>医疗注射器</color>，可在战场上治疗盟友。<color=#006eff>医疗专精</color>还能制造<color=#006eff>医疗增强体</color>，这是一种一次性物品，可永久性地提升一项或多项核心属性（生命值、耐力、食物），并提供额外效果，如<color=#006eff>生命恢复</color>、<color=#ff00f7>移动速度</color>提升，甚至温度调节。<color=#006eff>增强体</color>赋予的增益持续到另一个<color=#006eff>增强体</color>被使用或你“死亡”为止。

@p9 最终，<color=#006eff>医疗专精</color>将让你制造强大的<color=#006eff>医疗注射器</color>，它还能<color=#006eff>充能</color>盟友的耐力，并拥有一个<color=#04ff00>眩晕光束</color>，可造成少量<color=#04ff00>伤害</color>，但能让多数敌人退却（在PvP中也可眩晕玩家）。

@p9 一旦你选择了专精，你可以通过打开你的PDA（<color=#00fbff>F1</color>）并激活相应的第一级任务来开始在该专精中获得等级。

@p9 一旦你在任何专精中达到等级3，你将有机会完成一项高级训练课程，如果你愿意，这将允许你选择另一个专精，或者你可以获得500点UP来帮助你解锁你专精的高级物品或设备。

@p9 一旦你在任何专精中达到等级5，你将可以选择另一个专精，或者你可以获得500点UP来帮助你解锁你专精的高级物品或设备。

@p9 你想从哪个专精开始？

English:
Now that you have a <color=#ffc800>Drill</color>, you can begin <color=#ffc800>gathering </color>Crushed Stone to <color=#ffc800>process </color>into <color=#ffc800>raw ores</color>.
@w4 You will need at least @d6 2250 @d3 Crushed Stone to <color=#ffc800>process </color>enough of each <color=#ffc800>ore </color>to be useful. 

@w4 <color=#ffc800>Gather </color>2250 Crushed Stone.

Chinese (simplified):
既然你已拥有<color=#ffc800>钻头</color>，你可以开始<color=#ffc800>收集</color>碎石，以便将其<color=#ffc800>处理</color>成<color=#ffc800>原矿</color>。
@w4 你至少需要@d6 2250 @d3 份碎石，才能<color=#ffc800>处理</color>出足够每种<color=#ffc800>矿石</color>的可用量。

@w4 <color=#ffc800>收集</color>2250份碎石。

English:
Keeping a Capital Vessel <color=#ffc800>fueled </color>is tough these days. @w2 With <color=#ffc800>fuel </color>prices continuously going up, @w1 the ability to <color=#ffc800>craft </color>large amounts of <color=#ffc800>fuel </color>easily is a necessity for proper <color=#ffc800>engineering</color>. @w2 As an <color=#ffc800>engineer</color>, you can unlock the ability to craft <color=#ffc800>Promethium Fuel Packs</color>, @w1 which are more efficient than basic Promethium Fuel, @w1 and even more non-promethium based <color=#ffc800>fuel sources</color> than others. 

However, while other fuels are available, @w1 <color=#ffc800>Promethium Fuel Packs</color> are still the easiest source of energy to create, @w1 provided you can find <color=#ffc800>promethium ore</color> to <color=#ffc800>refine</color>.

@w4 Promethium Crystals can often be <b><color=#ff00c8>found </color></b>growing underwater in areas where <color=#ffc800>thrusters </color>or other types of wreckage leak promethium into the water. 

@w4 <color=#ffc800>Gather </color>100 <color=#ffc800>Promethium Ore</color>, @w1 then <color=#ffc800>craft </color>200 <color=#ffc800>Promethium Fuel Packs</color>.   @w2 Note: The <color=#ffc800>Constructor </color>crafts 2 <color=#ffc800>Fuel Packs</color> at a time.

Chinese (simplified):
如今维持一艘主力舰的<color=#ffc800>燃料</color>供应很困难。@w2 随着<color=#ffc800>燃料</color>价格不断上涨，@w1 能够轻松<color=#ffc800>制造</color>大量<color=#ffc800>燃料</color>已成为一项必备的<color=#ffc800>工程</color>技能。@w2 作为一名<color=#ffc800>工程师</color>，你可以解锁制造<color=#ffc800>钷燃料包</color>的能力，@w1 其效率高于基础钷燃料，@w1 甚至比其他非钷<color=#ffc800>燃料来源</color>更高效。

不过，尽管还有其他燃料可用，@w1 <color=#ffc800>钷燃料包</color>仍然是最容易制造的能量来源，@w1 前提是你能够找到可<color=#ffc800>精炼</color>的<color=#ffc800>钷矿石</color>。

@w4 钷水晶通常可以在水下<color=#ffc800>发现</color>，生长在<color=#ffc800>推进器</color>或其他残骸泄漏钷进入水体的区域。

@w4 <color=#ffc800>收集</color>100个<color=#ffc800>钷矿石</color>，@w1 然后<color=#ffc800>制造</color>200个<color=#ffc800>钷燃料包</color>。@w2 注意：<color=#ffc800>建造机</color>一次制造2个<color=#ffc800>燃料包</color>。

English:
{PlayerName}, @w1 I am detecting a <color=#ff00c8>mysterious signal</color> coming from the surface of the planet (Tohh). @w2 I can't <color=#ff00c8>pinpoint </color>its location, but if you get close enough, you can probably <color=#ff00c8>locate </color>it with a <color=#ff00c8>Detector</color>.

@p9 As a <color=#ff00f7>scout</color>, your job is to <color=#ff00f7>locate </color>POIs that could be useful for your group to <color=#ff00f7>investigate </color>or <color=#04ff00>attack</color>. @w2 In order to gain Ranks in <color=#ff00f7>Exploration</color>, you will need to <color=#ff00f7>locate </color>certain POIs, and eventually, head out into the wider galaxy in <color=#ff00f7>search </color>of ancient secrets.

@p9 Your first mission is to <color=#ff00f7>locate </color>the POI that's emitting the <color=#ff00c8>mysterious signal</color>. Keep an eye on your mini-map for an icon the shape of a Chevron. These POIs are often key elements for your missions, or those of your allies.

Chinese (simplified):
{PlayerName}, @w1 我探测到一个来自星球（托赫）表面的<color=#ff00c8>神秘信号</color>。@w2 我无法<color=#ff00c8>精确定位</color>它的位置，但如果你足够靠近，你或许可以用<color=#ff00c8>探测器</color><color=#ff00c8>找到</color>它。

@p9 作为一名<color=#ff00f7>侦察兵</color>，你的工作是<color=#ff00f7>定位</color>那些可能对你的团队有用、值得<color=#ff00f7>调查</color>或<color=#04ff00>攻击</color>的POI。@w2 为了提升<color=#ff00f7>探索</color>等级，你需要<color=#ff00f7>定位</color>特定的POI，最终前往更广阔的星系<color=#ff00f7>寻找</color>远古秘密。

@p9 你的第一个任务是<color=#ff00f7>定位</color>发出<color=#ff00c8>神秘信号</color>的POI。留意小地图上的V形图标。这些POI通常是你的任务或盟友任务的关键要素。

English:
It appears you've <color=#ff00f7>found </color>a Destroyed Alien Obelisk! @w2 This is an excellent find!

@p4 Sensors indicate this Obelisk is the source of the signal I've been <color=#ff00c8>detecting</color>, despite it's damaged state. @w2 I'll begin analyzing it and let you know what I find.

@w6 This could take a while. @w4 In the mean time, you should continue with your next mission.

Chinese (simplified):
看起来你<color=#ff00f7>发现</color>了一个被摧毁的外星方尖碑！@w2 这是一个极好的发现！

@p4 传感器显示，尽管此方尖碑已损坏，但它是我一直在<color=#ff00c8>探测</color>的信号源。@w2 我将开始分析它，并告诉你我的发现。

@w6 这可能需要一些时间。@w4 在此期间，你应该继续你的下一个任务。

English:
In a galaxy filled with threats, it's important to find allies to help you survive. @w2 Many friendly factions set up Trading Stations where they buy and sell goods with their allies.

Locate a Planetary Trading Station where you can trade for goods or services.

@w4 Note: If you haven't built a <color=#ff00f7>Scout Vessel </color>by now, you should do so.

Chinese (simplified):
在一个充满威胁的星系中，找到盟友来帮助你生存至关重要。@w2 许多友好派系建立了贸易站，在那里他们与盟友进行商品买卖。

找到一个行星贸易站，在那里你可以交易货物或服务。

@w4 注意：如果你还没有建造<color=#ff00f7>侦察飞船</color>，你应该建造一艘。

English:
This is the beacon sending out the distress signal that was used to lure the <color=#3333e5>Speedwell </color>into orbit. @w2 The design is definitely human, @w1 however, @w1 the materials used in its construction indicate that it was constructed in THIS galaxy, @w1 not in the Milky Way. @w2 The marking on the side seem to indicate an organization called the '<color=#3333e5>UCH</color>'.

@p9 In order to find out more, we should try to access a database of one of this galaxy's native races. @w2 Perhaps the aliens that attacked the <color=#3333e5>Speedwell </color>will have the information we need.

@w4 I've analyzed the energy signature of the beacon, and generated a Key Card for you. @w2 This key card should allow you to access the information from a compatible computer.

Chinese (simplified):
这就是那个发出求救信号、用于引诱<color=#3333e5>速威尔号</color>进入轨道的信标。@w2 设计绝对是人类的，@w1 然而，@w1 其建造所用的材料表明它是在这个星系建造的，@w1 而不是在银河系。@w2 侧面的标记似乎指向一个名为'<color=#3333e5>UCH</color>'的组织。

@p9 为了查明更多真相，我们应该尝试访问这个星系中某个本地种族的数据库。@w2 也许攻击<color=#3333e5>速威尔号</color>的外星人会拥有我们需要的信息。

@w4 我分析了信标的能量特征，并为你生成了一张密钥卡。@w2 这张密钥卡应该能让你从兼容的计算机上访问信息。

English:
@w4 …ACCESSING…
@w4 …ACCESSING…
@w4 …PROCESSING DATA…

@w6 The Com Array has <color=#ff00f7>detected </color>three signals similar to the one from the Destroyed Alien Obelisk.

@p9 The signals are coming from three planets in this solar system:
@w4 The Barren Metal planet called Brokanerth,
@w2 The Debris Field of the planet called Koronat;
@w2 And the Swamp planet called Aboged.

@w6 I suggest traveling to these planets and attempting to <color=#ff00f7>find</color> and <color=#ff00f7>scan </color>the obelisks emitting these signals to learn more.

Chinese (simplified):
@w4 …访问中…
@w4 …访问中…
@w4 …数据处理中…

@w6 通讯阵列已<color=#ff00f7>探测到</color>三个与被摧毁的外星方尖碑类似的信号。

@p9 信号来自这个太阳系中的三个星球：
@w4 名为布罗卡纳斯的贫瘠金属星球，
@w2 名为科罗纳特的星球碎片带，
@w2 以及名为阿博格德的沼泽星球。

@w6 我建议前往这些星球，尝试<color=#ff00f7>寻找</color>并<color=#ff00f7>扫描</color>发出这些信号的方尖碑，以了解更多信息。

English:
@q0 Accessing Data...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...

@p9 It seems that we are not the first humans to arrive in this galaxy. @w4 Around 400 years ago, a fleet of human ships arrived in this galaxy using warp drive technology derived from an alien vessel that crashed on Earth.
@w2 Unfortunately, they were attacked by the same aliens we were, who seem to call themselves the <color=#ff0000>Zirax Empire</color>.

@p9 The humans that arrived here were apparently part of an organization called the <color=#3333e5>United Council of Humanity</color>, @w1 or <color=#3333e5>UCH </color>for short. @w4 Their arrival in this galaxy seems to have coincided with the re-emergence of an alien species known as '<color=#00ffab>The Legacy</color>'. @w4 It seems that <color=#00ffab>The Legacy</color> was a major threat to all life in the galaxy, @w1 but with the help of the <color=#3333e5>UCH</color>, @w1 along with many of the factions in the galaxy, @w1 they were pushed back to a distant edge of the galaxy.

@p9 Many planets that remained infected by <color=#00ffab>The Legacy</color> were placed under a quarantine enforced by a subsidiary of the <color=#e6991f>Polaris Megacorporation</color>, @w1 called the <color=#e6991f>Polaris Medical Authority</color>, @w1 which was created just for this task. @w4 The <color=#e6991f>PMA </color>was given total authority over the quarantined planets, @w1 which they have recently began sending researchers to in order to try and figure out more about this ancient alien species.

@p9 For a long time, @w1 the <color=#3333e5>UCH </color>was a decisive force of change in the galaxy, @w1 searching for sources of renewable fuel, @w1 energy, @w1 and materials.
@w4 However, @w2 around a hundred years ago, @w1 the influence of the <color=#3333e5>UCH </color>seemingly vanished. @w4 The only mentions of the <color=#3333e5>UCH </color>after this point are vague references by the <color=#ff0000>Zirax Empire</color> to the former 'terran' faction as a 'failed coup'.
@p9 After the disappearance of the <color=#3333e5>UCH</color>, The <color=#ff0000>Zirax Empire</color> began expanding again, @w1 fighting again with many of the factions of the galaxy. @w4 It appears that since then, @w1 The <color=#ff0000>Zirax Empire</color> have been using stolen <color=#3333e5>UCH </color>Distress Beacons to try and lure any UCH remnants into ambushes.

@p9 Apparently, the <color=#3333e5>UES Speedwell</color> was an unexpected victim of a centuries old conflict. @w4 I suggest you focus your efforts on survival, @w1 and once you've achieved space flight, @w1 look for any signs of the remainder of the <color=#3333e5>United Earth Fleet</color>.

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 正在访问数据...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...

@p9 看起来我们并不是第一批到达这个星系的人类。@w4 大约400年前，一支人类飞船舰队使用从一艘坠毁在地球上的外星飞船中获得的翘曲引擎技术抵达了这个星系。
@w2 不幸的是，他们遭到了和我们一样的外星人攻击，这些外星人似乎自称为<color=#ff0000>兹瑞克斯帝国</color>。

@p9 抵达这里的人类显然是一个名为<color=#3333e5>人类联合议会</color>的组织的一部分，@w1 简称<color=#3333e5>UCH</color>。@w4 他们抵达这个星系的时间似乎与一个被称为'<color=#00ffab>遗留者</color>'的外星物种的重新出现相吻合。@w4 看来<color=#00ffab>遗留者</color>曾是星系中所有生命的主要威胁，@w1 但在<color=#3333e5>人类联合议会</color>的帮助下，@w1 连同星系中的许多派系，@w1 它们被击退到了星系的一个遥远边缘。

@p9 许多仍然被<color=#00ffab>遗留者</color>感染的星球被强制隔离，由<color=#e6991f>极星超级集团</color>的一个子公司负责执行，@w1 名为<color=#e6991f>极星医疗管理局</color>，@w1 该机构专为此任务而设立。@w4 <color=#e6991f>极星医疗管理局</color>被授予对隔离星球的完全管辖权，@w1 他们最近开始派遣研究人员前往这些星球，试图进一步了解这种古老的外星物种。

@p9 在很长一段时间里，@w1 <color=#3333e5>人类联合议会</color>是星系中变革的决定性力量，@w1 寻找可再生燃料、@w1 能源@w1 和材料的来源。
@w4 然而，@w2 大约一百年前，@w1 <color=#3333e5>人类联合议会</color>的影响力似乎消失了。@w4 此后唯一提到<color=#3333e5>人类联合议会</color>的地方是<color=#ff0000>兹瑞克斯帝国</color>对前'地球人'派系的模糊提及，称其为'一场失败的政变'。
@p9 在<color=#3333e5>人类联合议会</color>消失后，<color=#ff0000>兹瑞克斯帝国</color>开始再次扩张，@w1 再次与星系中的许多派系交战。@w4 看起来自那以后，@w1 <color=#ff0000>兹瑞克斯帝国</color>一直在使用盗窃来的<color=#3333e5>人类联合议会</color>遇险信标，试图引诱任何人类联合议会残余部队进入伏击。

@p9 显然，<color=#3333e5>UES速威号</color>是一场数世纪冲突的意外受害者。@w4 我建议你把精力集中在生存上，@w1 一旦你实现了太空飞行，@w1 寻找<color=#3333e5>地球联合舰队</color>剩余部分的任何迹象。

English:
The Rados Com Array we used <color=#ff00f7>detected </color>three signals similar to the one from the Destroyed Alien Obelisk.

@p9 The signals were coming from three planets in this solar system:
@w4 The Desert planet called Or Madra,
@w2 The Snow planet called Uropea;
@w2 And the Alien planet Nomspera.

@w6 I suggest traveling to these planets and attempting to <color=#ff00f7>find</color> and <color=#ff00f7>scan </color>the obelisks emitting these signals to learn more.

Chinese (simplified):
我们使用的拉多斯通信阵列<color=#ff00f7>探测到</color>三个与已毁坏外星方尖碑相似的信号。

@p9 信号来自这个太阳系中的三个星球：
@w4 名为奥玛德拉的沙漠星球，
@w2 名为尤洛匹亚的雪地星球；
@w2 以及外星星球诺姆斯佩拉。

@w6 我建议前往这些星球尝试<color=#ff00f7>寻找</color>并<color=#ff00f7>扫描</color>发出这些信号的方尖碑以了解更多信息。

English:
The Rados Com Array we used <color=#ff00f7>detected </color>three signals similar to the one from the Destroyed Alien Obelisk.

@p9 The signals were coming from three planets in this solar system:
@w4 The Swamp planet called Aboged,
@w2 The debris field remains of the planet called Koronat;
@w2 And the Barren Metal planet Brokanerth.

@w6 I suggest traveling to these planets and attempting to <color=#ff00f7>find</color> and <color=#ff00f7>scan </color>the obelisks emitting these signals to learn more.

