English:
…COMPILING SCAN DATA…


@w4 Like I initially thought, the obelisks all seem to be transmitting some sort of warning.

@p9 Unfortunately, I only seem to have recovered part of the message. @w1 Additionally, I can't seem to decipher the language used.
@w4 In order to decipher the message, we'll have to travel to the source of the signal. @w2 The signal seems to be coming from the Barren Planet of Yersona.

@p9 Make your way to Yersona in order to <color=#ff00f7>locate </color>the source of the Mysterious Signal.

Chinese (simplified):
…正在编译扫描数据…


@w4 正如我最初所想，这些方尖碑似乎都在传输某种警告。

@p9 不幸的是，我似乎只恢复了部分信息。@w1 此外，我无法破译所使用的语言。
@w4 为了破译信息，我们必须前往信号源。@w2 信号似乎来自耶尔索纳贫瘠星球。

@p9 前往耶尔索纳以<color=#ff00f7>定位</color>神秘信号的源头。

English:
{PlayerName}, It seems the Zirax had set up explosive devices on the Alien Alter, and were just trying to buy time by keeping us away. 

@w4 This Alien Alter was definitely the source of the Mysterious Signal. @w2 Unfortunately, it's destruction means I may not be able to translate the message from the signal, but I will try.
@w4...Processing...
@w4...Processing...
@w4...Processing...

@p9 Here's the best translation I can provide:

@w6 @d8 TRAVELERS OF ... @w4 BEWARE THE ... @w4 BEYOND, ... @w4 !
@w2 ... @w4 FORSAKEN GATE ... @w4 DARKENED EYE!
@w2 ... @w4 ETERNAL DARK, ... @w4 SOULS TO CONDEMN!
@w2 BEWARE THE ... !
@w2 BEWARE ... @w4 BEYOND!
@d3
@p9 That seems to be the as much of a translation I can provide. @w2 I will analyze this further to attempt to ascertain its meaning.

Chinese (simplified):
{PlayerName}，看来兹瑞克斯在外星祭坛上设置了爆炸装置，只是想通过阻止我们靠近来拖延时间。

@w4这个外星祭坛无疑是神秘信号的来源。@w2不幸的是，它的破坏意味着我可能无法翻译信号中的信息，但我会尽力。
@w4……处理中……
@w4……处理中……
@w4……处理中……

@p9以下是我能提供的最佳翻译：

@w6@d8 旅者们…… @w4 当心…… @w4 彼岸，…… @w4！
@w2 …… @w4 被遗忘之门…… @w4 黑暗之眼！
@w2 …… @w4 永恒黑暗，…… @w4 灵魂将受罚！
@w2 当心……！
@w2 当心…… @w4 彼岸！
@d3
@p9这似乎是我能提供的尽可能完整的翻译。@w2我将进一步分析以尝试解读其含义。

English:
{PlayerName}, I have analyzed the contents of the warning we received from the Alien Alter on Yersona.

@w2  Unfortunately, I seem to have more questions than answers:

@w2What is the 'Forsaken Gate'? 
@w2 What does it mean by a 'Darkened Eye'?
@w2 And what is the 'Beyond' it repeatedly mentions?

@w4 Perhaps you'll figure it out as you travel the stars.

Chinese (simplified):
{PlayerName}，我分析了我们从耶尔索纳的外星祭坛收到的警告内容。

@w2不幸的是，我似乎有更多问题而非答案：

@w2什么是“被遗忘之门”？
@w2“黑暗之眼”是什么意思？
@w2还有它反复提到的“彼岸”是什么？

@w4也许您会在星际旅行中弄清楚。

English:
@d6 I see...
@d3 @w2 In that case, may I see your credentials?

@p9 @d0 Ah! @w1 <color=#006eff>Medical Rank 4</color>! @w1 Excellent!
@w2 @d3 We've been looking for someone with your <color=#006eff>medical experience</color> for some time.
@p9 We have a situation on the surface that could use your assistance. @w2 Unfortunately, we cannot allow any vehicles to enter the planet's atmosphere, but you're being cleared to teleport to Quarantine Base Gammaon the planet.
@w4 The Access Code for the Teleporter is <color=#ffc800>6562</color>.

@w4 Once you arrive, talk to the security chief. @w2 He'll explain the situation in detail.

Chinese (simplified):
@d6我明白了……
@d3@w2那样的话，我能看看您的证件吗？

@p9@d0啊！@w1<color=#006eff>医疗等级4</color>！@w1太棒了！
@w2@d3我们一直在寻找像您这样拥有<color=#006eff>医疗经验</color>的人。
@p9星球表面有一个情况需要您的帮助。@w2不幸的是，我们不允许任何飞行器进入行星大气层，但您被获准传送到该星球上的伽马隔离基地。
@w4传送器的接入码是<color=#ffc800>6562</color>。

@w4到达后，请与安全酋长交谈。@w2他会详细说明情况。

English:
Welcome to Quarantine Base Gamma, Doctor {PlayerName}. @w2 Administrator Jesep told me to expect you.

@w4 We've been looking for someone with your <color=#0062ff>Medical </color>expertise to investigate a Mysterious Structure that our scouts discovered several kilometers away. @w2 The strange thing is that this structure wasn't there when we first quarantined the planet. 

@p9 We believe that this structure, @w1 and others like it, @w1 are somehow linked to the way The Legacy keeps a foothold on on a planet even after being sterilized and quarantined. @w2 We need you to see if there's anything of <color=#0062ff>Medical </color><color=#0062ff></color>relevance that could help us identify a way to remove all traces of The Legacy from a quarantined world. 

@p9 Take whatever team you need to the Mysterious Structure and try to find anything of  <color=#0062ff>Medical </color>relevance, @w1 then report back to us on our secure channel. @w4 As soon as you contact us, we'll send a research team to begin researching whatever you find. @w4 If there happens to be nothing of interest, @w1 we'll send out a team to assist you in clean up. 

@w4 Good Luck, Doctor.

Chinese (simplified):
欢迎来到伽马隔离基地，{PlayerName}医生。@w2耶塞普管理员告诉我你会来。

@w4我们一直在寻找像您这样拥有<color=#0062ff>医疗</color>专长的人，以调查我们侦察队在几公里外发现的一个神秘结构。@w2奇怪的是，当我们最初隔离这颗星球时，这个结构并不存在。

@p9我们相信这个结构，@w1以及其他类似的结构，@w1与遗留者即使在星球被灭菌和隔离后仍能维持立足点的方式有某种关联。@w2我们需要您查看是否有任何<color=#0062ff>医疗</color>相关的发现，能够帮助我们找到从隔离世界中清除所有遗留者痕迹的方法。

@p9带上您需要的任何团队前往神秘结构，尝试寻找任何<color=#0062ff>医疗</color>相关的线索，@w1然后通过我们的安全频道向我们报告。@w4一旦您联系我们，我们会派遣一个研究团队开始研究您的发现。@w4如果碰巧没有感兴趣的东西，@w1我们会派出一个团队协助您清理。

@w4祝您好运，医生。

English:
{PlayerName}, The mysterious biological node in this room seems to be made up of a different material from the rest of the structure... @w1 however...

@w2 Scanning...
@w2 Scanning...
@w2 Scanning...

@w2 Scan Complete...

@w4 Analyzing Scan...

@p9 This is unusual. @w2 The energy signatures of the biological components and the seemingly inorganic components of the structure are the same. @w2 It's as if...@w2 It seems that the entire building was grown from some sort of biological... @w1 seed. @w2 I recommend we contact the Polaris Medical Authority and let them know what we found.

Chinese (simplified):
{PlayerName}，这个房间中神秘的生物节点似乎由与建筑其他部分不同的材料构成……@w1 但是……

@w2 扫描中……
@w2 扫描中……
@w2 扫描中……

@w2 扫描完成……

@w4 分析扫描结果……

@p9 这很不寻常。@w2 生物组件与建筑中看似无机组件的能量特征完全相同。@w2 就好像……@w2 整栋建筑似乎是由某种生物……@w1 种子生长而成的。@w2 我建议联系极星医疗管理局，向他们报告我们的发现。

English:
Doctor {PlayerName}! It's great to hear from you. 

@p9 @d0 (You inform them of your findings in the Mysterious Temple)
@d6 ....................

@p9 @d3 That's great! @w4 I'll send our research team out now to set up a base camp in the structure. @w2 They will help you get out of the structure, if you haven't already found your way out.

@w4 They should arrive in approximately 5 minutes. @w2 Take this time to finish clearing the structure of enemies. @w2 Of course, any loot you find that's not relevant to the research you are free to keep.

@w4 P.M.A. Out

Chinese (simplified):
博士{PlayerName}！很高兴收到您的消息。

@p9 @d0 （您向他们报告了在神秘圣殿中的发现）
@d6 ....................

@p9 @d3 太棒了！@w4 我现在就派出研究小组，在建筑中设立一个基地营地。@w2 如果您还没找到出口，他们会帮助您离开。

@w4 他们大约5分钟后到达。@w2 趁这段时间，清理建筑内的敌人。@w2 当然，任何与研究无关的战利品您都可以自行保留。

@w4 P.M.A. 完毕

English:
Doctor {PlayerName}, @w1 Welcome Back. @w2 The discovery you found is unlike anything we've seen before. @w2 Perhaps it's because we never had the opportunity to investigate one of these structures so soon after it appeared, @w1 but our researchers have already reported that their initial findings indicate that the strange organic part of the structure did, indeed, seem to be responsible for its rapid appearance. @w2 It's probable that all such structures are grown by one of these things. 

@p9 In any case, your contribution to the <color=#0084ff>medical </color>and scientific community is greatly appreciated.

@w2, Take this Locker Key, and use it to open the Quarantine Locker in the <color=#0084ff>medical bay</color>. I think you'll find something useful inside.

Chinese (simplified):
博士{PlayerName}，@w1 欢迎回来。@w2 您的发现前所未见。@w2 也许是因为我们从未有机会在建筑出现后不久就对其进行调查，@w1 但我们的研究人员已经报告初步结果显示，建筑中奇特的有机部分确实似乎是其快速出现的原因。@w2 很可能所有此类建筑都是由这种东西生长而成的。

@p9 无论如何，非常感谢您对<color=#0084ff>医疗</color>和科学界的贡献。

@w2，拿着这把储物柜钥匙，用它打开<color=#0084ff>医疗舱</color>中的检疫储物柜。我想您会在里面找到有用的东西。

English:
The <color=#ff0000>Aliens</color> uses special <color=#ff0000>Defensive Towers</color> to expand their territory on a planet. @w2 <color=#04ff00>Taking out</color> these <color=#ff0000>towers </color>would reduce their territory tremendously.

@w6 Use a Small Vessel or Hover Vessel to <color=#04ff00>destroy </color>the <color=#ff0000>core </color>of five <color=#ff0000>enemy Junkyard Defense Towers</color>.
@w4 Alternatively, you could try to approach the <color=#ff0000>tower </color>on foot, and fight your way into the <color=#ff0000>tower </color>and destroy the <color=#ff0000>core </color>is exposed. @w2 However, this is not recommended.

Chinese (simplified):
这些<color=#ff0000>外星人</color>使用特殊的<color=#ff0000>防御塔</color>来扩张他们在星球上的领地。@w2 <color=#04ff00>摧毁</color>这些<color=#ff0000>塔</color>将极大削弱他们的领地。

@w6 使用小型飞船或悬浮飞船<color=#04ff00>摧毁</color>五座<color=#ff0000>敌方垃圾场防御塔</color>的<color=#ff0000>核心</color>。
@w4 或者，你也可以尝试步行接近<color=#ff0000>塔</color>，一路杀进去，在<color=#ff0000>核心</color>暴露时将其摧毁。@w2 不过，不推荐这种方式。

English:
@q0 {PlayerName}, @w1 I am receiving a signal on a <color=#3333e5>United Earth</color> frequency; @w2 It appears to be a distress signal from the UES<color=#3333e5> Fukushima</color>! 
@w4 I am attempting to locate the source of the signal…

@w2 Analyzing...

@w2 Analyzing...
@p9 It appears that the signal originated from a nearby G-type star called Koronashi Beta. @w2 We should head there and see if any of their crew or passengers survived.

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 {PlayerName}, @w1 我接收到了一个<color=#3333e5>联合地球</color>频道的信号；@w2 似乎是来自UES<color=#3333e5>福岛号</color>的求救信号！
@w4 我正在尝试定位信号源……

@w2 分析中……

@w2 分析中……
@p9 信号似乎来自附近一颗名为“Koronashi Beta”的G型恒星。@w2 我们应该去那里，看看是否有他们的船员或乘客幸存。

English:
@q0 This terminal appears to be working.
@w2 Attempting data retrieval...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...data retrieval complete.

@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the captain of the <color=#3333e5>UES Fukushima</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 Arrival Log, Entry 2
@w4 Investigating the derelict ship was a mistake. @w2 As soon as we were within sight of it, it powered up with some sort of mysterious energy causing it to become illuminated by an eerie green light. @w2 Its weapons sprang to life and began pummeling us while the wreckage, @w1 somehow, @w1 began to move toward us.
@w4 Ensign Tsukumo called it a Funayūrei, and I agree; this is some kind of <color=#57a86b>Ghost Ship</color>. 
@w4 We've managed to evade our persuer by taking refuge in the upper atmosphere of a nearby gas giant. @w2 While the temperature outside the ship is over 200 degrees, and the radiation levels are intense, the ship should protect us, @w1. For now.
@w4 -Captain Alonso Hooke

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 这个终端似乎还能工作。
@w2 尝试数据检索中...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...数据检索完成。

@w2 我发现了来自<color=#3333e5>UES 福岛号</color>船长的一条日志记录。@w2 开始播放。

@p9 抵达日志，条目 2
@w4 调查那艘废弃飞船是个错误。@w2 我们刚一进入视线范围，它就启动了某种神秘能量，整艘船被诡异的绿光照亮。@w2 它的武器突然开火，开始猛烈攻击我们，而残骸@w1 不知怎的@w1 开始向我们移动。
@w4 津云少尉称之为“船幽灵”，我同意；这根本就是某种<color=#57a86b>幽灵船</color>。
@w4 我们设法躲进了附近一颗气态巨行星的高层大气，才摆脱了追兵。@w2 虽然船外温度超过200度，辐射强度极高，但飞船应该能保护我们。@w1 目前如此。
@w4 ——船长阿隆索·胡克

English:
@q0 This terminal appears to be working.
@w2 Attempting data retrieval...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...data retrieval complete.

@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the captain of the <color=#3333e5>UES Fukushima</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 Arrival Log, Entry 3
@w4 It's been two weeks since Engineer Doohan completed his 'Fukushima Escape' Shuttle, @w1 which he cobbled together from various parts of the ship. @w2 I didn't think he could do it, @w1 but he proved me wrong yet again. @w2 We began shuttling passengers down to a nearby Temperate Planet just over a week ago. @w2 Now, we're loading the last of the passengers from the Cryo Chambers into the shuttle, @w1 and I will finally be joining them down on the planet. 
@p9 The passengers... @w1 I suppose they're colonists now... @w1 have constructed what they dubbed '<color=#3333e5>Fukushima Colony</color>' around what appears to be an old Emergency Shelter. @w2 They set up a variety of pre-fabricated habitats, @w1 as well as a small warehouse.
@w4 As we shuttled more personnel down, @w1 they began building separate farming settlements a short distance away. @w2 With nearly three hundred settlers, @w1 we should be able to survive. @w2 Perhaps others from the fleet will find us, @w1 and join us.
@w4 -Captain Alonso Hooke

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 这个终端似乎还能工作。
@w2 尝试数据检索中...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...数据检索完成。

@w2 我发现了来自<color=#3333e5>UES 福岛号</color>船长的一条日志记录。@w2 开始播放。

@p9 抵达日志，条目 3
@w4 工程师杜汉完成他的“福岛逃生”穿梭机已经两周了，@w1 他用飞船的各种零件拼凑而成。@w2 我本以为他做不到，@w1 但他又一次证明我错了。@w2 一周多前，我们开始把乘客运送到附近的一个温带星球。@w2 现在，我们正在把最后一批冷冻舱的乘客装上穿梭机，@w1 我也终于要和他们一起降落到那颗星球了。
@p9 那些乘客……@w1 我想现在该叫他们殖民者了……@w1 在一个旧应急避难所周围建起了他们称之为“<color=#3333e5>福岛殖民地</color>”的地方。@w2 他们搭建了各种预制栖息地，@w1 还有一个小型仓库。
@w4 随着我们运送更多人员下去，@w1 他们开始在稍远处建立独立的农业定居点。@w2 有了近三百名定居者，@w1 我们应该能生存下去。@w2 也许舰队中的其他人能找到我们，@w1 加入我们。
@w4 ——船长阿隆索·胡克

English:
@q0 This terminal appears to be working.
@w2 Attempting data retrieval...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...data retrieval complete.

@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the helmsman of the <color=#3333e5>UES Fukushima</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 Helmsman Log, Entry 1
@w4 I don't like this. @w4 Captain Hooke has us heading toward a massive derelict ship on the edge of the system. @w2 As I was setting the course, @w1 I got this chill down my spine that I just can't shake. @w2 T<color=#b6fbf7>he </color><color=#8afff7>cl</color><color=#69f7db>os</color><color=#4cf0bf>er</color> <color=#00ffb3>we</color> <color=#00ff9d>ge</color><color=#1eff00>t, @w1 @d0 {PlayerName}, @d3 @w1 th</color><color=#00ff9d>e m</color><color=#00ffb3>or</color><color=#4cf0bf>e I </color><color=#69f7db>ge</color><color=#8afff7>t t</color><color=#b6fbf7>hi</color>s sinking feeling in the pit of my stomach. 
@w4 I hope I'm wrong, @w1 but this feels like a trap.
