@w4 Engineer Doohan finally completed the Escape Shuttle, and christened it the '<color=#3333e5>Fukushima Escape</color>'. @w2 Captain Hooke assigned me to fly the shuttle to and from an apparently habitable planet that we detected in the system. @w2 The first trip to this planet went relatively smoothly. @w2 In addition to the thirty-five passengers that were revived from the first Cryo-Module, @w1 Doctor Kelley also joined us for the trip. 

