English:
@q0 I have the following items for Starships:

@p9 Pentaxid Compression Tank (250 Tokens): A Starship Pentaxid Fuel Tank that compresses the stored Pentaxid to utilize the most space possible. Can hold three times the amount of pentaxid of a normal Fuel Tank.

@p9 Refurbished Furnace (50 Tokens): This Furnace has been re-configured to function on a Starship rather than a Base.

@p9 Powered Core (T2) (50 Tokens): This Starship Core acts as a Generator that is capable of powering most small to medium Starships all by itself.

Enhanced Core (T3) (125 Tokens): This Starship Core not only acts as a powerful generator, capable of powering medium sized Starships, but also increases the available CPU of a Starship by 500,000!

@p9 Reinforced Core (T2) (50 Tokens): This Starship Core is reinforced with Titanium, making it tougher than a regular core.

Fortification Core (T3) (125 Tokens): This Starship Core is not only reinforced with Sathium, making it severely tougher than a regular core, but also increases the Shield Capacity of the starship's shield generator by 20,000.

So which one are you interested in?

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 我有以下可用于星舰的物品：

@p9 翘曲水晶压缩罐（250代币）：一种星舰翘曲水晶燃料罐，可压缩存储的翘曲水晶以最大限度地利用空间。其容量是普通燃料罐的三倍。

@p9 翻新熔炉（50代币）：该熔炉经过重新配置，使其能够在星舰上而非基地中运作。

@p9 动力核心（T2）（50代币）：该星舰核心本身即可充当发电机，能够为大多数中小型星舰提供电力。

增强核心（T3）（125代币）：该星舰核心不仅可作为强力发电机，能够为中型星舰供电，还能使星舰的可用CPU增加50万！

@p9 强化核心（T2）（50代币）：该星舰核心采用钛加固，使其比普通核心更加坚固。

防御核心（T3）（125代币）：该星舰核心不仅采用钑加固，使其比普通核心坚固得多，还能为星舰的护盾发生器增加20,000点护盾容量。

那么你对哪一个感兴趣呢？

English:
@q0 This terminal appears to be working.
@w2 Attempting data retrieval...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...data retrieval complete.

@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the Governor of <color=#3333e5>Fukushima Colony</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 Colony Log, Entry 1
@w4 It's been five days since we first arrived on this planet. @w2 I, Commander Jordan Holch, have been appointed by Captain Hooke as the Colonial Governor of Fukushima Colony, @w1 responsible for overseeing the construction and expansion of the colony. @w2 The third shuttle load of passengers has just arrived, @w1 many of which are agricultural specialists keen on setting up farming villages on the outskirts of the colony.  @w2 However, until we get the main settlement set up, @w1 and the walls around it erected, @w1 I'm not willing to allow anyone to travel too far away.
@p9 By my estimation, @w1 it will take another five days to complete the main settlement, @w1 using the Colonial Prefabs we have available. @w2 They were really meant to work in conjunction with transforming the Fukushima and her Modules into habitats as well, but we'll do the best we can with what we have. @w2 We've set up crude power systems with each Prefab, @w1 but hopefully once Engineer Doohan arrives, @w1 he will be able to set up a unified power grid.
@w2 - Commander Jordan Holch,  Colonial Governor

