@p9 Colony Log, Entry 2
@w4 Setting up the Cargo Deck was a lot more time consuming than we expected. @w2 while the initial setup wasn't that difficult, @w1 it took us nearly two days to gather the resources needed to set up the Constructors we will need for mass fabrication of parts for the rest of the colony. @w2 Even once they were online, @w1 our limited resources on this planet make it difficult to stockpile what we need. @w2 As such, a large portion of the upper level of the Cargo Deck is currently empty.
@p9 The final shuttle with Captain Hooke and Engineer Doohan on board are due to arrive tomorrow morning. @w2 Perhaps once they arrive, we'll be able to start work on the Farming Settlements, as it's already overcrowded here.
@w2 - Commander Jordan Holch,  Colonial Governor

