@p9 Colony Log, Entry 3
@w4 The first of the three Farming Settlements has been set up. @w2 Engineer Doohan is nearly done with the colony's solar power, @w1 and will be heading out to the Farm to set up solar power there. @w2 The other two Farming Settlements are in the process of being erected, @w1 but despite the lower population of the main Settlement, @w1 there seems to be a rising tension among the colonists.
@p9 Rumors are spreading amongst the local population about dangerous creatures in the forest. @w2 While I haven't seen anything unusual myself, @w1 I get an uneasy feeling being outside at night time. @w2 Even within the settlement walls, @w1 being outside makes the hair on my neck stand up.
@w2 - Commander Jordan Holch,  Colonial Governor

