@p9 Medical Log, Entry 1
@w4 When the captain told me I'd be one of the first to help set up the colony, @w1 I was happy to get off that blasted ship, @w1 to feel the cool breeze on my face, @w1 and to breath fresh air. @w2 However, @w1 over the last week, @w1 as more and more people arrive, @w1 it seems that the sky is always cloudy, @w1 the wind blows less and less, @w1 and the air seems to have a... @w2 metallic taste. 
@w2 Something's wrong with this damned planet. @w2 On top of all that, @w1 people seem to be getting more paranoid than usual: @w1 Shadows moving out of the corner of the eye, @w1 strange noises in the woods, @w1 a feeling of being watched. @w2 Obviously something on this planet is causing hallucinations, @w1 but I've tested the water, air, and soil, and I can't find anything, @w1 toxins, @w1 microbes, @w1 spores, @w1 anything that can explain it.

@p9 At night, @w1 even I feel as if there's prying eyes everywhere. @w2 While I don't feel any other effects that could be attributed to any toxins or aliment. @w2 While I don't feel as if my faculties are compromised, @w1 I have decided to maintain this log to catalogue my potential exposure for later review. @w2 If I am loosing my mind, @w1 perhaps this log will serve to aid others who may find us.
@w4 - Doctor Kelley

