English:
@q0 I have the following weapons available::

@p9 Breaching Shotgun (25 Tokens): A highly-powerful Shotgun that fires very powerful blasts that can take out nearly any wall or door with a single shot (or two at most). Note: the Recipe for Breaching Shotgun Shells is included with this purchase.

@p9 Converted Gatling Gun (50 Tokens): A Gatling Gun for a Small Vessel that's been converted into a hand-held weapon. 

@p9 High Powered Assault Rifle (35 Tokens): An Assault Rifle modified to use 15mm ammunition. This powerful weapon can even break through walls and reinforced doors.

So which one are you interested in?

