English:
It appears that some mysterious force on this planet caused the colonists to wander off... @w1 or take their own lives... @w2 However, there should be some remains of those who died, @w1 and yet, @w1 there is nothing... @w1 not even a trace of human remains. 

@w4 It seems the colonists believed that whatever it was that caused this followed them from the <color=#3333e5>UES Fukushima</color>. @w2 Whatever the mysterious presence that was taking over that ship may also be responsible for the disappearance of the colonists.

@w4 I would recommend not lingering here too long, @w1 in case their speculation was well founded, @w1 as whatever it was may try to follow us back to our own ship...

Chinese (simplified):
看来这个星球上的某种神秘力量导致了殖民者失踪……@w1 或是自杀……@w2 然而，应该会有死者留下的遗骸，@w1 但，@w1 什么都没有……@w1 连人类遗骸的痕迹都没有。

@w4 似乎殖民者认为，无论是什么造成了这一切，都是它们从<color=#3333e5>UES 福岛</color>跟随而来的。@w2 那个曾占据飞船的神秘存在，可能也导致了殖民者的消失。

@w4 我建议不要在这里停留太久，@w1 以防他们的猜测是正确的，@w1 因为那个东西可能会试图跟随我们回到我们自己的飞船上……

English:
{PlayerName}, <color=#fed43e>Resources </color>in this galaxy seem to be very limited. Even the most basic <color=#fed43e>resources </color>are difficult to find in their pure form. 
@w2 It may be a good idea to learn how to <color=#fed43e>Reforge resource Ingots</color> from a more common form. @w2 The easiest <color=#fed43e>resources </color>to <color=#fed43e>Reforge </color>are those you can simply heat up to high temperatures in a <color=#fed43e>furnace</color>: <color=#fed43e>Iron</color>, <color=#fed43e>Silicon</color>, <color=#fed43e>Titanium</color>, and <color=#fed43e>Sathium</color>. 

Unlock the <color=#fed43e>Furnace </color>if you haven't already, then <color=#fed43e>Reforge </color>100 <color=#fed43e>Ingots </color>of any of these four <color=#fed43e>resources</color>.

Chinese (simplified):
{PlayerName}, <color=#fed43e>资源 </color>在这个星系中似乎非常有限。即使是最基本的<color=#fed43e>资源 </color>也很难找到其纯净形态。
@w2 学会如何从更常见的形态<color=#fed43e>重铸资源锭 </color>可能是个好主意。@w2 最容易<color=#fed43e>重铸 </color>的<color=#fed43e>资源 </color>是那些你只需在<color=#fed43e>熔炉 </color>中加热到高温的：<color=#fed43e>铁 </color>, <color=#fed43e>硅 </color>, <color=#fed43e>钛 </color>, 和<color=#fed43e>钑 </color>。

解锁<color=#fed43e>熔炉 </color>（如果尚未解锁），然后<color=#fed43e>重铸 </color>100个<color=#fed43e>锭 </color>，来自这四种<color=#fed43e>资源 </color>中的任意一种。

English:
Well Done! @w2 While Iron, Silicon, Titanium, and Sathium are easy to Reforge, Copper and Cobalt are less easily Reforged. 
@w4 These 'Combplex' Ingots require you to first turn other components into 'Scrap' of the appropriate type. @w2 You can strip the copper from electronics and the cobalt from Energy Matrices. @w2 Doing so destroys the other resources in the components, but provides easily Smeltable Scrap.

@w4 Reforge 50 Complex Ingots (Copper or Cobalt).

Chinese (simplified):
做得好！@w2 虽然铁、硅、钛和钑易于重铸，但铜和钴则不太容易重铸。
@w4 这些 '复合锭' 要求你先将其他部件转化为适当类型的 '废料'。@w2 你可以从电子元件中剥离铜，从能量矩阵中剥离钴。@w2 这样做会摧毁部件中的其他资源，但提供易于熔炼的废料。

@w4 重铸50个复合锭（铜或钴）。

