@p9 If you would be willing to aid us, @w1 we would not only pay a wealthy amount upon completion, @w1 but we would also ensure that you receive the highest honors within Polaris.

@w4 Do you accept?

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 博士 {PlayerName}，感谢你的回应。@w2 我是金斯拉尔博士，@w1 PMA的特殊研究主管。@w2 鉴于你之前在涉及遗留者感染残余的研究事宜上提供的帮助，@w1 我们想再次请求你的援助，事关……@w2 最高敏感度。

@p9 如果你愿意帮助我们，@w1 我们不仅在任务完成后支付丰厚报酬，@w1 还会确保你获得极星内部的最高荣誉。

@w4 你接受吗？

English:
@q0 Earlier this week, @w2 our researchers that were studying a Mysterious Structure on the surface of Vegra. @w2 While researching a strange growth within the structure, @w1 they discovered a key component to create a potential cure for the Legacy Infection. @w2 This is the closest we've ever come to creating such a cure. 

@p9 What we need from you, @w1 is to go to the Mysterious Structure, @w1 take possession of the potential cure, @w1 transport it to Polaris Medical Authority Headquarters on the edge of Polaris Space, @w1 and deliver it to our researchers there. @w4 Once you have done this, the mission will be complete.

@w4 Do you have any questions?

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 本周早些时候，@w2 我们在维格拉表面研究一个神秘结构的研究人员，@w2 在研究结构内的一种奇怪生长物时，@w1 他们发现了一种可能制造出遗留者感染解药的关键成分。@w2 这是我们离制造出这种解药最近的一次。

@p9 我们需要你做的，@w1 是前往神秘结构，@w1 获取可能的解药，@w1 将其运送到极星空间边缘的极星医疗管理局总部，@w1 并交给那里的研究人员。@w4 完成后，任务就结束了。

@w4 你还有什么问题吗？

English:
@q0 Great! @w2 I will contact the Research Lead at the Mysterious Structure and tell her to expect you.

@w4Go talk to Station Administrator Eldra in the room next to this one in order to get clearance to teleport to Vegra. @w2 Tell him you're working for me, @w1 and he should grant you clearance.

@w4 Good Luck!

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 太好了！@w2 我会联系神秘结构的研究负责人，告诉她你将来访。

@w4 去隔壁房间找空间站管理员埃尔德拉，获得传送到维格拉的许可。@w2 告诉他你在为我工作，@w1 他会授予你许可。

@w4 祝你好运！

English:
@q0 Very Well.
@w2 In that case, may I see your credentials?

@p9 @d0 Ah! @w1 Doctor {PlayerName}! @w1 Excellent! @w2 @d3  I was told to expect you.
@w2 I'll grant you planetary access immediately. @w2 You may use the Quarantine Teleporter to teleport down to Quarantine Base Epsilon.

@w4 The Access Code for the Teleporter is <color=#ffc800>6755</color>.

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 很好。
@w2 既然如此，我能看看你的证件吗？

@p9 @d0 啊！@w1 博士 {PlayerName}！@w1 太好了！@w2 @d3 我被告知你将来访。
@w2 我将立即授予你行星访问权限。 @w2 你可以使用检疫传送器传送到检疫基地埃普西隆。

@w4 传送器的访问代码是 <color=#ffc800>6755</color>。

English:
@q0 I told you to be careful with them! @w2 These cures aren't easy to make, you know!

@w4 I have a few more on hand, @w1 but I can't give them out for free.

@w4 I'll give you six more samples, @w1 but you'll have to pay me ten thousand credits per vial.

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 我告诉过你要小心保管它们！@w2 这些解药可不容易制作，你知道吗！

@w4 我手头还有一些，@w1 但我不能免费提供。

@w4 我会再给你六份样本，@w1 但每小瓶你得付我一万信用点。

English:
@q0 Welcome, Doctor {PlayerName}! @w2 We've been expecting you. 

@w4 The Legacy Research Lab is up the elevator at the top of the stairs to your left. @w2 Go up one floor, @w1 then across the Connection Bridge to the adjacent building. @w2 Just past the elevator is the Legacy Research Lab. @w2 Once you're there, give the samples to Doctor Ogl'Svan in the Lab, then use the elevator across from my desk to report to Director Jin'Slar in his office two floors down.

@p9 You'll need an ID Badge with Security Level 10 access to enter the Legacy Research Lab. Give me a moment and I'll provide one for you.

@w4 ...
@w4 ...
@w4 ...

@w4 Here you go. @w2 Have a good day.

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 欢迎，医生{PlayerName}！@w2 我们一直在等你。

@w4 遗留者研究实验室在你左手边楼梯顶部的电梯上方。@w2 上一层楼，@w1 然后穿过连接桥到相邻的建筑。@w2 电梯过去就是遗留者研究实验室。@w2 到了那里，把样本交给实验室里的奥格尔斯万医生，然后用我办公桌对面的电梯下两层楼，向金斯拉主任的办公室汇报。

@p9 你需要一个安全等级10的身份徽章才能进入遗留者研究实验室。稍等一下，我会为你提供一个。

@w4 ……
@w4 ……
@w4 ……

@w4 给你。@w2 祝你愉快。

English:
@q0 Thank You, {PlayerName}. @w4 Your efforts to aid Polaris Space Industries in ridding the galaxy of these <color=#57a86b>Ghost Ships</color> is greatly appreciated!

@w4 As promised, your credits are being transferred to you now, and we will spread the word of your aid to all of Polaris.

@p9 If you ever find yourself in possession of a large quantity of <color=#57a86b>Ectoplasm</color>, contact us and we will gladly provide you appropriate compensation.

@w4 Thanks again, {PlayerName}. @w2 Safe travels!

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 谢谢您，{PlayerName}。 @w4 您为极星太空工业清除星系中这些<color=#57a86b>幽灵船</color>所做的努力，我们深表感激！

@w4 如约，您的信用点正在转移中，我们将向整个极星宣传您的援助。

@p9 如果您日后持有大量<color=#57a86b>灵质</color>，请联系我们，我们将乐意为您提供适当补偿。

@w4 再次感谢，{PlayerName}。 @w2 一路平安！

English:
@q0 Arrival Log, Entry 1

@w4 The anomaly that appeared in front of the fleet just before we entered Cryo Sleep seems to have damaged several of our ship's navigational systems, @w1 but life support, @w1 maneuverability, @w1 and even the warp drive are still functional. @w2 I suppose it's fortunate we didn't suffer more damage, @w1 as the rest of the fleet is nowhere in visual range. 

@p9 Engineer Lockley managed to get the external sensors online, @w1 although what they're telling us makes no sense. @w2 Ensign Gammon tells me that the readings indicate that we've been deposited somewhere in the Andromeda Galaxy, @w1 and that based on the star positions and interstellar drift calculations, @w1 we've arrived around six hundred years after our initial departure.

@p9 I've ordered Doctor Wyse to maintain the Cryo Systems until we find a suitable location to try and set up a colony, @w1 as I believe our best course for survival is to find a safe place to settle, @w1 and wait to see if the rest of the fleet shows up.

@w4 - Captain Volante

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 抵达日志，第1条

@w4 就在我们进入低温睡眠前出现在舰队前方的异常现象似乎损坏了我们飞船的多个导航系统，@w1 但生命维持系统、@w1 机动能力，@w1 甚至翘曲引擎都仍然正常运作。@w2 我想幸运的是我们没有遭受更大的损伤，@w1 因为舰队其他船只不在任何可视范围内。

@p9 工程师洛克利设法恢复了外部传感器，@w1 但传感器显示的信息毫无意义。@w2 加蒙少尉告诉我，读数表明我们被传送到了仙女座星系中的某个位置，@w1 根据恒星位置和星际漂移计算，@w1 我们抵达的时间比最初出发晚了大约六百年。

@p9 我已命令怀斯医生维持低温系统，直到我们找到适合建立殖民地的地点，@w1 因为我相信我们最好的生存方案是找个安全的地方定居，@w1 然后等待舰队其他船只出现。

@w4 —— 船长沃兰特

English:
@q0 Arrival Log, Entry 2

@w4 An hour ago, we picked up the distress signal of the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo</color>. @w2 We're on an intercept course for the origin of the signal. @w2 As soon as we're in range, @w1 I've ordered Ensign Gammon to send out hails to the <color=#3333e5>Leo</color> in an attempt to contact them. @w2 Fortunately, @w1 Engineer Lockley was able to repair all the damaged systems in less than a day, @w1 and we're operating at peak efficiency.

@p9 Furthermore, @w1 Ensign Gammon has located a temperate planet that seems viable for a location to set up a Colony. @w2 Hopefully we'll be able to join with the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo</color> with efforts to set up a colony, @w1 although I'm concerned that their distress signal means they've run into some sort of trouble in this galaxy. 

@w4 - Captain Volante

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 抵达日志，第2条

@w4 一小时前，我们收到了<color=#3333e5>UES 狮子号</color>的求救信号。@w2 我们正在沿拦截航线前往信号源头。@w2 一进入通讯范围，@w1 我就命令加蒙少尉向<color=#3333e5>狮子号</color>发出呼叫，试图与他们取得联系。@w2 幸运的是，@w1 工程师洛克利在不到一天的时间内修复了所有受损系统，@w1 我们现在处于最佳运行状态。

@p9 此外，@w1 加蒙少尉发现了一个似乎适合建立殖民地的温带星球。@w2 希望我们能与<color=#3333e5>UES 狮子号</color>联手建立殖民地，@w1 不过我担心他们的求救信号意味着他们在这个星系中遇到了某种麻烦。

@w4 —— 船长沃兰特

English:
@q0 Arrival Log, Entry 3

@w4 While en route to the location of the distress signal of the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo</color>, @w1 we were able to make contact with some of the flight crew. @w2 They had apparently been attacked by an alien ship, @w1 and ejected the Modules of the <color=#3333e5>Leo </color>in hopes of escaping in one while Captain Earling remained on the ship to lure the attackers away. @w2 We found the Engineer, Medic, and Helmsman of the <color=#3333e5>Leo </color>hiding inside a Magnesium Asteroid where they had parked the Cryo Module they had escaped on. @w2 After rescuing them, @w1 we located the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo</color> adrift around a planet that was little more than an arid wasteland. @w2 Unfortunately, @w1 Captain Earling didn't make it.

@p9 We returned to the Temperate planet we found, @w1 and have landed the <color=#3333e5>Orion </color>on the low planes near one of the mountains. @w2 Doctor Wyse is in the process of awakening the passengers from Cryo Stasis while Engineer Lockley is beginning the disassembly process of the <color=#3333e5>Orion</color>, @w1 deciding how to use the limited parts we have to set up a small colony. @w2 While the original colonial plans were to set up a thriving city combining the parts of all the ships of the <color=#3333e5>United Earth Fleet</color>, @w1 we're having to figure out a plan for a much smaller settlement using only one ship. @w2 Engineer Lockley has his work cut out for him. 

@p9 Once we have the crew fully awakened, @w1 we'll have to decide on a governor for the colony, @w1 as well as assigning tasks to the colonists. @w2 We've got a lot of work ahead of us.

@w4 - Captain Volante

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 抵达日志，第3条

@w4 在前往<color=#3333e5>UES 狮子号</color>求救信号位置的途中，@w1 我们成功与部分飞行机组人员取得了联系。@w2 他们显然受到了外星飞船的攻击，@w1 并弹射出了<color=#3333e5>狮子号</color>的模块，希望乘其中一个逃生，而厄林船长则留在飞船上引开攻击者。@w2 我们发现<color=#3333e5>狮子号</color>的工程师、医护兵和舵手藏在一个镁质小行星里，他们把逃生的低温模块停在那里。@w2 救出他们后，@w1 我们找到了在几乎是一片干旱荒芜的星球上漂流着的<color=#3333e5>UES 狮子号</color>。@w2 不幸的是，@w1 厄林船长未能幸存。

@p9 我们回到了之前发现的那个温带星球，@w1 并将<color=#3333e5>猎户座号</color>降落在靠近一座山的低地平原上。@w2 怀斯医生正在将乘客从低温休眠中唤醒，而工程师洛克利则开始拆解<color=#3333e5>猎户座号</color>，@w1 决定如何利用我们有限的零件建立一个小的殖民地。@w2 虽然最初的殖民计划是结合<color=#3333e5>联合地球舰队</color>所有飞船的零件建立一个繁荣的城市，@w1 但我们不得不制定一个只使用一艘飞船的、规模小得多的定居点计划。@w2 工程师洛克利面临着艰巨的任务。

@p9 一旦所有船员完全苏醒，@w1 我们必须为殖民地选出一位总督，@w1 同时为殖民者分配任务。@w2 我们面前还有大量工作要做。

@w4 —— 船长沃兰特

English:
@q0 Engineer Log, Entry 1

@w4 We're not where we're supposed to be, @w1 despite what the ship's sensors are telling us. @w2 Apparently, @w1 that anomaly fried our ship's computer systems, @w1 navigational array, @w1 and external sensors. @w2 Fortunately, we have one of the best engineers in the fleet on board to fix it all. @w2 I can replace the navigational array with spare parts we have in cargo, @w1 and the external sensors should be repairable with some... @w1 creative re-wiring. @w2 The computer systems will take longer, @w1 requiring a complete re-programming of the primary IA. @w2 Perhaps I can give it a more pleasant personality while I'm at it.

@w4 - Engineer Lockley

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 工程师日志，条目 1

@w4 我们不在应该的位置，@w1 尽管飞船传感器显示并非如此。@w2 显然，@w1 那次异常烧毁了飞船的计算机系统、@w1 导航阵列@w1 和外部传感器。@w2 幸运的是，我们船上有舰队中最优秀的工程师之一来修复这一切。@w2 我可以用货舱中的备件替换导航阵列，@w1 外部传感器应该可以通过一些……@w1 创造性的重新布线来修复。@w2 计算机系统需要更长时间，@w1 需要对主AI进行完整的重新编程。@w2 也许我顺便可以给它一个更讨人喜欢的个性。

@w4 ——工程师洛克利

English:
@q0 Engineer Log, Entry 2

@w4 I don't like going further than we have to with the limited warp fuel we have. @w2 There's no guarantee we'll find a compatible fuel source for the warp drive when we run out. @w2 We've located a temperate planet that seems viable for colonization. @w2 The smart thing would be to land and begin setting up a colony as soon as possible, @w1 but we detected a distress signal from the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo</color>, @w1 and the Captain decided to try and warp over eighty light years to a system that MAY be the point of origin for their distress signal. @w2 That said, @w1 if we can join up with the <color=#3333e5>Leo</color>, @w1 we may be able to find a better location.

@w4 - Engineer Lockley

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 工程师日志，条目 2

@w4 我不想在有限的翘曲燃料下走不必要的远路。@w2 无法保证燃料耗尽后我们能找到兼容的燃料源来驱动翘曲引擎。@w2 我们找到了一颗适合殖民的温带星球。@w2 明智的做法是尽快着陆并开始建立殖民地，@w1 但我们探测到了来自<color=#3333e5>UES 狮子号</color>的求救信号，@w1 船长决定尝试翘曲超过八十光年，前往一个可能是求救信号源头的星系。@w2 也就是说，@w1 如果我们能与<color=#3333e5>狮子号</color>会合，@w1 也许能找到更好的地点。

@w4 ——工程师洛克利

English:
@q0 Medical Log, Entry 2

@w4 A few hours ago, we arrived in the system where the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo</color>'s distress signal originated. @w2 We were able to make contact with what remained of the <color=#3333e5>Leo</color>'s flight crew, @w1 who had taken refuge inside a Magnesium Asteroid. @w2 Apparently they were attacked by an alien ship almost as soon as they activated their distress beacon. @w2 Their captain opted to remain on the ship after they launched their Modules. @w2 Unfortunately, @w1 it appears that he did not make it, @w1 as we located the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo</color> badly damaged in orbit around this arid planet.

@p9 When the remaining crew came on board, @w1 the Captain had me look them over, @w1 to make sure they weren't badly injured. @w2 Fortunately, @w1 they appeared to be no worse off than we are. @w2 They've decided to come along with us back to the Temperate planet that Ensign Gammon had located a while back. @w2 With any luck, @w1 we'll be able to set up a small Colony settlement there.

@w4 - Doctor Wyse

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 医疗日志，条目 2

@w4 几个小时前，我们到达了<color=#3333e5>UES 狮子号</color>求救信号起源的星系。@w2 我们成功与<color=#3333e5>狮子号</color>的剩余飞行机组人员取得了联系，@w1 他们躲在一颗镁质小行星中。@w2 显然，他们一激活求救信标就遭到了外星飞船的攻击。@w2 他们的船长在发射模块后选择留在飞船上。@w2 不幸的是，@w1 他似乎没能幸存，@w1 因为我们在围绕这颗干旱星球运行的轨道上发现了严重受损的<color=#3333e5>UES 狮子号</color>。

@p9 当剩余船员登船时，@w1 船长让我检查了他们，@w1 以确保他们伤势不重。@w2 幸运的是，@w1 他们的状况似乎不比我们差。@w2 他们决定和我们一起回到伽蒙少尉之前找到的那颗温带星球。@w2 运气好的话，@w1 我们能在那里建立一个小型殖民地定居点。

@w4 ——怀斯医生

English:
@q0 Medical Log, Entry 1

@w4 I've just awoken from CryoStasis. @w1 The anomaly must have screwed up the Cryo Chamber's auto-revival system, @w1 because it indicates we've arrived at our intended destination, @w1 but there's nothing outside any of the windows. @w2 No Planets, @w1 Moons, @w1 not even a lonely asteroid. @w2 I'm reviving Engineer Lockley now so he can take a look at the systems. @w2 I'll revive the Captain and Helmsman as well, @w1 since there's no sign of any of the other ships from the fleet.

@p9 From what I can tell, @w1 the ship doesn't appear to have any significant damage due to the anomaly. @w2 All the Cryo Chambers in the five Cryo Modules are fully functional, @w1 and awaiting manual revival. @w2 With any Luck, Ensign Gammon will be able to locate a Temperate Planet relatively close by, and we can begin to settle down.

@w4 - Doctor Wyse

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 医疗日志，条目 1

@w4 我刚从低温休眠中醒来。@w1 那个异常肯定搞砸了低温舱的自动复苏系统，@w1 因为它显示我们已经到达了预定目的地，@w1 但窗外什么也没有。@w2 没有星球，@w1 没有卫星，@w1 连一颗孤独的小行星都没有。@w2 我现在正在唤醒工程师洛克利，让他检查一下系统。@w2 我也会唤醒船长和舵手，@w1 因为舰队中其他飞船毫无踪影。

@p9 据我所知，@w1 飞船似乎没有因异常而遭受严重损坏。@w2 五个低温模块中的所有低温舱都完全正常，@w1 等待手动复苏。@w2 运气好的话，伽蒙少尉能在相对近的地方找到一颗温带星球，我们就可以开始定居。

@w4 ——怀斯医生

English:
@q0 Helmsman's Log, Entry 1

@w4 Distant Galaxies, @w1 Time Travel, @w1 Spatial Anomalies that transport you vast distances. @w2 It all seems like something out of a Science Fiction novel. @w2 Now that the navigation and external sensors are back online, @w1 Captain Volante has me searching for potential Colony sites. @w2 We've already warped to three different G-type star systems, @w1 none of which have any planets that seem viable. 

@p9 We just arrived in the fourth G-type system. @w2 Scans indicate there is a Temperate planet here. @w2 Good Oxygen levels, @w1 Gravity within a few points of Earth Norm, @w1 no excessive toxins in the air. @w2 It seems that we may have found our... @d0 *beep* *beep*...

@p9 @d3 That's odd... @w1 I'm picking up a distress call on a <color=#3333e5>United Earth</color> frequency... @w1 *muffled* Captain Volante! @w1 We're picking up a distress signal from the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo</color>! @w2 Should I set a course to intercept?

@w4 *inaudible reply*

@w4 Looks like we're playing 'Rescue Ship' today.

@w4 - Ensign Gammon

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 舵手日志，条目 1

@w4 遥远的星系，@w1 时间旅行，@w1 将你传送至遥远距离的空间异常。@w2 这一切都像是科幻小说中的情节。@w2 既然导航和外部传感器已重新上线，@w1 沃兰特船长让我搜寻潜在的殖民地选址。@w2 我们已经翘曲到三个不同的G型恒星系统，@w1 但没有一个拥有看起来可行的星球。

@p9 我们刚到达第四个G型恒星系统。@w2 扫描显示这里有一颗温带星球。@w2 含氧量良好，@w1 重力接近地球标准值，@w1 空气中无过量毒素。@w2 看来我们可能找到了我们的……@d0 *哔哔* *哔哔*……

@p9 @d3 奇怪……@w1 我在一个<color=#3333e5>联合地球</color>频率上收到了求救信号……@w1 *闷声* 沃兰特船长！@w1 我们收到了来自<color=#3333e5>UES 狮子号</color>的求救信号！@w2 我应该设定拦截航线吗？

@w4 *听不清的回复*

@w4 看来我们今天要扮演‘救援船’了。

@w4 ——伽蒙少尉

