@p9 Arrival Log Entry 1
@w4 Upon emerging from the anomaly, @w1 the flight crew, @w1 including Ensign Steinman, our helmsman, @w1 Engineer Brown, @w1 Doctor Pong, @w1 and myself, @w1 were awakened from cryo-stasis. @w2 According to the ship's chronometer, @w1 we've only been in stasis for just over a year. 

@p9 However, @w1 based on an assessment of current astronomical positions from Ensign Steinman, @w1 We seem to have emerged from the anomaly some six hundred years after we left. @w2 Furthermore, @w1 our current position seems to be somewhere inside the Andromeda galaxy, @w1 which would have taken over a thousand years at warp. 
@w4 Despite this anomaly, @w1 I have decided that our best course of action is to try and assess our damages and ensure that the Cryo Chambers are all still functional.
@w4 - Captain Bodegar

