@w2 Attempting data retrieval...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...data retrieval complete.

@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the Captain of the <color=#3333e5>UES Rossignol</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 Arrival Log Entry 3
@w4 The asteroid field we took refuge in concealed a hidden Starship Graveyard. @w2 Whether the sight of an ancient battle, @w1 or the dumping ground for some alien race, @w1 is impossible to tell without more in-depth analysis. @w2 Regardless of its origin, @w1 it seems this junk field will be the final resting place of the <color=#3333e5>UES Rosignol</color>, @w1 as the drones have not only followed us into the field, @w1 but there were more waiting in ambush inside. @w2 We have no choice but to abandon ship, @w1 and pray that whatever cosmic forces reside in this galaxy watch over our passengers in Cryo Stasis until they revive on their own.
@w4 - Captain Bodegar

