@p9 Engineer's Log Entry 1
@w4 The trip through the anomaly has left the ship no worse for wear, @w1 although our power reserves are low, @w1 and slowly dropping further. @w2 Much of the power drained has left many Cryo Chambers failing. @w2 While Doctor Pong assesses the state of the Cryo Chambers, @w1 I will be taking inventory of our supplies. @w2 With any luck, @w1 we should have what we need to fix the power drain. 
@w4 - Engineer Brown

