English:
@q0 This terminal appears to be working.
@w2 Attempting data retrieval...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...data retrieval complete.

@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the helmsman of the <color=#3333e5>UES Rossignol</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 Helmsman 's Log, Entry 1
@w4 I've double checked my calculations, @w1 triple checked them, @w1 and I've come to the unnerving conclusion that despite the ship's chronometer saying we've only been in stasis for eleven months, fifteen days and eighteen hours, @w1 Earth Standard Time obviously, @w1 we have somehow arrived six hundred years in our future, @w1 somewhere in the galaxy of Andromeda. @w2 we're currently running on auxiliary power, @w1 with most of our main power diverted to the remaining Cryo-Chambers to save what's left of our passengers. @w2 Until we can determine a course, @w1 the Captain has us holding position, @w1 broadcasting our distress signal at full strength. @w2 Perhaps the rest of the fleet will detect our signal and come looking for us.
@w4 - Ensign Steinman

