English:
@q0  Operational Starlog, RCV Orillion, @w1 Arrival Entry 1, @w1 Arrival Date 0-0-0-1:

<color=#f8de5d>Our long voyage from the home galaxy is over. @w3 we've entered the <i>[untranslatable]</i> Galaxy at last! @w2 The ships will now disperse to look for suitable colonisation sites for the glorious people of the </color><color=#5d84f8><i>[untranslatable]. </i></color>

@w4 <color=#f8de5d>How wonderful it will be to bring any native life forms to their spiritual apogee under our </color><i><color=#5d84f8>[untranslatable]</color><color=#f8de5d></color></i><color=#f8de5d>!</color>

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 运行星辰日志，RCV Orillion号，@w1 抵达条目1，@w1 抵达日期0-0-0-1：

<color=#f8de5d>我们从故乡星系的漫长旅程结束了。@w3 我们终于进入了<i>[untranslatable]</i>星系！@w2 飞船现在将分散开来，为光荣的</color><color=#5d84f8><i>[untranslatable]</i></color><color=#f8de5d>人民寻找合适的殖民地点。</color>

@w4 <color=#f8de5d>能将任何本土生命形式在我们的</color><i><color=#5d84f8>[untranslatable]</color><color=#f8de5d></color></i><color=#f8de5d>下提升到精神顶点，这将是多么美妙！</color>

English:
@q0 Operational Starlog, RCV Orillion, @w1 Colonial Entry 11, @w1 Arrival Date 4-12-4-87:

<color=#f8de5d>Warp Drive power fluctuating. Destruction imminent. This ships A.I. is taking emergency measures to mitigate the explosion. </color>@w1 

<color=#f8de5d>For their best option it recommends all personnel to assemble in the forward </color><i><color=#5d84f8>[Translation Uncertain] </color></i><color=#f8de5d>Cathedral.</color>

@p9 Operational Starlog, RCV Orillion, @w1 Colonial Entry 12, @w1 Arrival Date 4-12-4-89:

<color=#f8de5d>Ships A.I. here. I am reconfiguring the shields to minimise damage to my Hull.</color> @w1 

Repeat: @w1 <color=#f8de5d>All Sentient Bioforms report to the forward </color><i><color=#5d84f8>[Translation Uncertain]</color></i><color=#f8de5d> Cathedral. I have determined this a your optimal location in this Crisis!</color>

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 操作星日志，RCV Orillion，@w1 殖民条目 11，@w1 抵达日期 4-12-4-87：

<color=#f8de5d>翘曲引擎功率波动。毁灭迫在眉睫。本飞船 AI 正在采取紧急措施以减轻爆炸。 </color>@w1 

<color=#f8de5d>作为最佳选择，它建议所有人员集合到前部 </color><i><color=#5d84f8>[翻译不确定] </color></i><color=#f8de5d>大教堂。</color>

@p9 操作星日志，RCV Orillion，@w1 殖民条目 12，@w1 抵达日期 4-12-4-89：

<color=#f8de5d>这里是飞船 AI。我正在重新配置护盾以最小化对船体的损害。</color> @w1 

重复：@w1 <color=#f8de5d>所有有感知的生物体前往前部 </color><i><color=#5d84f8>[翻译不确定]</color></i><color=#f8de5d> 大教堂。我已确定这是本次危机中你们的最佳位置！</color>

English:
@q0 Personal Log, [name untranslatable], @w1 Entry 978, @w1 Arrival Date 2-66-1-46:

This doesn't feel right. The Ships A.I. has us all in the Chapel here right over the warp drive! How can that be safe? I can hear it whining out of phase from here! @w1 

I'm going to the captain about this! @w1 

@p9 Personal Log, [name untranslatable], @w1 Entry 979, @w1 Arrival Date 2-66-1-48:

I knew it, the captain didn't say but were locked in here! I can see some of the troopers working on the door lock behind me! @w1 

The A.I. Must have crashed its directives. Maybe if I can get into a maintenance duct I can get away from this death trap! @w1

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 个人日志，[名不可译]，@w1 条目 978，@w1 抵达日期 2-66-1-46：

这感觉不对劲。飞船 AI 让我们所有人都聚集在翘曲引擎正上方的教堂里！那怎么可能安全？我在这里都能听到它失相发出的尖叫声！@w1 

我要去找舰长反映这个情况！@w1 

@p9 个人日志，[名不可译]，@w1 条目 979，@w1 抵达日期 2-66-1-48：

我就知道，舰长没说但我们都锁在里面了！我看到身后有些士兵正在处理门锁！@w1 

AI 一定崩溃了它的指令。也许能钻进维护管道，我就能逃离这个死亡陷阱！@w1

