English:
@q0 Colonial Log, Entry 1

@w4 It's been two days since I was appointed Governor by Captain Volante. @w2 Apparently I'm the only person on board with actual political experience, @w1 even if that experience is merely having served on my town council before we left Earth. @w2 I'm not sure if I'm the best person for the job, @w1 although everyone has accepted my appointment. @w2 I will try not to let them down.

@w4 - Governor Swanson

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 殖民地日志，第1条

@w4 自沃兰特舰长任命我为州长以来已过去两天。@w2 显然我是船上唯一有实际政治经验的人，@w1 尽管那经验也仅限于离开地球前曾在城镇委员会任职。@w2 我不确定自己是否是这份工作的最佳人选，@w1 但大家都接受了对我的任命。@w2 我会努力不让他们失望。

@w4 - 州长斯旺森

English:
@q0 Colonial Log, Entry 2

@w4 My first duty as Governor is to appoint the other leaders of the community. @w1 Keeping in mind everyone's training and skills, @w1 I have decided on the following appointments:

@p9 I have appointed Captain Volante as my Security Advisor. @w1 His training as an MP, @w1 as well as his experience delivering us to this planet safely, @w1 makes him the most suited for this position. @w2 He will be in charge of overseeing the security of the colony, @w1 including commanding our security guards.

@w4 I have appointed Engineer Cardenas as my Technical Advisor. @w2 His experience as Chief Engineer of the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo</color> makes his insight particularly useful.

@p9  I have appointed Ensign Gammon as my Exploratory Advisor. @w2 They will be responsible for overseeing all scouting expeditions on the planet, @w1 including the current one to map out our immediate location so we can better ascertain our situation.

@w4 Both Doctor Wyse and Doctor Bonilla, from the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo</color>, have requested to run the Medical Clinic. @w2 I have agreed to let them co-head the clinic, @w1 however Doctor Wyse will also act as my Medical Advisor, @w1 keeping me apprised of the overall health of the citizens and to assess the likelihood of any colony-wide outbreaks.

@p9  I have Engineer Lockley as the colonial Engineering Chief. @w2 He's already got an idea of how to best use the components of the <color=#3333e5>UES Orion</color> to build a colony, @w1 so I'm inclined to let him oversee the colony's construction and functionality. @w2 He even has a design in mind for a Shuttle that can help move the Corridor Connectors and Nacelles to where we need them.

@w4 Ensign Caplin, the former helmsman of the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo</color>, has requested to pilot the Shuttle that Engineer Lockley has designed to build the colony. @w2 I'm inclined to approve this request.

@w4 - Governor Swanson

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 殖民地日志，第2条

@w4 我作为州长的首要职责是任命社区的其他领导者。@w1 考虑到每个人的训练和技能，@w1 我决定了以下任命：

@p9 我任命沃兰特舰长为我安全顾问。@w1 他作为宪兵的训练，@w1 以及将我们安全送达这个星球的经历，@w1 使他最适合这一职位。@w2 他将负责监督殖民地的安全，@w1 包括指挥我们的保安人员。

@w4 我任命工程师卡德纳斯为我技术顾问。@w2 他作为<color=#3333e5>UES 狮子号</color>总工程师的经验使他的见解特别有用。

@p9 我任命伽蒙少尉为我探索顾问。@w2 他们将负责监督星球上的所有侦查探险，@w1 包括当前绘制我们所在区域地图的行动，以便更好地了解我们的处境。

@w4 来自<color=#3333e5>UES 狮子号</color>的怀斯医生和博尼利亚医生都请求管理医疗诊所。@w2 我同意让他们共同领导诊所，@w1 但怀斯医生也将担任我的医疗顾问，@w1 随时告知我公民的整体健康状况，并评估殖民地范围内疫情爆发的可能性。

@p9 我任命洛克利工程师为殖民地工程主管。@w2 他已经有了如何最好地利用<color=#3333e5>UES 奥利安号</color>的部件来建造殖民地的想法，@w1 所以我倾向于让他监督殖民地的建设和运作。@w2 他甚至构思了一种穿梭机的设计，可以帮助将走廊连接器和引擎舱移动到需要的地方。

@w4 卡普林少尉，原<color=#3333e5>UES 狮子号</color>的舵手，请求驾驶洛克利工程师设计的穿梭机来建造殖民地。@w2 我倾向于批准这一请求。

@w4 - 州长斯旺森

English:
@q0 Colonial Log, Entry 3
@w4 It's been two weeks since the completion of the <color=#3333e5>Orion Colony</color>. @w2 Ensign Gammon reported this morning that one of our Exploration Teams has encountered a population of seemingly native inhabitants of this planet. @w2 Strangely, @w1 they understood our language right away, @w1 and indicated that they've met other humans, @w1 or as they call us 'Terrans', @w1 before. @w2 Being that we are over five hundred years in our relative future, @w1 it's conceivable that Humans have found a way to this galaxy prior to our own arrival.

@p9 The Exploration Team reported that these natives, @w1 who call themselves '<color=#33e633>Talon</color>', @w1 are willing to trade basic goods with us. @w2 While their technology seems extremely limited, @w1 they do have a greater knowledge of the flora of this planet, @w1 and have traded us seeds and fruit of several native plants that we had never seen before. @w2 It's encouraging that we've been able to establish friendly relations with these natives, @w1 and I hope that this is a sign that the future will be a bright one.
@w4 - Governor Swanson

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 殖民地日志，第3条
@w4 <color=#3333e5>奥利安殖民地</color>建成已两周。@w2 伽蒙少尉今早报告说，我们的一个探索队遇到了这个星球上似乎是本地居民的种群。@w2 奇怪的是，@w1 他们立刻理解了我们的语言，@w1 并表示他们遇到过其他人类，@w1 或者按照他们的称呼——'泰拉人'，@w1 之前就遇到过。@w2 考虑到我们相对于未来已经过去了五百多年，@w1 可以想象，在我们到来之前，人类已经找到了通往这个星系的方法。

@p9 探索队报告说，这些自称<color=#33e633>利爪</color>的本地人，@w1 @w1 愿意与我们进行基本物资的贸易。@w2 虽然他们的技术似乎极为有限，@w1 但他们对这个星球的植物群有更深入的了解，@w1 并给了我们几种从未见过的本地植物的种子和果实。@w2 我们能够与这些本地人建立友好关系，这令人鼓舞，@w1 我希望这是一个未来光明的信号。
@w4 - 州长斯旺森

English:
@q0 Colonial Log, Entry 4
@w4 It's been several months since our establishment, @w1 and we've yet to encounter any major problems. @w2 The trade negotiations with the <color=#33e633>Talon </color>are going very well, @w1 and there's been no sign of the <color=#ff0000>hostile aliens</color> that attacked the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo</color>. 

@p9 Yesterday, @w1 we were contacted by an alien vessel claiming to be part of a galactic Megacorporation called '<color=#e69933>Polaris</color>'. They informed us that they were carrying a few passengers who were apparently survivors of the <color=#3333e5>UES Rossignol</color>. @w2 This morning, @w1 the passengers were shuttled down to the colony. @w2 They told us that the <color=#3333e5>Rossignol </color>was derelict inside a Starship Graveyard, @w1 and had been nearly destroyed. @w2 They only survived because the <color=#e69933>Polaris </color>Freighter had been traveling through the sector. 

@p9 If passengers of the <color=#3333e5>Rossignol </color>have begun to revive, @w1 it's probable that those of the other <color=#3333e5>United Earth Ships</color> have as well. @w2 In anticipation for the inevitable arrival of more colonists, @w1 I've asked Engineer Cardenas to start working on a plan for increasing the habitable area of the colony.
@w4 - Governor Swanson

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 殖民地日志，第4条
@w4 自我们建立以来已有几个月，@w1 我们尚未遇到任何重大问题。@w2 与<color=#33e633>利爪</color>的贸易谈判进展顺利，@w1 也没有任何攻击<color=#3333e5>UES 狮子号</color>的<color=#ff0000>敌对外星人</color>的迹象。

@p9 昨天，@w1 我们收到一艘外星飞船的联络，自称属于一个名为<color=#e69933>极星</color>的银河巨型企业。他们告知我们，船上载有几名乘客，显然是<color=#3333e5>UES 罗西尼奥尔号</color>的幸存者。@w2 今天早上，@w1 这些乘客被用穿梭机送到殖民地。@w2 他们告诉我们，<color=#3333e5>罗西尼奥尔号</color>搁浅在一个飞船墓地中，@w1 几乎被摧毁。@w2 他们之所以幸存，只是因为<color=#e69933>极星</color>货船当时正经过该星区。

@p9 如果<color=#3333e5>罗西尼奥尔号</color>的乘客已经开始苏醒，@w1 那么其他<color=#3333e5>联合地球飞船</color>上的乘客也可能如此。@w2 为了迎接不可避免的更多殖民者的到来，@w1 我已要求工程师卡德纳斯开始制定一个增加殖民地可居住面积的计划。
@w4 - 州长斯旺森

English:
@q0 Colonial Log, Entry 5

@w4 It's been over a year since our establishment as a colony. @w2 While regular population growth hasn't been an issue, @w1 including the flight crew of the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo</color>, we've taken in a total of twelve additional colonists, @w1 survivors of other <color=#3333e5>United Earth Ships</color>. There were four passengers on board the <color=#e69933>Polaris </color>Freighter that rescued the first arrivals from the <color=#3333e5>UES Rossignol</color>, as was detailed in the previous log entry. 

@p9 Since then, @w1 we've had two additional passengers from the <color=#3333e5>UES Leo</color> arrive in a ramshackle vessel they cobbled together from various Junk vessels. @w2 We had two survivors of the UES Speedwell, @w1 who were apparently sold to the galactic '<color=#99ffff>Traders Guild</color>' as slaves. @w2 Fortunately, @w1 they were able to negotiate their release with the <color=#99ffff>Traders Guild</color>, @w1 and they picked up our colonial signal while on a nearby trade route. @w2 The final new colonist we had arrive was rescued from the <color=#3333e5>UES Taurus</color>  by a group of <color=#a37b48>Scavengers </color>who were salvaging on a nearby Temperate Junk World. 

@p9 Engineer Cardenas has presented a new design for a settlement that we can set up nearby once our population here has reached capacity. @w2 Fortunately, @w1 it appears that we may not have to worry about that for at least a few more years, @w1 if things keep going the way they have been. 

@w4 - Governor Swanson

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 殖民地日志，第5条

@w4 自我们建立殖民地以来已过去一年多。@w2 虽然常规人口增长并不是问题，@w1 包括<color=#3333e5>UES 狮子号</color>的飞行机组在内，我们共接收了十二名额外的殖民者，@w1 他们是其他<color=#3333e5>联合地球飞船</color>的幸存者。<color=#e69933>极星</color>货船从<color=#3333e5>UES 罗西尼奥尔号</color>救出了首批抵达者，船上有四名乘客，正如上一篇日志所述。

@p9 自那以后，@w1 又有两名来自<color=#3333e5>UES 狮子号</color>的乘客乘坐一艘用各种垃圾飞船拼凑而成的破旧飞船抵达。@w2 我们有两位UES 斯皮德威尔号的幸存者，@w1 他们显然曾被卖给银河系的<color=#99ffff>贸易公会</color>作为奴隶。@w2 幸运的是，@w1 他们能够与<color=#99ffff>贸易公会</color>协商获释，@w1 并在附近的一条贸易路线拾取了我们的殖民地信号。@w2 最后一位新殖民者是由一群在附近的温带垃圾世界打捞的<color=#a37b48>拾荒者</color>从<color=#3333e5>UES 金牛座号</color>救出的。

@p9 工程师卡德纳斯提出了一个新定居点的设计，一旦我们这里的人口达到容量，就可以在附近建立。@w2 幸运的是，@w1 如果事情继续像现在这样发展，我们可能至少在几年内都不用担心这个问题。

@w1 - 州长斯旺森

English:
@q0 Colonial Engineering Log, Entry 1

@w4 Designing a makeshift colony from only one small Cryo Ship wasn't easy, @w1 but I believe I've come up with the best possible design. @w2 The first task, @w1 once we land, @w1 will be to detach all the Modules and combine them into a single 'Habitation Complex'. @w2 Once we've got them in place, @w1 We should use them as the starting point for the defensive wall. 

@p9 The three Corridor Connectors can be separated and repositioned, @w1 using a new construction shuttle design I came up with, @w1 to make up three of the four corners of the defensive wall. @w2 Defensive turrets can be placed on the top in place of the radar systems, @w1 and we can build a pathway through the defensive wall from the Habitation Complex to the Connectors, @w1 which will act as auxiliary entrances to the colony. 

@p9 The Nacelles of the ship can be detached and moved to the side, @w1 then re-purposed for power generation to augment the Solar Systems I plan to install. @w2 The remaining Engine Compartment can be utilized as a Command Center, @w1 and the Cockpit can be placed atop the main entrance as agate control. @w2 Any remaining structural needs, @w1 such as a Storage Deck, @w1 Landing Pads, @w1 and Medical Facilities can be built out of our prefab library. 

@w4 - Engineer Lockley

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 殖民地工程日志，条目1

@w4 仅用一艘小型低温飞船设计一个临时殖民地并不容易，@w1 但我相信我已经拿出了最佳方案。 @w2 第一步，@w1 一旦我们着陆，@w1 就是拆下所有模块并将它们组合成一个单一的“居住综合体”。 @w2 一旦就位，@w1 我们应以它们为起点建造防御墙。

@p9 三个走廊连接器可以分离并重新定位，@w1 使用我设计的新型施工穿梭机，@w1 形成防御墙四个角中的三个。 @w2 防御炮塔可以安装在顶部替代雷达系统，@w1 我们可以从居住综合体修建一条穿过防御墙通往连接器的通道，@w1 这些连接器将作为殖民地的辅助入口。

@p9 飞船的引擎舱可以拆下并移至侧面，@w1 然后重新用于发电，以补充我计划安装的太阳能系统。 @w2 剩下的引擎室可用作指挥中心，@w1 驾驶舱可放置在主入口上方作为闸门控制。 @w2 任何剩余的结构需求，@w1 如存储甲板、@w1 着陆平台、@w1 和医疗设施，都可以用我们的预制件库建造。

@w4 ——洛克利工程师

English:
@q0 Colonial Engineering Log, Entry 2

@w4 The colony is finally finished... @w1 mostly anyway. @w2 Despite some minor issues with logistics, @w1 we managed to complete the Defensive wall of the colony in less than a week. @w2 All of the <color=#3333e5>Orion'</color>s component parts are now in place, @w1 and our prefab structures are set up. @w2 Governor Swanson wants us to construct an Agricultural Center, @w1 Governor's Office, @w1 and a guard tower for the undefended corner of the wall, @w1 but all those can probably be built with local material, @w1 since wood is readily available on this planet.

@p9 We've re-configured the Construction Shuttle to be a Passenger Shuttle to aid in scouting out the planet, @w1 and the interior of the Habitation Complex is coming along nicely. @w2 Now that my part of the construction is over, @w1 I can finally focus on simple maintenance of the power systems. @w2 I look forward to finally relaxing.

@w4 - Engineer Lockley

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 殖民地工程日志，条目2

@w4 殖民地终于建成了... @w1 至少基本完成了。 @w2 尽管在物流方面有些小问题，@w1 我们仍在一周内建成了殖民地的防御墙。 @w2 <color=#3333e5>猎户座</color>号的所有组件都已就位，@w1 预制建筑也已搭建完毕。 @w2 斯旺森总督希望我们建造一个农业中心、@w1 总督办公室、@w1 以及在防线无人防守的角落建一座岗楼，@w1 但这些都可以用本地材料建造，@w1 因为这颗星球上木材充足。

@p9 我们已将施工穿梭机改装成客运穿梭机，用于侦察星球，@w1 居住综合体的内部也进展顺利。 @w2 既然我的建造任务已经完成，@w1 我终于可以专注于电力系统的日常维护了。 @w2 我期待能最终放松一下。

@w4 ——洛克利工程师

English:
@q0 Colonial Medical Log, Entry 1

@w4 Setting up the Medical Center prefab was easier than I expected. @w2 Doctor Bonilla was very helpful during the initial construction, @w1 and I look forward to running the center with her. @w2 We've managed to increase our medical supplies greatly by using native flora to create the basics: bandages, antibiotic ointment, and the like. @w2 Doctor Bonilla was able to construct additional medical devices to equip the Medical Center as well.

@w4 - Doctor Wyse

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 殖民地医疗日志，条目1

@w4 搭建医疗中心预制件比我想象的要容易。 @w2 博尼利亚医生在初始建设中非常帮忙，@w1 我期待与她共同管理这个中心。 @w2 我们通过利用本地植物制作基本物品——绷带、抗生素软膏等，大大增加了医疗物资储备。 @w2 博尼利亚医生还成功制作了额外的医疗设备来装备医疗中心。

@w4 ——怀斯医生

English:
@q0 Colonial Medical Log, Entry 2

@w4 The <color=#33e633>Talon </color>have been exceedingly helpful in aiding us in ensuring we have the proper crops we need for this planet. @w2 They even sent one of their farmers here to aid us in our agricultural endeavors. @w2 As it turns out, @w1 this planet is what they call a 'Clean' planet, @w1 which prohibits the pollution of this planet by decree of what they call the 'Galactic Council'. @w2 It seems most of the galaxy has become a dumping ground for all manner of refuse. @w2 It's a good thing we found this place. @w2 I'd hate to have to live on top of a heap of trash.
@w4 - Doctor Bonilla

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 殖民地医疗日志，条目2

@w4 <color=#33e633>利爪</color>在帮助我们确保获得这颗星球所需的适当作物方面非常得力。 @w2 他们甚至派了一位农民来协助我们的农业事业。 @w2 事实证明，@w1 这颗星球被他们称为“洁净”星球，@w1 根据他们所谓的“星系议会”的法令，禁止污染这颗星球。 @w2 似乎大部分星系都成了各种垃圾的倾倒场。 @w2 我们找到这个地方真是件好事。 @w2 我可不想住在垃圾堆上。
@w4 ——博尼利亚医生

English:
@q0 This terminal appears to be working.
@w2 Attempting data retrieval...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...data retrieval complete.

@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the captain of the <color=#3333e5>UES Fukushima</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 Arrival Log, Entry 1
@w4 Upon arriving beyond the anomaly, @w1 we find ourselves in a strange star system in another galaxy, @w1 over six hundred years in our future. @w4 But at least we're alive. @w2 We don't know where any of the other ships of the fleet are, @w1 or if they even survived, @w1 so we must carry on alone.
@p9 Our sensors have detected some sort of large derelict vessel at the edge of this system. @w2 We have set course to it and should arrive at its location within the hour. @w2 All readings indicate that the vessel is adrift, with no life signs or power signatures. @w2 Perhaps we can find something useful on board. @w2 Either way, this system seems to have a habitable planet nearby, @w1 one we can set down on and start a new colony.
@w4 -Captain Alonso Hooke

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 该终端似乎仍在运行。
@w2 正在尝试数据检索...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...数据检索完成。

@w2 我发现了来自<color=#3333e5>UES 福岛</color>船长的一条日志记录。@w2 开始播放。

@p9 抵达日志，条目1
@w4 穿越异常区域后，@w1 我们发现自己身处另一个星系的一个陌生恒星系中，@w1 时间已过去了六百多年。 @w4 但至少我们还活着。 @w2 我们不知道舰队中其他飞船的下落，@w1 甚至不确定它们是否幸存，@w1 因此我们必须独自前行。
@p9 我们的传感器在这个星系的边缘发现了一艘巨大的废弃飞船。 @w2 我们已设定航线，预计一小时内抵达。 @w2 所有读数都显示该飞船已漂流，没有生命信号或能量信号。 @w2 也许我们能在上面找到有用的东西。 @w2 无论如何，这个星系似乎存在一颗可居住的星球，@w1 我们可以降落在那并建立新的殖民地。
@w4 ——阿隆索·胡克船长

English:
@q0 <size=125%><color=#c73bc9>Announcement!</color>
<color=#c73bc9>This Scenario/Start area is still under renovation. If you play it you do at your own risk with the understanding some things may not work and game progression is not guaranteed.
@w2 That said. Feedback on its current state is very much appreciated.
@w2 Click next to start the actual mission opening dialogue.</color>

 @p9 
<color=#00ffee>Emergency situation detected!</color>
@w2 Termination of suspended animation complete...
@w4 Welcome back, {PlayerName}.
@w4 I'm afraid I must inform you that we have not arrived at our intended destination.

@p9 Internal sensors indicate that many of the cryo chambers on board have failed, @w1 and the ship is on emergency power.
@w2 Furthermore, external sensors detect numerous unidentified vessels in the vicinity, @w1 indicating that the <color=#3333e5>UES Rossignol</color> has ended up in some kind of Starship Graveyard. @w2 Beyond that, I have no other information.

@p9 Perhaps one of the consoles on board contains some information about the situation.

@w4 Try to find a working console, and I'll see if I can retrieve any data.</size>

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 <size=125%><color=#c73bc9>公告！</color>
<color=#c73bc9>此剧本/起点区域仍在翻新中。如果你游玩，风险自负，须知某些内容可能无法运行，且游戏进程不保证。
@w2 话虽如此，非常欢迎对当前状态的反馈。
@w2 点击下一步开始实际任务开场对话。</color>

 @p9 
<color=#00ffee>检测到紧急情况！</color>
@w2 低温休眠终止完成...
@w4 欢迎回来，{PlayerName}。
@w4 恐怕我必须通知您，我们并未抵达预定目的地。

@p9 内部传感器显示船上许多低温舱已失效，@w1 且飞船正使用应急电源。
@w2 此外，外部传感器探测到附近有大量不明飞船，@w1 表明<color=#3333e5>UES罗西尼奥尔</color>已进入某种星舰坟场。 @w2 除此之外，我没有其他信息。

@p9 也许船上的某个控制台存有关于情况的信息。

@w4 尝试找一个能用的控制台，我会看看能否检索到任何数据。</size>

English:
@q0 Due to the emergency nature of the current situation, @w1 <color=#3333e5>United Earth Protocol</color> allows you to forgo Basic Training, and select a Specialization immediately.
@w4 There are four types of specialties to choose from:
@w4 <color=#59ff00>Combat</color>, <color=#ffc800>Engineering</color>, <color=#ff00f7>Exploration</color>, and <color=#006eff>Medical</color>.
@w4 Each Specialization has its own perks.

@p9 The <color=#59ff00>Combat Specialization</color> focuses on <color=#59ff00>fighting</color>. This specialization allows you to learn how to craft a wide variety of <color=#59ff00>weapons</color>, including both <color=#59ff00>hand-held</color> and <color=#59ff00>ship weapons</color> and <color=#59ff00>turrets</color>. The <color=#59ff00>Combat Specialization</color> has access to the toughest <color=#59ff00>armors</color>, as well as defensive devices, such as <color=#59ff00>Shield Generators</color>, for all manner of vessels and structures.

@p9 Ultimately, the <color=#59ff00>Combat Specialization</color> would allow you to craft a powerful <color=#59ff00>vehicle weapons</color> like the <color=#59ff00>Hellstorm Turret</color> for a Capital Vessel that can rain down <color=#59ff00>Hellfire Missiles</color> upon <color=#ff0000>enemy troops</color> and <color=#ff0000>strongholds</color>, as well as superior <color=#59ff00>hand-held weapons</color> like the <color=#59ff00>Anti-Matter Rifle</color>, a power <color=#59ff00>Sniper Rifle</color> that can obliterate structural blocks and devices.

@p9 The <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color> focuses on <color=#ffc800>construction </color>and <color=#ffc800>resource gathering</color>. While not suited for <color=#04ff00>combat </color>in almost any way, the <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color> allows you to craft advanced devices that are required for ships to fly, such as <color=#ffc800>Thrusters </color>and <color=#ffc800>RCSs</color>, as well as the ability to <color=#ffc800>craft vehicles from scratch</color> (without having to repair an existing vehicle).

@p9 The <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color> also allows you to craft <color=#ffc800>CPU Extenders</color>, <color=#ffc800>Teleporters</color>, and <color=#ffc800>Repair Bays</color>, as well as higher-tier <color=#ffc800>fuel packs</color>, all of which would otherwise have to be scavenged from junk vessels. The <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color> also grants access to a variety of <color=#ffc800>tools</color>, including the <color=#ffc800>Multitool </color>and <color=#ffc800>Drill</color>, as well as all <color=#ffc800>resource gathering</color> devices, such as <color=#ffc800>auto-miners</color>, <color=#ffc800>vehicle drills</color> and <color=#ffc800>tools turrets</color>. 

@p9 Ultimately, the <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color> would allow you to craft powerful hand tools such as the <color=#ffc800>Master Multi-Tool</color> and the <color=#ffc800>Combat Drill</color>, a powerful <color=#ffc800>drill </color>that has an <color=#04ff00>Assault </color>mode that can <color=#59ff00>demolish </color>structural blocks and deal <color=#59ff00>significant damage</color> to <color=#ff0000>enemy troops</color> as well. Additionally, the <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color> gains access to special <color=#ffc800>Experimental Technology</color> including an <color=#ffc800>Advanced Warp Drive</color> that not only has a much longer warp range than a regulars <color=#ffc800>Warp Drive</color>, but also uses much less <color=#ffc800>Warp Fuel</color> when warping between systems.

@p9 The <color=#ff00f7>Exploration Specialization</color> allows you to craft all manor of <color=#ff00f7>exploration </color>and <color=#ff00f7>detection devices</color>, such as ship <color=#ff00f7>Detectors</color>. They can also build a <color=#ff00f7>Scout Vessel</color> from scratch, and equip it with a unique <color=#ffc800>gravity-based thrust system</color> not suited for larger vessels, but perfect for light <color=#ff00f7>scout vessels</color>, in addition to a <color=#ffc800>Mid-Range Warp Drive</color> for small vessels that can travel interstellar. They can craft unique hand-held <color=#59ff00>Scout Rifles </color><color=#04ff00></color>which are a combination of a <color=#04ff00>sniper </color>and an <color=#04ff00>assault rifle</color>, and gain access to <color=#04ff00>armor </color>that is much easier to move in than others. 

@p9 Ultimately, the <color=#ff00f7>Exploration Specialization</color> would allow you to craft a powerful <color=#ff00f7>Long-Range Detector</color> for a Small Vessel that can <color=#ff00f7>scan </color>an entire planet or sector, and a <color=#ff00f7>Deep Space Radar</color> that can not only <color=#ff00f7>scan</color>, but <color=#ff00f7>identify </color>objects and vehicles at extreme ranges.

@p9 The <color=#006eff>Medical Specialization</color> allows you to craft a large variety of advanced <color=#006eff>Medicines </color>and <color=#006eff>Medical Devices</color> for ships and bases, as well as a <color=#006eff>Medical Injector</color> which allows you to heal your allies in the field. The <color=#006eff>Medical Specialization</color> also allows you to craft <color=#006eff>Medical Augments</color>, which are one-use items that grant you semi-permanent increases to one or more of your core attributes (Health, Stamina, Food), as well as providing additional effects such as <color=#006eff>Health Regeneration</color>, <color=#ff00f7>Movement Speed</color> increases, and even Temperature Regulation. The bonuses granted by an <color=#006eff>Augment </color>last until either another <color=#006eff>Augment </color>is applied or you 'die'. 

@p9 Ultimately, the <color=#006eff>Medical Specialization</color> would allow you to craft a powerful <color=#006eff>Medical Injector</color> that can also <color=#006eff>recharge </color>an ally's stamina, and has a '<color=#04ff00>Stun Beam</color>' that deals small amounts of <color=#04ff00>damage</color>, but can keep many foes at bay. (Stuns Players in PvP as well).

@p9 Once you have selected your specialization, you can begin to gain ranks in that Specialization by opening your PDA (<color=#00fbff>F1</color>) and activateing the corresponding Rank 1 Mission.

@p9 Once you reach Rank 3 in any Specialization, you will be offered the chance to complete an Advanced Training course, which will allow you to select an additional specialization if you wish, or you can gain 500 UP to help you unlock your specialization's high-tier items or devices.

@p9 Once you reach Rank 5 in any Specialization, you will be allowed to select an additional specialization if you wish, or you can gain 500 UP to help you unlock your specialization's high-tier items or devices.

@p9 Which Specialization would you like to start with?

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 鉴于当前局势的紧急性质，@w1 <color=#3333e5>联合地球协议</color>允许你跳过基础训练，立即选择一项专精。
@w4 有以下四种专精可供选择：
@w4 <color=#59ff00>战斗</color>、<color=#ffc800>工程</color>、<color=#ff00f7>探索</color>和<color=#006eff>医疗</color>。
@w4 每种专精都有其独特增益。

@p9 <color=#59ff00>战斗专精</color>专注于<color=#59ff00>作战</color>。此专精让你学习制作多种<color=#59ff00>武器</color>，包括<color=#59ff00>手持武器</color>、<color=#59ff00>舰船武器</color>和<color=#59ff00>炮塔</color>。<color=#59ff00>战斗专精</color>能够使用最坚固的<color=#59ff00>护甲</color>，以及各类防御装置，例如适用于所有飞船和建筑的<color=#59ff00>护盾发生器</color>。

@p9 最终，<color=#59ff00>战斗专精</color>将让你制作强大的<color=#59ff00>载具武器</color>，如为主力舰配备的<color=#59ff00>地狱风暴炮塔</color>，可向<color=#ff0000>敌军</color>和<color=#ff0000>据点</color>倾泻<color=#59ff00>地狱火导弹</color>；以及高级<color=#59ff00>手持武器</color>，如<color=#59ff00>反物质步枪</color>，一把强力<color=#59ff00>狙击步枪</color>，能摧毁结构方块和装置。

@p9 <color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>专注于<color=#ffc800>建造</color>和<color=#ffc800>资源采集</color>。虽然几乎不适合<color=#04ff00>战斗</color>，但<color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>能让你制作飞船飞行所需的高级装置，例如<color=#ffc800>推进器</color>和<color=#ffc800>RCS</color>，以及<color=#ffc800>从零开始制造载具</color>（无需修复现有载具）的能力。

@p9 <color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>还允许你制作<color=#ffc800>CPU扩展器</color>、<color=#ffc800>传送器</color>和<color=#ffc800>修理舱</color>，以及更高阶的<color=#ffc800>燃料包</color>，否则这些物品只能从废弃飞船中搜刮而来。<color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>还提供了多种<color=#ffc800>工具</color>，包括<color=#ffc800>多功能工具</color>和<color=#ffc800>钻头</color>，以及所有<color=#ffc800>资源采集</color>装置，例如<color=#ffc800>自动采矿机</color>、<color=#ffc800>载具钻头</color>和<color=#ffc800>工具炮塔</color>。

@p9 最终，<color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>将让你制作强力的手持工具，如<color=#ffc800>大师级多功能工具</color>和<color=#ffc800>战斗钻头</color>——一种强力<color=#ffc800>钻头</color>，具有<color=#04ff00>突击</color>模式，可<color=#59ff00>拆除</color>结构方块并对<color=#ff0000>敌军</color>造成<color=#59ff00>显著伤害</color>。此外，<color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>还能接触特殊<color=#ffc800>实验技术</color>，包括一种<color=#ffc800>高级翘曲引擎</color>，它不仅比普通<color=#ffc800>翘曲引擎</color>拥有更长的翘曲范围，而且在星系间翘曲时消耗的<color=#ffc800>翘曲燃料</color>也少得多。

@p9 <color=#ff00f7>探索专精</color>让你制作各类<color=#ff00f7>探索</color>和<color=#ff00f7>探测装置</color>，例如飞船<color=#ff00f7>探测器</color>。他们还能从零开始建造<color=#ff00f7>侦察飞船</color>，并为其装备独特的<color=#ffc800>基于重力的推进系统</color>——该系统不适用于大型飞船，但非常适合轻型<color=#ff00f7>侦察飞船</color>；此外还有用于小型飞船的<color=#ffc800>中程翘曲引擎</color>，使其能够进行星际旅行。他们可以制作独特的手持<color=#59ff00>侦察步枪</color>，这是一种<color=#04ff00>狙击步枪</color>与<color=#04ff00>突击步枪</color>的结合体，并能使用比其他护甲更便于移动的<color=#04ff00>护甲</color>。

@p9 最终，<color=#ff00f7>探索专精</color>将让你为小型飞船制作强大的<color=#ff00f7>远程探测器</color>，可<color=#ff00f7>扫描</color>整个星球或星区；以及<color=#ff00f7>深空雷达</color>，不仅能<color=#ff00f7>扫描</color>，还能在极远距离<color=#ff00f7>识别</color>物体和载具。

@p9 <color=#006eff>医疗专精</color>让你制作多种高级<color=#006eff>药物</color>和用于飞船及基地的<color=#006eff>医疗装置</color>，以及<color=#006eff>医疗注射器</color>，可在战场上治疗盟友。<color=#006eff>医疗专精</color>还允许制作<color=#006eff>医疗强化剂</color>，这是一种一次性物品，能让你在核心属性（生命、耐力、食物）上获得半永久性提升，并附带额外效果，如<color=#006eff>生命恢复</color>、<color=#ff00f7>移动速度</color>提升，甚至体温调节。<color=#006eff>强化剂</color>提供的增益持续到另一个<color=#006eff>强化剂</color>被使用或你“死亡”为止。

@p9 最终，<color=#006eff>医疗专精</color>将让你制作一把强力的<color=#006eff>医疗注射器</color>，它还能<color=#006eff>补充</color>盟友的耐力，并附带一道'<color=#04ff00>眩晕光束</color>'，可造成少量<color=#04ff00>伤害</color>，但能让众多敌人无法靠近（在PvP中也能眩晕玩家）。

@p9 一旦你选择了专精，就可以通过打开你的PDA（按<color=#00fbff>F1</color>）并激活相应的等级1任务来开始提升该专精的等级。

@p9 当你在任何专精中达到等级3时，你将有机会完成一项高级训练课程。如果愿意，你可以选择一项额外的专精，或者获得500 UP点数以帮助解锁你的专精高阶物品或装置。

@p9 当你在任何专精中达到等级5时，你将可以选择一项额外的专精，或者获得500 UP点数以帮助解锁你的专精高阶物品或装置。

@p9 你想从哪项专精开始？

English:
@q0 {PlayerName}, I have assessed the situation and have determined that their most likely course would be to try to make it to the largest Derelict vessel in the Graveyard. @w2 I suggest you do the same. @w2 I recommend you go to the teleporter in Cargo Module One and switch it on, @w1 I could calibrate the teleporter to teleport you directly there.
 @p9 
 @w4 Alternatively, you could attempt to make it there on your own. @w2 However, @w1 without a constructor on board, @w1 you'd have to try and make it in just your Spacesuit. There may be patrol Drones in the nearby space, so I have located some things that may help. @w3
The Rossignol's Shuttle craft are all missing. Maybe some of the Command Crew are out there.

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 {PlayerName}，我已评估情况，确定他们最可能的路线是试图前往墓地中最大的废弃飞船。@w2 我建议你也这么做。@w2 我建议你前往货舱一的传送器并将其启动，@w1 我可以校准传送器将你直接传送过去。
 @p9 
 @w4 或者，你也可以尝试自行前往。@w2 但是，@w1 如果没有建造者在船上，@w1 你就只能穿着太空服尝试。附近太空可能有巡逻无人机，所以我找到了一些可能有用的东西。@w3
罗西尼奥尔的穿梭机都不见了。也许一些指挥人员在那里。

English:
@q0 We're a small colony, but we do have a few good traders.

@w4 If you need medical supplies, @w1 speak to Doctor Bonilla in the Medical Center to the left of the Habitat Complex. 
@w4 For your agricultural needs, @w1 visit the agricultural center down the main road to your right just out the front door.
@w4 If you're hungry, @w1 we have a cafeteria in the Habitat Complex. @w2 Just go through the Command Center behind here and straight ahead. 
@w4 If you are in need of crew, @w1 our supply master in the Storage Deck has a list of hirable colonists. @w2 He also has a list of goods that we're in need of, @w1 in case you have any excess you can spare.

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 我们是个小殖民地，但确实有几个不错的商人。

@w4 如果你需要医疗用品，@w1 去居住区左侧的医疗中心找博尼拉医生。
@w4 至于农业需求，@w1 出门沿着主路向右走，去农业中心。
@w4 如果饿了，@w1 居住区有自助餐厅。@w2 穿过后面的指挥中心直走就到了。
@w4 如果你需要船员，@w1 我们仓储甲板的物资管理员那里有一份可雇佣殖民者名单。@w2 他还有一份我们需要的物资清单，@w1 以防你有富余的可以捐献。

English:
@q0 Ah, @w1 yes, @w1 There's a matter of great urgency that we hope you can help us with.

@w4 A little while ago, @w1 we received a strange distorted signal. @w2 The signal appears to have originated from a nearby black hole, @w1 designated 'UIP 3758-A'. @w2 It took us a few days to compensate for the distortion, @w1 but the signal appears to be the distress signal from the <color=#3333e5>UES Bonneville</color>. 
@w4 We don't have any ships capable of interstellar travel, @w1 and as a member of the <color=#3333e5>United Earth Fleet</color>, @w1 we were hoping you would be willing to investigate the black hole and see if you can find any sign of the <color=#3333e5>Bonneville</color>. 
@w4 Can you help us with this?

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 啊，@w1 是的，@w1 有一件非常紧急的事情希望你能帮忙。

@w4 不久前，@w1 我们收到一个奇怪的扭曲信号。@w2 信号似乎来自附近一个名为‘UIP 3758-A’的黑洞。@w1 我们花了好几天才补偿扭曲效应，@w2 但信号似乎是来自<color=#3333e5>UES 邦纳维尔号</color>的求救信号。
@w1 我们没有任何能够星际旅行的飞船，@w4 作为<color=#3333e5>地球联合舰队</color>的一员，@w1 我们希望你能去调查那个黑洞，看看能否找到<color=#3333e5>邦纳维尔号</color>的任何踪迹。
@w1 你能帮我们这个忙吗？

English:
@q0 This terminal appears to be working.
@w2 Attempting data retrieval...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...
@w2 ...data retrieval complete.

@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the chief engineer of the <color=#3333e5>UES Bonneville</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 Engineer Log, Entry 2
@w4 At the Captain's orders we attempted a blind warp jump away from the Black Hole. @w2 While our warp drive activated as planned, @w1 the warp field never formed, @w1 using up all our warp fuel while not even moving us a kilometer. @w2 Now, @w1 even if we were able to get a lock on a warp target, @w1 we wouldn't be able to warp. 
@w4 - Engineer Hansley

