@w2 I have uncovered a log entry from the chief engineer of the <color=#3333e5>UES Bonneville</color>. @w2 Playback initiating.

@p9 Engineer Log, Entry 3
@w4 With the crew and passengers disappearing due to some unknown phenomenon, @w2 the Captain has ordered us to send out a distress signal. @w2 Because of our proximity to the anomaly, @w1 it's possible that the signal will be badly distorted, @w1 possibly even not identifiable. @w2 However, @w1 I've compressed the signal to as tight a signal as we can. @w2 Hopefully when the distortion slows the signal down, @w1 it will uncompress into a recognizable signal.
@w4 - Engineer Hansley

