@w4 I have no idea where we are. @w2 Ignoring the presence of the massive black hole looming outside the ship, @w1 with no stars visible, @w1 and our ship's long-range sensors non-functional, @w1 the computer can't calculate our position. @w2 With that in mind, @w1 we have no idea where in the galaxy we are, @w1 or if we are even, @w1 in fact, @w1 in the same galaxy. @w2 I only hope the other ships of the fleet have fared better than we.
@w4 - Ensign Ashford

