@w4 They're all around us. @w2 The Captain says we shouldn't worry about them, @w1 but they're everywhere. @w2 The first time I saw one was two days ago. @w2 I was leaving the bridge after my shift. @w2 I was heading toward the forward elevator shaft to go down to the lounge, @w1 but when I opened the door to the shaft... @w2 there it was... @w2 Standing right in front of me. @w2 A shadowy humanoid shape just... @w2 standing there. @w2 I felt instantly cold as I backed away hurriedly, @w1 and as quickly as it had appeared, @w1 it was gone.
