English:
@q0 <color=#c73bc9>Blueprint use is restricted in StarSalvage. Partly because the scenario uses a lot of customised blocks but mainly because the Speciality system means it may not be possible for a single player to unlock all the items used in a previously built blueprint!
@p9 
To get around this we recommend that you use creative mode to make a “stripped” version of your favourite Blueprint with the stuff you have unlocked still on it but with the stuff you know your team mates can provide - or that you can buy or salvage missing. It can then be spawned in and you can add back those items.
@p9 
Actual spawn restrictions have been lifted somewhat from earlier versions of Star salvage.

Starter planets: typically these don't allow CV’s but everything ese can be spawned in
Quarantine worlds. Just HV’s are allowed
Orbits and Barren Moons are you best place to spawn in a CV</color>

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 <color=#c73bc9>在星际打捞中蓝图的使用受到限制。部分原因是该场景使用了大量自定义方块，但主要原因是专精系统意味着单个玩家可能无法解锁先前建造蓝图中使用的所有物品！
@p9 
为了解决这个问题，我们建议你使用创造模式制作你最喜欢的蓝图的“精简版”，保留你已经解锁的东西，但移除你知道你的队友可以提供的东西——或者你可以购买或打捞缺失的东西。然后可以生成它，再添加上那些物品。
@p9 
实际的生成限制比早期版本的星际打捞有所放宽。

初始星球：通常不允许生成 CV，但其他一切都可以生成
隔离世界：只允许生成 HV
轨道和荒芜卫星是你生成 CV 的最佳地点</color>

English:
@q0 <color=#c73bc9>Equipment
In addition to some new items, many existing ones have been tweaked for balance purposes. So it is</color><color=#6dfdfa> <b><i>important you read descriptions</i></b>. </color><color=#c73bc9>Weapons or other items you previously thought useless may now have some function</color>.
@p9 
<color=#c73bc9>Its always possible that you may be disappointed with some changes too. But rest assured any such changes were not done casually and link in to other adjustments to the general improvement of the Game.</color>

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 <color=#c73bc9>装备
除了一些新物品，许多现有物品也为了平衡性而进行了调整。因此，</color><color=#6dfdfa> <b><i>务必阅读描述</i></b>。 </color><color=#c73bc9>你之前认为无用的武器或其他物品现在可能有了某种功能。</color>.
@p9 
<color=#c73bc9>你也可能会对某些改动感到失望。但请放心，任何此类改动都不是随意进行的，并且与游戏整体改进的其他调整相关联。</color>

English:
@q0<color=#0bf93b> Now that you've mastered basic power components, it's time to expand on what it means to be a Flight Engineer.  W</color><color=#0bf93b>e need to get set to salvage some equipment from any nearby sources.</color>
<color=#0bf93b></color>@w2  <color=#0bf93b>To begin, you need to craft a SV Starter module, next </color>@w2  <color=#0bf93b>obtain six thrusters (One per direction of travel) for it. Basic small or medium ones will do in any combination. </color>@w2 <color=#0bf93b> Finally obtain a cockpit. (Craft or salvage)  </color>@w2  <color=#0bf93b>You should have an appropriate Generator and fuel tank already.</color>
<color=#0bf93b></color>
@p4 <color=#0bf93b>With this mobile platform you can much more easily gather materials from the surrounding area in due course. </color>@w2 

<size=125%><color=#c73bc9>[You do not have to keep all items on you at all times to complete the quest. </color></size>@w2  <size=125%><color=#c73bc9>
You do not have to assemble it immediately!]</color></size>

Chinese (simplified):
@q0<color=#0bf93b> 既然你已经掌握了基础能源组件，是时候扩展你对飞行工程师的理解了。</color><color=#0bf93b>我们需要准备从附近任何来源回收一些设备。</color>
<color=#0bf93b></color>@w2  <color=#0bf93b>首先，你需要制作一个小型飞船启动模块，接下来 </color>@w2  <color=#0bf93b>获取六个推进器（每个移动方向一个）。基础型的小型或中型推进器任意组合即可。</color>@w2 <color=#0bf93b>最后获取一个驾驶舱。（制作或回收）</color>@w2  <color=#0bf93b>你应该已经有合适的发电机和燃料罐了。</color>
<color=#0bf93b></color>
@p4 <color=#0bf93b>有了这个移动平台，你就能更轻松地从周边区域收集材料了。</color>@w2 

<size=125%><color=#c73bc9>[你不必一直随身携带所有物品才能完成任务。</color></size>@w2  <size=125%><color=#c73bc9>
你也没有必要立即组装它！]</color></size>

English:
Your expertise is needed for a specialized salvage operation. There's a damaged support vessel called the <color=#ffc800>Removal Supporter</color> that requires your engineering skills to get back online.

@p9 This mission may intersect with ongoing main operations, so coordinate carefully with other salvagers to ensure smooth workflow integration.

@p9 <color=#59ff00>Mission Objectives:</color>
• Locate the <color=#ffc800>Removal Supporter</color> vessel
• Assess and repair critical system failures
• Restore the vessel to operational status
• Coordinate with main mission operations as needed

@p9 The <color=#ffc800>Removal Supporter</color> is a specialized vessel designed for heavy salvage operations. Getting it operational will significantly expand your team's capabilities.

Chinese (simplified):
我们需要你的专业知识来进行一次专业回收作业。有一艘名为<color=#ffc800>回收支援号</color>的受损支援飞船需要你的工程技能来恢复在线。

@p9 此任务可能与正在进行的核心任务重叠，请与其他回收者仔细协调，确保工作流程顺利整合。

@p9 <color=#59ff00>任务目标：</color>
• 定位<color=#ffc800>回收支援号</color>飞船
• 评估并修复关键系统故障
• 将飞船恢复至运行状态
• 根据需要与核心任务操作协调

@p9 <color=#ffc800>回收支援号</color>是一艘专为重型回收作业设计的专业飞船。让它重新运行将显著提升团队的能力。

English:
Outstanding work, {PlayerName}! You've successfully restored the <color=#ffc800>Removal Supporter</color> to operational status. This specialized vessel will now be available for heavy salvage operations.

@p9 Your ability to work within the broader mission framework while completing specialized engineering tasks shows the kind of <color=#ffc800>professional coordination</color> that successful salvage operations depend on.

@p9 <color=#59ff00>Mission Complete!</color> You've earned <color=#00ff00>300 XP</color> and advanced to <color=#ffc800>Engineering Rank 6</color>.

Chinese (simplified):
出色的工作，{PlayerName}！你已成功将<color=#ffc800>回收支援号</color>修复至运行状态。这艘专业飞船将可用于重型回收作业。

@p9 你在完成专业工程任务的同时，融入更大任务框架的能力，展现了成功回收作业所依赖的<color=#ffc800>专业协调</color>。

@p9 <color=#59ff00>任务完成！</color>你获得了<color=#00ff00>300经验值</color>并晋升至<color=#ffc800>工程专精等级6</color>。

English:
Excellent resource extraction work, {PlayerName}! You've successfully harvested <color=#ffc800>carbon ore</color> from space junk using proper mining techniques. This material will be crucial for manufacturing operations.

@p9 Your understanding of <color=#ffc800>resource identification</color>, <color=#ffc800>extraction efficiency</color>, and <color=#ffc800>material processing</color> demonstrates the comprehensive resource management skills required of senior engineers.

@p9 <color=#59ff00>Mission Complete!</color> You've earned <color=#00ff00>300 XP</color> and advanced to <color=#ffc800>Engineering Rank 7</color>.

Chinese (simplified):
出色的资源采集工作，{PlayerName}！你已通过正确的采矿技术从太空垃圾中成功获取了<color=#ffc800>碳矿石</color>。这种材料对制造操作至关重要。

@p9 你对<color=#ffc800>资源识别</color>、<color=#ffc800>采集效率</color>和<color=#ffc800>材料处理</color>的理解，展示了高级工程师所需的全面资源管理技能。

@p9 <color=#59ff00>任务完成！</color>你获得了<color=#00ff00>300经验值</color>并晋升至<color=#ffc800>工程专精等级7</color>。

English:
Your next mission involves planetary operations. You need to establish ground-based mining capabilities by locating and repairing a <color=#ffc800>Hover Vehicle (HV)</color> equipped with drilling equipment.

@p9 Ground-based resource extraction is essential for large-scale salvage operations, and hover vehicles provide the mobility and power needed for efficient mining.

@p9 <color=#59ff00>Mission Objectives:</color>
• Head to a nearby world/planet
• Locate a damaged Hover Vehicle with drilling equipment
• Repair and restore the HV's systems
• Ensure the drilling equipment is operational
• Test the vehicle's mobility and drilling functions

@p9 A functional <color=#ffc800>drilling HV</color> will enable efficient extraction of planetary resources needed for large construction projects.

Chinese (simplified):
您的下一个任务涉及行星操作。您需要定位并修理一艘配备钻孔设备的<color=#ffc800>悬浮载具（HV）</color>，以建立地面采矿能力。

@p9 地面资源提取对于大规模打捞作业至关重要，而悬浮载具提供了高效采矿所需的机动性和动力。

@p9 <color=#59ff00>任务目标：</color>
• 前往附近的世界/星球
• 找到一艘损坏的、配备钻孔设备的悬浮载具
• 修理并恢复悬浮载具的系统
• 确保钻孔设备可运行
• 测试载具的机动性和钻孔功能

@p9 一个功能正常的<color=#ffc800>钻孔悬浮载具</color>将能够高效提取大型建设项目所需的行星资源。

English:
Superb engineering work, {PlayerName}! You've successfully restored a <color=#ffc800>drilling-equipped Hover Vehicle</color> to full operational status. This ground-based mining platform will significantly enhance resource extraction capabilities.

@p9 Your ability to work across different operational environments - from space-based salvage to planetary mining - demonstrates the <color=#ffc800>versatility and adaptability</color> required of elite salvage engineers.

@p9 <color=#59ff00>Mission Complete!</color> You've earned <color=#00ff00>300 XP</color> and advanced to <color=#ffc800>Engineering Rank 8</color>.

Chinese (simplified):
出色的工程工作，{PlayerName}！您已成功将一艘<color=#ffc800>配备钻孔设备的悬浮载具</color>恢复至完全运行状态。这个地面采矿平台将显著增强资源提取能力。

@p9 您在不同操作环境（从太空打捞到行星采矿）中工作的能力，展示了精英打捞工程师所需的<color=#ffc800>多样性和适应性</color>。

@p9 <color=#59ff00>任务完成！</color>您获得了<color=#00ff00>300 XP</color>并晋升至<color=#ffc800>工程等级8</color>。

English:
Integration and logistics are crucial engineering skills. Your mission is to demonstrate advanced <color=#ffc800>docking and transport capabilities</color> by successfully docking your Hover Vehicle onto a Small Vessel.

@p9 This operation requires precise engineering, understanding of <color=#ffc800>mass distribution</color>, <color=#ffc800>structural loading</color>, and <color=#ffc800>transport logistics</color>.

@p9 <color=#59ff00>Mission Objectives:</color>
• Prepare the HV and SV for docking operations
• Successfully dock the Hover Vehicle onto the Small Vessel
• Ensure structural integrity and stability
• Verify transport readiness and security systems

@p9 Successful vehicle integration enables efficient transport of ground-based equipment to different operational sites, greatly expanding mission flexibility.

Chinese (simplified):
集成和物流是关键的工程技能。您的任务是通过成功将悬浮载具对接至小型飞船，展示高级<color=#ffc800>对接与运输能力</color>。

@p9 此操作需要精确的工程、对<color=#ffc800>质量分布</color>、<color=#ffc800>结构载荷</color>和<color=#ffc800>运输物流</color>的理解。

@p9 <color=#59ff00>任务目标：</color>
• 准备悬浮载具和小型飞船进行对接操作
• 成功将悬浮载具对接至小型飞船
• 确保结构完整性和稳定性
• 验证运输准备状态和安全系统

@p9 成功的载具集成可将地面设备高效运输至不同操作地点，大大扩展任务灵活性。

English:
Exceptional integration work, {PlayerName}! You've successfully docked the <color=#ffc800>Hover Vehicle</color> onto the <color=#ffc800>Small Vessel</color>, creating a combined transport and mining platform.

@p9 Your mastery of <color=#ffc800>vehicle integration</color>, <color=#ffc800>structural engineering</color>, and <color=#ffc800>transport logistics</color> represents the advanced skill set needed for complex multi-platform operations.

@p9 <color=#59ff00>Mission Complete!</color> You've earned <color=#00ff00>300 XP</color> and advanced to <color=#ffc800>Engineering Rank 9</color>.

Chinese (simplified):
卓越的集成工作，{PlayerName}！您已成功将<color=#ffc800>悬浮载具</color>对接至<color=#ffc800>小型飞船</color>，创建了联合运输和采矿平台。

@p9 您在<color=#ffc800>载具集成</color>、<color=#ffc800>结构工程</color>和<color=#ffc800>运输物流</color>方面的掌握代表了复杂多平台操作所需的高级技能。

@p9 <color=#59ff00>任务完成！</color>您获得了<color=#00ff00>300 XP</color>并晋升至<color=#ffc800>工程等级9</color>。

English:
You're approaching mastery of the <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color>! This advanced mission requires you to upgrade a <color=#ffc800>Capital Vessel</color> with sophisticated systems.

@p9 <color=#59ff00>Mission Objectives:</color>
• Locate or access a Capital Vessel
• Install 4x <color=#ffc800>L4 CPU Extenders</color> to enhance computational capacity
• Ensure proper integration and system compatibility
• Verify enhanced processing capabilities

@p9 <color=#ffc800>L4 CPU Extenders</color> represent advanced technology that significantly expands a vessel's processing power, enabling operation of complex systems, advanced automation, and sophisticated equipment arrays.

@p9 This upgrade will transform a basic capital vessel into a high-capability command and manufacturing platform.

Chinese (simplified):
您已接近掌握<color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>！这项高级任务要求您使用精密系统升级一艘<color=#ffc800>主力舰</color>。

@p9 <color=#59ff00>任务目标：</color>
• 找到或访问一艘主力舰
• 安装4个<color=#ffc800>L4 CPU扩展器</color>以增强计算能力
• 确保正确集成和系统兼容性
• 验证增强后的处理能力

@p9 <color=#ffc800>L4 CPU扩展器</color>代表了显著扩展飞船处理能力的先进技术，可运行复杂系统、高级自动化和精密设备阵列。

@p9 此升级将把一艘基础主力舰转变为高能力的指挥和制造平台。

English:
Masterful engineering work, {PlayerName}! You've successfully upgraded the <color=#ffc800>Capital Vessel</color> with advanced <color=#ffc800>L4 CPU Extenders</color>, transforming it into a high-capability platform.

@p9 Your expertise in <color=#ffc800>advanced systems integration</color>, <color=#ffc800>computational architecture</color>, and <color=#ffc800>capital vessel engineering</color> marks you as an elite specialist in the field.

@p9 <color=#59ff00>Mission Complete!</color> You've earned <color=#00ff00>1000 XP</color> and advanced to <color=#ffc800>Engineering Rank 10</color>!

Chinese (simplified):
精湛的工程工作，{PlayerName}！您已成功使用高级<color=#ffc800>L4 CPU扩展器</color>升级了<color=#ffc800>主力舰</color>，将其转化为高能力平台。

@p9 您在<color=#ffc800>高级系统集成</color>、<color=#ffc800>计算架构</color>和<color=#ffc800>主力舰工程</color>方面的专长使您成为该领域的精英专家。

@p9 <color=#59ff00>任务完成！</color>您获得了<color=#00ff00>1000 XP</color>并晋升至<color=#ffc800>工程等级10</color>！

English:
Welcome to your final <color=#ffc800>Engineering Specialization</color> mission, {PlayerName}! This ultimate challenge will test your mastery of <color=#ffc800>heavy mining operations</color> and <color=#ffc800>advanced weapon systems integration</color>.

@p9 <color=#59ff00>Mission Objectives:</color>
• Equip a Capital Vessel with an <color=#ffc800>Epic Laser Machine Gun</color>
• Manufacture 1000 rounds of ammunition for the weapon
• Use the CV mining laser to extract 1000 <color=#ffc800>Promethium</color>
• Demonstrate mastery of both weapons technology and mining operations

@p9 This mission combines <color=#ffc800>advanced weapons engineering</color>, <color=#ffc800>ammunition manufacturing</color>, and <color=#ffc800>industrial-scale resource extraction</color> - the pinnacle skills of a master engineer.

@p9 <color=#ffc800>Promethium</color> is one of the most valuable resources in salvage operations, and extracting it efficiently requires both technical expertise and proper equipment operation.

Chinese (simplified):
欢迎来到您的最终<color=#ffc800>工程专精</color>任务，{PlayerName}！这一终极挑战将考验您对<color=#ffc800>重采作业</color>和<color=#ffc800>高级武器系统集成</color>的掌握程度。

@p9 <color=#59ff00>任务目标：</color>
• 为主力舰配备一把<color=#ffc800>史诗级激光机枪</color>
• 为该武器制造1000发弹药
• 使用主力舰采矿激光提取1000单位<color=#ffc800>钷</color>
• 展示对武器技术和采矿作业的全面掌握

@p9 此任务结合了<color=#ffc800>高级武器工程</color>、<color=#ffc800>弹药制造</color>和<color=#ffc800>工业级资源提取</color>——这是大师级工程师的巅峰技能。

@p9 <color=#ffc800>钷</color>是打捞作业中最有价值的资源之一，高效提取它需要技术专长和适当的设备操作。

English:
There are reports of a surviving <color=#ffc800>medical droid</color> somewhere in this sector. @w4 These droids contain vast databases of medical knowledge and procedures that could be invaluable to your training.

@w4 The droid may be damaged or in low-power mode, but if you can locate and communicate with it, you could gain access to <color=#006eff>advanced medical protocols</color> that would otherwise take years to learn.

@p9 Find and communicate with the <color=#ffc800>last surviving medical droid</color>. Be prepared - it may be in a restricted or dangerous area.

Chinese (simplified):
有报告称此星区某处有一台幸存的<color=#ffc800>医疗机器人</color>。@w4 这些机器人包含庞大的医疗知识和程序数据库，对你的训练可能极为宝贵。

@w4 该机器人可能受损或处于低电量模式，但如果你能定位并与之通信，你就能获得<color=#006eff>高级医疗协议</color>，否则需要数年才能学会。

@p9 找到并与<color=#ffc800>最后一台幸存的医疗机器人</color>通信。做好准备——它可能位于受限或危险区域。

English:
*SYSTEM REBOOT COMPLETE* @w4 GREETINGS, MEDICAL PRACTITIONER. @w2 I AM MEDICAL DROID MD-7734, LAST OPERATIONAL UNIT OF THE GALACTIC MEDICAL CORPS.

@w4 MY DATABANKS CONTAIN OVER 10,000 MEDICAL PROCEDURES AND TREATMENT PROTOCOLS. @w2 WARNING: POWER LEVELS AT 12%. REQUESTING IMMEDIATE DATA TRANSFER.

@p9 ACCESSING EMERGENCY MEDICAL PROTOCOLS... @w4 TRANSFERRING ADVANCED TRAUMA CARE PROCEDURES...

Chinese (simplified):
*系统重启完成* @w4 你好，医疗从业者。@w2 我是医疗机器人MD-7734，星系医疗军团最后一个在役单元。

@w4 我的数据库包含超过10,000种医疗程序和治疗方案。@w2 警告：能量水平剩余12%。请求立即数据转移。

@p9 正在访问紧急医疗协议……@w4 正在传输高级创伤护理程序……

English:
As a <color=#006eff>medic</color>, you'll often need to respond to medical emergencies across different locations. @w4 A <color=#ffc800>Small Vessel (SV)</color> will give you the mobility needed to reach patients quickly and transport critical medical supplies.

@w4 Your SV can also serve as a mobile medical unit, equipped with emergency medical equipment for field operations.

@p9 Acquire or build a <color=#ffc800>Small Vessel</color>. This will be your primary means of transportation for medical missions across the system.

Chinese (simplified):
作为<color=#006eff>医疗</color>，你经常需要响应不同地点的医疗紧急情况。@w4 一艘<color=#ffc800>小型飞船（SV）</color>将赋予你所需的机动性，以便快速抵达患者身边并运输关键医疗物资。

@w4 你的小型飞船也可以作为流动医疗单元，配备用于野外作业的急救医疗设备。

@p9 获取或建造一艘<color=#ffc800>小型飞船</color>。这将成为你在星系中执行医疗任务的主要交通工具。

English:
Advanced medical practice requires sophisticated equipment. @w4 <color=#006eff>Medical healing devices</color> can provide automated treatment and continuous patient monitoring.

@w4 These devices are essential for treating severe injuries and maintaining patient stability during complex procedures.

@p9 Obtain a <color=#006eff>medical healing device</color>. This may require crafting, salvaging from medical facilities, or trading with other survivors.

Chinese (simplified):
先进的医疗实践需要精良的设备。@w4 <color=#006eff>医疗治疗装置</color>可以提供自动化治疗和持续的患者监测。

@w4 这些装置对于处理重伤以及在高难度手术中维持患者稳定至关重要。

@p9 获取一个<color=#006eff>医疗治疗装置</color>。这可能需要制造、从医疗设施中回收，或与其他幸存者交易。

English:
The time has come for your ultimate test as a <color=#006eff>medic</color>. @w4 There's a mysterious plague called the <color=#ff0000>Legacy Scourge</color> that has been devastating colonies across the galaxy.

@w4 A potential cure has been developed, but it requires a <color=#006eff>second medical opinion</color> from a qualified expert before it can be deployed. @w2 Your expertise is needed to verify the cure's safety and effectiveness.

@p9 This is your final mission as a medic trainee. Provide your professional medical opinion on the Legacy Scourge cure. The fate of entire worlds may depend on your judgment.

Chinese (simplified):
作为一位<color=#006eff>医疗</color>，你接受终极考验的时刻到了。@w4 有一种名为<color=#ff0000>遗留者灾祸</color>的神秘瘟疫，一直肆虐着整个星系的殖民点。

@w4 一种潜在的治疗方案已经开发出来，但在实施之前，需要一位合格的专家提供<color=#006eff>第二医疗意见</color>。@w2 需要你的专业知识来验证该疗法的安全性和有效性。

@p9 这是你作为医疗实习生的最后任务。请对遗留者灾祸的治疗方案提供你的专业医疗意见。整个世界的命运可能取决于你的判断。

English:
Remarkable work! @w2 Your analysis of the Legacy Scourge cure was thorough and professional. @w4 Your recommendations have been accepted by the Galactic Medical Council, and the cure is being distributed across affected worlds.

@w4 You have completed your medical training with distinction. @w2 As recognition of your exceptional service to galactic health, you're being awarded this <color=#59ff00>Epic Laser Rifle</color> and ammunition.

@w4 Congratulations, <color=#006eff>Master Medic</color> {PlayerName}! The galaxy is safer because of your dedication to healing.

Chinese (simplified):
出色工作！@w2 你对“遗留灾祸”疗法的分析彻底而专业。@w4 你的建议已被银河医疗委员会接受，该疗法正在受影响的世界中分发。

@w4 你以优异成绩完成了医疗培训。@w2 作为对你在银河健康方面卓越服务的认可，你被授予这把<color=#59ff00>史诗激光步枪</color>和弹药。

@w4 祝贺你，<color=#006eff>大师级医务官</color>{PlayerName}！由于你对治愈的奉献，银河系更加安全。

English:
@p0 <color=#ff00f7>Navigation Log - Entry 847</color> @w4<color=#5d84f8> Final hyperspace jump coordinates locked in.</color>  @w1<color=#5d84f8> New Destination:</color>  <color=#0bf93b>[Translation inferred] </color><color=#5d84f8>Zikan system.</color> 
 @w2 <color=#5d84f8>Ships AI Warns of a massive gravitational anomaly detected in original target system</color>. @w4 <color=#5d84f8>The Captain has authorised this suggested course correction, but hyperdrive malfunction prevented proper exit vector. </color>

 @p0 <color=#5d84f8>Ship structural integrity compromised during emergency drop from hyperspace. </color> @w2 <color=#5d84f8>Multiple hull breaches reported across decks 7-12.</color>  @w1<color=#5d84f8> I am keeping ship in stable inter solar orbit while doing scans of system.  </color>@w2 <color=#5d84f8>One marginally habitable planet at least is confirmed.</color>
 @q0<color=#5d84f8> The captain and</color> <color=#0bf93b>[Translation uncertain]</color> <color=#5d84f8>Ships Guru are in consultation with Ships A.I. to formulate emergency protocols.</color>

Chinese (simplified):
@p0 <color=#ff00f7>导航日志 - 条目847</color> @w4<color=#5d84f8> 最终超空间跳跃坐标已锁定。</color>  @w1<color=#5d84f8> 新目的地：</color>  <color=#0bf93b>[翻译推断] </color><color=#5d84f8>齐坎星系。</color> 
 @w2 <color=#5d84f8>飞船AI警告在原目标星系检测到巨大引力异常</color>。 @w4 <color=#5d84f8>舰长授权了此建议航线修正，但超光速引擎故障导致无法正确退出向量。</color> 

 @p0 <color=#5d84f8>紧急脱离超空间时飞船结构完整性受损。</color> @w2 <color=#5d84f8>报告甲板7-12多处船壳破裂。</color>  @w1<color=#5d84f8> 我保持飞船在稳定的太阳系内轨道，同时对星系进行扫描。</color>@w2 <color=#5d84f8>至少确认了一颗勉强可居住的星球。</color>
 @q0<color=#5d84f8> 舰长和</color> <color=#0bf93b>[翻译不确定]</color> <color=#5d84f8>飞船大师正在与飞船AI协商制定紧急协议。</color>

English:
@w2 <color=#f9ae0b><b>Engineering Report </b></color> @w4 <color=#f9ae0b>Hyperdrive core experiencing mysterious shutdown on exit to real space. </color>@w2 <color=#f9ae0b>Unexpected radiation flooding the Warp drive section; so all data coming from A.I. remote monitoring until we can manufacture enough suits to allow direct access. </color>@w2 <color=#f9ae0b>Fabricators are also malfunctioning slowing this process. </color>@w1 <color=#f9ae0b>But as the A.I. reports no danger of a critical cascade failure: </color>@w1 <color=#f9ae0b>prioritising other repairs for now.</color>
<color=#f9ae0b></color>
 @w2 <color=#f9ae0b>Emergency power diverted to repair and automation support systems.</color>
<color=#f9ae0b></color>@q0 <color=#f9ae0b>Supplemental Entry: </color>@w2 
<color=#f9ae0b>Some of the colonists have taken advantage of the situation and seized the landing craft bays!</color> @w2 <color=#f9ae0b>Just when those ships could have helped survey the damage and resources nearby to fix it! </color>@w2<color=#f9ae0b> Don't they realise their are sabotaging everyone's survival here!</color>

Chinese (simplified):
@w2 <color=#f9ae0b><b>工程报告</b></color> @w4 <color=#f9ae0b>超光速引擎核心在退出实空间时遭遇神秘关闭。</color>@w2 <color=#f9ae0b>意外的辐射淹没了翘曲引擎区；因此所有数据来自AI远程监控，直到我们能制造足够多的防护服以允许直接进入。</color>@w2 <color=#f9ae0b>制造机也出现故障，减缓了这一过程。</color>@w1 <color=#f9ae0b>但AI报告称没有关键级联故障的危险：</color>@w1 <color=#f9ae0b>目前优先进行其他维修。</color>
<color=#f9ae0b></color>
 @w2 <color=#f9ae0b>紧急电力转用于维修和自动化支持系统。</color>
<color=#f9ae0b></color>@q0 <color=#f9ae0b>补充条目：</color>@w2 
<color=#f9ae0b>一些殖民者利用了这个局势，夺取了登陆艇停泊区！</color> @w2 <color=#f9ae0b>正当那些飞船本可以帮助勘察附近损坏和资源以进行修复的时候！</color> @w2<color=#f9ae0b>他们难道不明白这是在破坏每个人的生存机会吗！</color>

English:
@q0 <color=#f9ae0b><b>Medical Emergency Log</b></color><color=#ff00f7></color> @w4 <color=#f9ae0b>Ninety percent of the ships remain crew are casualties from hyperdrive explosion: The few survivors, or those like the medical staff that were exempted from the general assembly the ships A.I. organised, are all that's left</color> @w2 <color=#f9ae0b>Medical bay overwhelmed as those seem to have been exposed to unknown Pathogen released by the blast somehow. </color>

@p9 <color=#f9ae0b>The Ships A.I. has apparently gone inert after the explosion; none of my diagnostic gear is working.</color> @w2 <color=#f9ae0b>The last couple of technicians alive are in search of  manual way to restart it; but the Computer core is in lock down mode. </color>@w2 <color=#f9ae0b>Emergency triage protocols in effect for the wounded till they get something working again</color>. 

@p9<color=#f9ae0b> Emergency council of survivors is trying to find a way off the ship, but the only functional lander was already seized by mutineers!</color>
@w2 <color=#f9ae0b>Time is running out.</color>

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 <color=#f9ae0b><b>医疗紧急日志</b></color><color=#ff00f7></color> @w4 <color=#f9ae0b>飞船剩余百分之九十的船员因超光速引擎爆炸而伤亡：少数幸存者，或像医务人员那样被排除在飞船AI组织的全体大会之外的人，是仅剩的</color> @w2 <color=#f9ae0b>医疗区不堪重负，因为那些人似乎接触了爆炸释放的未知病原体。 </color>

@p9 <color=#f9ae0b>飞船AI在爆炸后似乎已失效；我的诊断设备都无法工作。</color> @w2 <color=#f9ae0b>最后几名活着的技术人员正在寻找手动重启AI的方法；但计算机核心处于锁定模式。 </color>@w2 <color=#f9ae0b>对伤者实施紧急分诊协议，直到他们让某些系统重新运转</color>. 

@p9<color=#f9ae0b>幸存者紧急委员会正试图寻找离开飞船的方法，但唯一的功能性着陆器已被叛变者夺取！</color>
@w2 <color=#f9ae0b>时间不多了。</color>

English:
@q0 <color=#ff00f7>Security Alert</color> @w4 Ships A.I. Reports possible Alien vessels detected on long-range sensors. @w2 Configuration unknown. 
 @w2 Ships Defensive systems are unresponsive. Ships A.I. is attempting to take control of the Systems directly via emergency bypass protocols. @w2 But currently the ships defenceless. @w4 Panic increasing among surviving crew. Scattered Reports of looting in cargo bays 3 and 5. 

 @q0 <color=#c73bc9>Initiating lockdown:</color> @w2 Bridge sealed, defence turrets on lethal mode for duration of crisis. @w2 Commencing lockdown of critical and dangerous supply bays: 
 @w2 <color=#6afb74>Hydroponics' storage</color> - Unknown the Head AgriTech was killed and his second cannot be located.<color=#f9ae0b></color>@w2 <color=#f9ae0b>Aft Air Lock ready room</color> storage status unknown: @w2 This is critical! @w1  This must secured as holds free promethium and other volatile element. @w2 Armory secured. Second squad to Manufactory awaiting report.

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 <color=#ff00f7>安全警报</color> @w4 飞船人工智能报告在远程传感器上检测到疑似外星飞船。 @w2 配置未知。 
 @w2 飞船防御系统无响应。飞船人工智能正试图通过紧急旁路协议直接控制系统。 @w2 但目前飞船毫无防御能力。 @w4 幸存船员中恐慌加剧。有零散报告称货舱3号和5号发生抢劫。 

 @q0 <color=#c73bc9>启动封锁：</color> @w2 舰桥密封，危机期间防御炮塔开启致命模式。 @w2 开始封锁关键和危险补给舱： 
 @w2 <color=#6afb74>水培舱存储室</color> - 未知，首席农业技术员已死亡，其副手无法找到。<color=#f9ae0b></color>@w2 <color=#f9ae0b>尾部气闸准备室</color>存储状态未知： @w2 这很关键！ @w1 此房间必须封锁，因为其中存放着游离钷和其他易挥发元素。 @w2 武器库已封锁。第二小队前往制造厂等待报告。

English:
@q0 <color=#f9ae0b>Captain's Final Log </color> @w4 <color=#f9ae0b>I take full responsibility for the loss of this vessel and the lives of those aboard.</color> @w2 <color=#f9ae0b>The </color><color=#0bf93b>[Translation Inferred] </color><color=#f9ae0b></color><color=#f9ae0b>Zikan system was not as surveyed. </color>
 @w2 <color=#f9ae0b>Hostile alien presence confirmed, but more concerning is the Engineering reports that the A.I. is unstable and may be misreporting some of the faults! </color>@w1 <color=#f9ae0b>I have ordered a full diagnostics on it right after the general assembly that it has been called in the </color><color=#0bf93b>[Translation Uncertain]</color><color=#f9ae0b> Cathedral. </color>@w1 <color=#f9ae0b>I need to hear what it has to say one last time, before doing something as dangerous as taking it completely offline.</color>
<color=#f9ae0b></color>
 @p9 <color=#f9ae0b>If anyone finds this log, know that we did not go quietly. </color>@w2 <color=#f9ae0b>A few of the colonists </color><color=#f9ae0b>and crew </color><color=#f9ae0b></color><color=#f9ae0b>panicked and have seized our last intact landing ship: the </color><color=#f8de5d><b>Durevel Thureneth. </b></color><color=#f9ae0b></color><color=#f9ae0b></color>@w1 <color=#f9ae0b></color><color=#0bf93b>[Translation Uncertain] </color><color=#f9ae0b></color><color=#f9ae0b>Protocol scripture says I should persecute them as heretics! But after all the death that has occurred I cannot, </color>@w2 <color=#f9ae0b>they may in fact be the only future of this ship if we can't stabilise it</color>. @w2<color=#f9ae0b> I pray they find safer worlds than we found here, signing off. </color>@w2 <color=#f9ae0b>End log.</color>

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 <color=#f9ae0b>舰长最终日志</color> @w4 <color=#f9ae0b>我对这艘飞船的损失及船上所有人的生命负全责。</color> @w2 <color=#f9ae0b></color><color=#0bf93b>[翻译推断]</color><color=#f9ae0b></color><color=#f9ae0b> 齐坎星系的情况与勘测结果不符。</color> 
 @w2 <color=#f9ae0b>已确认存在敌对外星生物，但更令人担忧的是工程报告指出人工智能不稳定，可能误报了一些故障！</color>@w1 <color=#f9ae0b>我已下令在它被召集到</color><color=#0bf93b>[翻译不确定]</color><color=#f9ae0b> 大教堂举行全体会议后立即进行全面诊断。</color>@w1 <color=#f9ae0b>在采取完全离线这种危险举动之前，我需要在最后听一听它要说的话。</color>
<color=#f9ae0b></color>
 @p9 <color=#f9ae0b>如果有人找到这份日志，请知晓我们并未坐以待毙。</color>@w2 <color=#f9ae0b>部分殖民者</color><color=#f9ae0b>和船员</color><color=#f9ae0b></color><color=#f9ae0b>惊慌失措，夺取了我们最后一艘完好着陆船：</color><color=#f8de5d><b>杜雷维尔·图伦奈斯号。</b></color><color=#f9ae0b></color><color=#f9ae0b></color>@w1 <color=#f9ae0b></color><color=#0bf93b>[翻译不确定]</color><color=#f9ae0b></color><color=#f9ae0b> 经文指示我应以异端之名迫害他们！但经历了如此多的死亡后，我无法这样做。</color>@w2 <color=#f9ae0b>事实上，如果我们无法稳定飞船，他们可能是这艘船唯一的未来。</color> @w2<color=#f9ae0b>我祈祷他们能找到比我们这里更安全的世界，就此结束通信。</color>@w2 <color=#f9ae0b>日志结束。</color>

English:
@q0 <color=#04ff00>COMBAT SPECIALIZATION - LEVEL 1</color>
 @w4<color=#0bf93b> Welcome to advanced combat training, {PlayerName}. </color>

 @w2<color=#0bf93b> Your first mission is to demonstrate your ability to neutralize automated defences. </color><color=#ff0000>AI turrets</color> <color=#0bf93b>are a common threat in this sector and must be dealt with efficiently.</color>

 @p9 <color=#0bf93b>Locate and</color> <color=#04ff00>disintegrate 4 AI turrets</color><color=#0bf93b> using any available weapons. </color>@w2<color=#0bf93b></color><color=#0bf93b>These can typically be found at abandoned facilities or defensive positions.</color>
 @w4 <color=#0bf93b>This will test your tactical awareness and weapon proficiency.</color>

@q0 Hey {PlayerName} back at my desk biding my time till the big payday.

You know how it is. 

You need any supplies or a spot of repairs? I've switched the repair bots on for you. Food and stuff you can get from D.E.N.T.

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 嘿{PlayerName}，回到我的桌前，熬时间等发薪日。

你知道怎么回事。

你需要补给或一些维修吗？我已经为你打开了修理机器人。食物之类的东西可以从D.E.N.T.那里拿到。

English:
@q0 Ah there you are! I'm in the office inside.
 @w2 Sorry we're a bit small, you may have to come over in a suit:  @w2 You do have a suit yes?
 @w2 Be quick! The radiations pretty crippling hereabouts!
 @p9 Airlocks round the back or come in through the roof eithers fine! 

 @w2 Ignore the guns they always do that! @w1 they won't shoot first I assure you! I've issued you a Visitors badge!
 @w2 Don't suppose you have any Waffles or Hot beverages do you? 
 @w2 They're my favourites' and its been so long...

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 啊，你来了！我在里面的办公室。
 @w2 抱歉我们地方有点小，你可能得穿着防护服过来：@w2 你有防护服对吧？
 @w2 快点！这里的辐射相当严重！
 @p9 后边的气闸或者从屋顶进来都行！

 @w2 别管那些炮，它们总是那样！@w1 我保证它们不会先开火！我给你发了访客徽章！
 @w2 你不会碰巧有华夫饼或热饮吧？
 @w2 它们是我的最爱，已经好久没吃到了...

English:
@q0  Thank you for asking {PlayerName}! Nice to see somebody gives a damn about us researchers'! 

 @w2  Well as you probably guesses me and my morose companion over there, monitor the black hole and specifically what sort of things are coming in to it.

 @p9 I totally understand people not wanting to come here - I didn't; @w2 but the money's pretty good - but I did ask they send my regular supplies :   @w2  we've no room here to grow anything after all! @w2 The ships very late and my Transmitters all fouled up and I can't call out of the system for resupply!

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 谢谢你问起{PlayerName}！很高兴看到有人关心我们研究员！

 @w2 嗯，你可能猜到了，我和那边那个沉闷的同伴在监测黑洞，特别是哪些东西正在被它吸入。

 @p9 我完全理解人们不想来这里——我本来也不想；@w2 但报酬还不错——但我的确要求他们送来常规补给：@w2 我们这里根本没有空间种任何东西！@w2 飞船晚到了，我的发射器全都坏了，无法呼叫星系外进行补给！

English:
@q0  That will have to do then. 
 @w2 I'll take anything you can spare at up to <color=#f8de5d>triple market rate</color>. @w2 Go talk to D.E.N.T. You can see what we're offering at least. @w2 If you can spare anything at all, he'll pay you and store whatever you can manage.
 @p9
<color=#f8de5d>If you do discover you have any of my favourite foods in your stores come right back here with them, never mind DENT! </color>@w4

Now, let me tell you about this Rock I found! @w3 It's like nothing I've ever seen!

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 那就这样吧。
 @w2 我会以最高<color=#f8de5d>市价三倍</color>的价格收购你能省下的任何东西。@w2 去找D.E.N.T.，至少你能看到我们提供的价目。@w2 如果你能省下任何东西，他会付钱并储存你能弄到的所有物品。
 @p9
<color=#f8de5d>如果你发现你的库存里有我喜欢的食物，直接带回来找我，别管D.E.N.T.! </color>@w4

现在，让我告诉你我发现的一块岩石！@w3 它和我见过的任何东西都不一样！

English:
@q0 Well I have contact's that will help move and mine the stuff. @w2 But they aint going to bite without Proof. @w2 I mean nobodies seen this stuff in years, not anyplace in the galaxy!

Here's my offer: {PlayerName} @w2 I have an Epic quality Drill. If that can't cut it then well were all outta luck. @w2 The Asteroids moving slowly but by this time next year it'll be in deep in the grip of the Back hole and gone!
 @p9 
 @w2 If you will go get 50 ore for me. @w2 I'll  let you keep the drill, give you rights to haul as much of that stuff away as you can, and... 10,000,000 credits when you get word to my friends out there!

 @w2 All that, If you agree to get the samples I'll need for some investors, @w2  and keep your mouth shut about the whole thing!

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 嗯，我有一些联系人能帮忙搬运和开采这东西。@w2 但没有证据他们是不会行动的。@w2 我的意思是，好几年没人见过这东西了，整个星系都没有！

我的提议是：{PlayerName}@w2 我有一个史诗品质的钻头。如果连它都切不开，那我们就都倒霉了。@w2 那颗小行星正在缓慢移动，但明年这个时候它就会被黑洞深深抓住，消失不见！
 @p9 
 @w2 如果你去帮我弄50块矿石。@w2 我让你保留钻头，给你权利尽可能多地拖走那些东西，并且……当你把消息传给我外面的朋友时，给你1000万信用点！

 @w2 所有这些，只要你同意为一些投资者获取我需要的样本，@w2 并且对整件事保密！

English:
@q0 The Drills old but works like nothing else I've ever seen. @w2 Had it for years but no idea if its up to this.

 @w2 If you got nothing after burning a full charge on the rock: get back to me. @w2 We'll have to think of something else.
 @p9 
 @w2 <color=#f8de5d>But if you get even a little bit of ore?</color> @w2 <color=#f8de5d>Keep going no matter how long it takes!</color> @w2 I recon 5 samples of ten Ore a piece will get us the investment I have in mind.

 @w2 Get any more than that: Keep it as your first down payment!

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 这钻头旧了，但效果比我见过的任何东西都好。 @w2 用了好多年了，但不知道它能不能胜任这个任务。

 @w2 如果你在岩石上耗完一整块能量包后一无所获，就回来找我。 @w2 我们得另想办法。
 @p9 
 @w2 <color=#f8de5d>但如果你哪怕只得到一丁点矿石呢？</color> @w2 <color=#f8de5d>不管花多久，继续挖下去！</color> @w2 我估计每份十块矿石的五份样本就能为我们带来我设想中的投资。

 @w2 如果得到更多，就留着作为你的首付吧！

English:
@q0 Well I am glad you asked Dar.. Commander {Playername}

 @w2 The material's like nothing in my data base, but I can see how it could be alloyed into Hull plating more resilient than anything the UES ever dreamed of. @w2 That will be useful for us no doubt!

 @p9
 @w2 He told the truth I quietly checked his figures. @w2 The whole mass will be in the danger zone of the black hole in about a solar year so there isn't much time to mine such a concentration of very, very hard metal.

 @w2 He's underpaying you sure but I don't think he had much more in his private accounts. @w2 So on balance he's a good risk.

 @p9
 @w2 I'd send the messages then get back there with a bunch of drill equipment and dig as much as possible as fast as possible before anyone can say no! @w2 That's fair by his offer, we get in grab what we can and get out. @w2 After all there might be other asteroids of the stuff around for his partners to spend time looking for. @w2 I'll keep a sensor out for them in any other Black Hole systems we come across from now on!

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 嗯，很高兴你问了，达……指挥官。{Playername}

@w2 这种材料在我的数据库里完全找不到类似物，但我知道它可以被合金化，制成比UES梦想中的任何船体装甲都更具韧性的外壳。@w2 那对我们无疑会很有用！

@p9
@w2 他说的是实话，我悄悄核实过他的数据。@w2 整个质量群大约在一个太阳年后就会进入黑洞的危险区域，所以没有太多时间开采这么高浓度的非常坚硬的金属。

@w2 他给你的报酬确实低了点，但我认为他的私人账户里也没多富裕。@w2 所以总的来说，他算是个可靠的风险对象。

@p9
@w2 我会先发送消息，然后带着一堆钻头设备赶回去，在任何人说不行之前尽可能快地挖出尽量多的东西！@w2 这公平合理，按他的报价，我们进去捞一把就撤。@w2 毕竟可能还有其他小行星含有这种材料，供他的伙伴们慢慢寻找。@w2 从现在开始，在我们经过的其他黑洞星系里，我会保持传感器留意它们！

English:
@p9
<color=#0bf93b>Fortunately my little mud wrestle with that sleaze bag turned up some interesting bits of information! </color>@w3

<color=#0bf93b>There are some manual overrides to the Security Robot protocols, </color>@w2 <color=#0bf93b>they are in four semi hidden locations: </color>@w1 <color=#0bf93b>a couple of security stations and a couple of hidden 'closets' here and their. </color>@w2 <color=#0bf93b>You might have stumbled across some of them already but without that Key ...</color>

@p9
<color=#0bf93b>You still have it right? </color>@w2<color=#0bf93b> You didn't loose the Security Key we found..? </color>@w2
<color=#0bf93b>Assuming your not that dumb, the overrides can now be taken offline! </color>@w2

<color=#0bf93b>Also I got some info on some supply caches here and there. </color>@w2 <color=#0bf93b>Looks like a few of the original crew survived the mad blast he let loose and held out for a while.</color>
<color=#0bf93b></color>
@p9
<color=#0bf93b>Here's some of their supplies. </color>@w2 <color=#0bf93b>Take this commander it's old but should be just the thing for Robot bashing!</color>

Chinese (simplified):
@p9
<color=#0bf93b>幸运的是，我和那个无赖电脑的较量挖出了一些有趣的信息！</color>@w3

<color=#0bf93b>安全机器人协议有一些手动覆盖开关，</color>@w2 <color=#0bf93b>它们位于四个半隐藏的位置：</color>@w1 <color=#0bf93b>几个安全站和几个隐藏的'壁橱'，散布在各处。</color>@w2 <color=#0bf93b>你可能已经偶然发现了一些，但没有那把钥匙……</color>

@p9
<color=#0bf93b>你还有那把钥匙，对吧？</color>@w2<color=#0bf93b>你没弄丢我们找到的安全钥匙吧？</color>@w2
<color=#0bf93b>假设你没那么蠢，现在可以把覆盖开关离线了！</color>@w2

<color=#0bf93b>另外，我还得到了一些关于各处补给箱的信息。</color>@w2 <color=#0bf93b>看起来有几个原始船员在疯狂爆炸中幸存下来，并坚持了一段时间。</color>
<color=#0bf93b></color>
@p9
<color=#0bf93b>这里有一些他们的补给。</color>@w2 <color=#0bf93b>拿着，指挥官，这个虽然旧，但用来砸机器人正合适！</color>

English:
@q0 <color=#c73bc9>Welcome to the Story chapter of this start area.
This is a very hard location!</color>

 @p9 <color=#c73bc9>The story is designed to cover at least the first three ranks of your specialty missions which are tied to this POI do not leave its vicinity till you have attained rank three in your initial speciality. To escape you will need to disable the plasma cannons or you will be shot as you try and leave.</color>

 @p9 <color=#c73bc9>After that you may complete the story for special and unique rewards or venture into space at your discretion.</color>

 @p9 <color=#c73bc9>Can you conquer the mysteries of:</color>
<color=#f9ae0b>The Ancient Giant</color>

Chinese (simplified):
@q0 <color=#c73bc9>欢迎来到本起始区域的故事章节。
这是一个非常危险的地点！</color>

 @p9 <color=#c73bc9>故事设计涵盖至少你的专长任务的前三个等级，这些任务与这个兴趣点相关联。在你达到初始专长三级之前，不要离开其周边区域。要逃脱，你需要禁用等离子炮，否则在你尝试离开时会被击毁。</color>

 @p9 <color=#c73bc9>之后，你可以完成故事以获得特殊独特奖励，或自行决定进入太空。</color>

 @p9 <color=#c73bc9>你能征服以下谜团吗：</color>
<tag n="12">古代巨人</tag n="12"></color>

